#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo Invoicing is a standalone app designed to create invoices, send them to "
"customers, and manage payments. It also handles flows involving vendor "
"bills. On the other hand, the Accounting app is a comprehensive accounting "
"solution that allows the same actions and includes additional features such "
"as standard financial reports, bank reconciliation, budgets, asset "
"management, and more."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Invoicing — hisob-fakturalar yaratish, ularni mijozlarga yuborish va "
"to'lovlarni boshqarish uchun mo'ljallangan mustaqil ilova. U yetkazib "
"beruvchi hisoblari bilan bog'liq jarayonlarni ham qamrab oladi. Boshqa "
"tomondan, Accounting ilovasi xuddi shu amallarni bajarish imkonini beruvchi "
"hamda standart moliyaviy hisobotlar, bank solishtirmasi (rekonsiliatsiya), "
"byudjetlar, aktivlarni boshqarish va boshqa qo'shimcha funksiyalarni o'z "
"ichiga olgan keng qamrovli buxgalteriya yechimidir."

