#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:56
msgid "Double-entry bookkeeping"
msgstr "Ikki yoqlama yozuv usuli"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:58
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically creates all the underlying journal entries for all "
"accounting transactions (e.g., customer invoices, vendor bills, point-of-"
"sales orders, expenses, inventory valuations, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Odoo barcha buxgalteriya operatsiyalari (masalan, mijoz hisob-fakturalari, "
"yetkazib beruvchi hisoblari, savdo nuqtasi buyurtmalari, xarajatlar, zaxira "
"baholashlari va h.k.) uchun barcha tegishli jurnal yozuvlarini avtomatik "
"ravishda yaratadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:61
msgid ""
"Odoo uses the double-entry bookkeeping system, whereby every entry needs a "
"corresponding and opposite counterpart in a different account, with one "
"account debited and the other credited. It ensures that all transactions are "
"recorded accurately and consistently and that the accounts always balance."
msgstr ""
"Odoo ikki yoqlama yozuv tizimidan foydalanadi, ya'ni har bir yozuv boshqa "
"hisobda mos va qarama-qarshi juftlikka ega bo'lishi kerak: bir hisob "
"debetlanadi, ikkinchisi kreditlanadi. Bu barcha operatsiyalar aniq va izchil "
"qayd etilishini hamda hisoblar doimo balansda bo'lishini ta'minlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:67
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:296
msgid ":doc:`Accounting Cheat Sheet <accounting/get_started/cheat_sheet>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Buxgalteriya bo'yicha qisqacha qo'llanma <accounting/get_started/"
"cheat_sheet>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:72
msgid "Accrual and cash basis"
msgstr "Hisoblash va kassa usuli"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:74
msgid ""
"Both accrual and cash basis accounting are supported in Odoo. This allows "
"reporting income and expense either when the transaction occurs (accrual "
"basis) or when the payment is made or received (cash basis)."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'da hisoblash usuli va kassa usuli bo'yicha buxgalteriya hisobining har "
"ikkalasi ham qo'llab-quvvatlanadi. Bu daromad va xarajatlarni operatsiya "
"sodir bo'lganda (hisoblash usuli) yoki to'lov amalga oshirilganda yoxud "
"qabul qilinganda (kassa usuli) hisobotga kiritish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:79
msgid ":doc:`Cash basis <accounting/taxes/cash_basis>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Kassa usuli <accounting/taxes/cash_basis>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:84
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/kenya.rst:143
msgid "Multi-company"
msgstr "Ko'p kompaniya"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:86
msgid ""
":doc:`Multiple companies <../general/companies/multi_company>` can be "
"managed within the same database. Each company has its own :doc:`chart of "
"accounts <accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts>`, but :ref:`accounts can "
"be shared <consolidation_account_mapping>`, which is useful when viewing "
"consolidation reports. Users can view records and reports from multiple "
"companies simultaneously but can only work on a single company's accounting "
"at a time."
msgstr ""
"Bitta ma'lumotlar bazasi ichida :doc:`bir nechta kompaniyani <../general/"
"companies/multi_company>` boshqarish mumkin. Har bir kompaniya "
"o'zining :doc:`hisoblar rejasiga <accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts>` "
"ega, ammo :ref:`hisoblar umumiy bo'lishi mumkin "
"<consolidation_account_mapping>`, bu konsolidatsiya hisobotlarini ko'rishda "
"foydalidir. Foydalanuvchilar bir vaqtning o'zida bir nechta kompaniyaning "
"yozuvlari va hisobotlarini ko'rishlari mumkin, lekin bir vaqtda faqat bitta "
"kompaniyaning buxgalteriyasi ustida ishlashlari mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:94
msgid ":doc:`Multi-company </applications/general/companies/multi_company>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Ko'p kompaniya </applications/general/companies/multi_company>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:95
msgid ""
":ref:`Inter-company transactions <general/multi-company/inter-company-"
"transactions>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Kompaniyalararo operatsiyalar <general/multi-company/inter-company-"
"transactions>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:100
msgid "Multi-currency environment"
msgstr "Ko'p valyutali muhit"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:102
msgid ""
"A :doc:`multi-currency <accounting/get_started/multi_currency>` environment "
"with an automated exchange rate to ease international transactions is "
"available in Odoo. Every transaction is recorded in the company's default "
"currency; for transactions occurring in another currency, Odoo stores both "
"the value in the company's currency and the transactions' currency value. "
"Odoo generates currency gains and losses after reconciling the journal items."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'da xalqaro operatsiyalarni osonlashtirish uchun avtomatlashtirilgan "
"valyuta kursiga ega :doc:`ko'p valyuta <accounting/get_started/"
"multi_currency>` muhiti mavjud. Har bir operatsiya kompaniyaning standart "
"valyutasida qayd etiladi; boshqa valyutada amalga oshirilgan operatsiyalar "
"uchun Odoo qiymatni ham kompaniya valyutasida, ham operatsiya valyutasida "
"saqlaydi. Odoo jurnal moddalari solishtirilgandan (rekonsiliatsiyadan) so'ng "
"valyuta kursidagi foyda va zararlarni yaratadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:109
msgid ""
":doc:`Manage a bank in a foreign currency <accounting/bank/foreign_currency>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Xorijiy valyutadagi bankni boshqarish <accounting/bank/"
"foreign_currency>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:114
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/egypt.rst:130
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:174
msgid "Branches"
msgstr "Filiallar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:116
msgid ""
"Parent :doc:`companies </applications/general/companies>` and "
"their :ref:`branches <general/companies/branches>` can be managed within a "
"single database, operating under shared accounting and reporting rules, "
"including the following:"
msgstr ""
"Bosh :doc:`kompaniyalar </applications/general/companies>` va "
"ularning :ref:`filiallarini <general/companies/branches>` bitta ma'lumotlar "
"bazasi ichida, umumiy buxgalteriya va hisobot qoidalari asosida boshqarish "
"mumkin, jumladan quyidagilar:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:120
msgid ""
"The parent company’s :doc:`chart of accounts <accounting/get_started/"
"chart_of_accounts>`, :doc:`main currency <accounting/get_started/"
"multi_currency>`, and :doc:`taxes <accounting/taxes>` apply to all branches."
msgstr ""
"Bosh kompaniyaning :doc:`hisoblar rejasi <accounting/get_started/"
"chart_of_accounts>`, :doc:`asosiy valyutasi <accounting/get_started/"
"multi_currency>` va :doc:`soliqlari <accounting/taxes>` barcha filiallarga "
"qo'llaniladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:123
msgid "Branches can manage their own dedicated journals and related records."
msgstr ""
"Filiallar o'zlarining maxsus jurnallari va ular bilan bog'liq yozuvlarini "
"boshqarishlari mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:124
msgid ""
"The parent company manages a common :ref:`fiscal period <accounting/year-end/"
"fiscal-years>`, so its :ref:`lock and closing dates <accounting/year-end/"
"lock-everything-date>` apply across all branches. However, branches may set "
"earlier lock dates if needed."
msgstr ""
"Bosh kompaniya umumiy :ref:`moliya davrini <accounting/year-end/fiscal-"
"years>` boshqaradi, shuning uchun uning :ref:`qulflash va yopish sanalari "
"<accounting/year-end/lock-everything-date>` barcha filiallarga qo'llaniladi. "
"Biroq, zarur bo'lsa, filiallar ertaroq qulflash sanalarini belgilashlari "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:127
msgid ""
"The parent company can access all :doc:`reports <accounting/"
"reporting>`, :doc:`invoices <accounting/customer_invoices>`, :doc:`bills "
"<accounting/vendor_bills>`, etc., from its branches, while each branch can "
"only view its own data."
msgstr ""
"Bosh kompaniya o'z filiallarining barcha :doc:`hisobotlariga <accounting/"
"reporting>`, :doc:`hisob-fakturalariga <accounting/"
"customer_invoices>`, :doc:`hisoblariga <accounting/vendor_bills>` va "
"boshqalarga kirishi mumkin, har bir filial esa faqat o'z ma'lumotlarini "
"ko'ra oladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:132
msgid ""
"The :doc:`Fiscal localization <fiscal_localizations>` package is set on the "
"parent company."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Soliq lokalizatsiyasi <fiscal_localizations>` paketi bosh kompaniyada "
"o'rnatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:135
msgid ""
"Adding a branch to a company enables :doc:`multi-company functions <../"
"general/companies/multi_company>`."
msgstr ""
"Kompaniyaga filial qo'shish :doc:`ko'p kompaniya funksiyalarini <../general/"
"companies/multi_company>` yoqadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:138
msgid ""
"For more information, refer to `Odoo's pricing page <https://www.odoo.com/"
"pricing-plan>`_ or contact your Odoo account manager."
msgstr ""
"Qo'shimcha ma'lumot uchun `Odoo narxlar sahifasiga <https://www.odoo.com/"
"pricing-plan>`_ murojaat qiling yoki Odoo akkaunt-menejeringiz bilan "
"bog'laning."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:146
msgid ""
"The parent company consolidates accounting operations from all branches, "
"providing a centralized view of :doc:`financial reports <accounting/"
"reporting>`, such as profit and loss or balance sheets."
msgstr ""
"Bosh kompaniya barcha filiallarning buxgalteriya operatsiyalarini "
"konsolidatsiya qiladi va foyda va zarar yoki balans kabi :doc:`moliyaviy "
"hisobotlarning <accounting/reporting>` markazlashgan ko'rinishini "
"ta'minlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:152
msgid "VAT"
msgstr "QQS"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:154
msgid ""
"Each company and branch must be configured with its own legal information, "
"including a VAT number when applicable. Depending on the structure, branches "
"may share the parent company's VAT number or have their own, resulting in a "
"common or separate :doc:`VAT return <accounting/reporting/tax_returns>`."
msgstr ""
"Har bir kompaniya va filial o'zining yuridik ma'lumotlari, jumladan, "
"tegishli hollarda QQS raqami bilan sozlanishi kerak. Tuzilmaga qarab, "
"filiallar bosh kompaniyaning QQS raqamidan foydalanishlari yoki o'zlarining "
"raqamiga ega bo'lishlari mumkin, bu esa umumiy yoki alohida :doc:`QQS "
"deklaratsiyasiga <accounting/reporting/tax_returns>` olib keladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:159
msgid ""
"This flexible setup allows users to generate individual reports and tax "
"returns for each entity if needed."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu moslashuvchan sozlama foydalanuvchilarga zarur bo'lganda har bir "
"tashkilot uchun alohida hisobotlar va soliq deklaratsiyalarini yaratish "
"imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:165
msgid "International standards"
msgstr "Xalqaro standartlar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:167
msgid ""
"Odoo Accounting supports over 100 countries and provides standardized "
"features and mechanisms applicable across all regions. Country-specific "
"modules are included to comply with local accounting "
"regulations. :doc:`Fiscal localizations <fiscal_localizations>` handle "
"regional requirements, such as charts of accounts, taxes, or any other legal "
"obligations."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Accounting 100 dan ortiq mamlakatni qo'llab-quvvatlaydi hamda barcha "
"hududlarda qo'llanadigan standartlashtirilgan funksiyalar va mexanizmlarni "
"taqdim etadi. Mahalliy buxgalteriya qoidalariga rioya qilish uchun "
"mamlakatga xos modullar kiritilgan. :doc:`Soliq lokalizatsiyalari "
"<fiscal_localizations>` hisoblar rejasi, soliqlar yoki boshqa har qanday "
"qonuniy majburiyatlar kabi hududiy talablarni qamrab oladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:175
msgid "Accounts receivable and payable"
msgstr "Debitorlik va kreditorlik hisoblari"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:177
msgid ""
"By default, one account is designated for accounts receivable entries and "
"another for accounts payable entries. As transactions are linked to "
"**contacts**, it is possible to run a report per customer, vendor, or "
"supplier."
msgstr ""
"Standart holatda bitta hisob debitorlik yozuvlari uchun, boshqasi esa "
"kreditorlik yozuvlari uchun belgilanadi. Operatsiyalar **kontaktlar** bilan "
"bog'langanligi sababli, har bir mijoz, yetkazib beruvchi yoki ta'minotchi "
"bo'yicha hisobot yuritish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:181
msgid ""
"The **Partner Ledger** report displays the balance of customers and "
"suppliers. To access it, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> "
"Partner Ledger`."
msgstr ""
"**Partner Ledger** hisoboti mijozlar va ta'minotchilarning balansini "
"ko'rsatadi. Unga kirish uchun :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> "
"Partner Ledger` yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting.rst:189
msgid ""
"The following financial :doc:`reports <accounting/reporting>` are available "
"and updated in real-time:"
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi moliyaviy :doc:`hisobotlar <accounting/reporting>` mavjud bo'lib, "
"real vaqt rejimida yangilanadi:"

