#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:126
msgid ""
"`Basiq <https://www.basiq.io/home.html>`_ (supported in `Australia <https://"
"www.basiq.io/resources/supported-insitutions.html>`_)"
msgstr ""
"`Basiq <https://www.basiq.io/home.html>`_ (`Avstraliyada <https://"
"www.basiq.io/resources/supported-insitutions.html>`_ qo'llab-quvvatlanadi)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:130
msgid ""
"When :ref:`connecting a bank to Odoo <accounting/bank-synchronization/first-"
"synchronization>`:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Bankni Odoo'ga ulashda <accounting/bank-synchronization/first-"
"synchronization>`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:132
msgid ""
"Depending on your bank and country, change the default third-party provider "
"when selecting the bank, if necessary."
msgstr ""
"Bankingiz va mamlakatingizga qarab, zarur bo'lsa, bankni tanlashda standart "
"uchinchi tomon provayderini o'zgartiring."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:134
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/ponto.rst:66
msgid ""
"Make sure to check the consent checkbox to allow information to be shared "
"with Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlarning Odoo bilan ulashilishiga ruxsat berish uchun rozilik "
"katagini belgilashni unutmang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:135
