#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:24
msgid "Basiq account creation"
msgstr "Basiq hisobini yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:26
msgid ""
"To create a Basiq account, go to the `Basiq website <https://"
"dashboard.basiq.io/register>`_ and follow the registration instructions."
msgstr ""
"Basiq hisobini yaratish uchun `Basiq veb-saytiga <https://dashboard.basiq.io/"
"register>`_ o'ting va ro'yxatdan o'tish ko'rsatmalariga amal qiling."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:32
msgid "Business banking data sharing"
msgstr "Biznes bank ma'lumotlarini ulashish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:34
msgid ""
"Under Australia's Consumer Data Right (CDR) regime, sharing business banking "
"data requires an explicit **opt-in**. Consequently, setting up a business "
"account with Basiq may require additional configuration steps compared to a "
"standard personal account. For detailed setup instructions, refer to Basiq's "
"`online documentation <https://api.basiq.io/docs/connecting-business-"
"accounts-via-cdr>`_."
msgstr ""
"Avstraliyaning Iste'molchi ma'lumotlari huquqi (CDR) rejimiga ko'ra, biznes "
"bank ma'lumotlarini ulashish aniq **rozilik berish**ni talab qiladi. Shu "
"sababli, Basiq'da biznes hisobini sozlash oddiy shaxsiy hisobga nisbatan "
"qo'shimcha sozlash bosqichlarini talab qilishi mumkin. Batafsil sozlash "
"ko'rsatmalari uchun Basiq'ning `onlayn hujjatlariga <https://api.basiq.io/"
"docs/connecting-business-accounts-via-cdr>`_ murojaat qiling."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:40
msgid ""
"To see how Odoo manages your financial data and how to access, update, or "
"delete it, read the `Odoo finance privacy policy page <https://"
"production.odoofin.com/privacy#basiq>`_."
msgstr ""
"Odoo moliyaviy ma'lumotlaringizni qanday boshqarishini hamda ularga qanday "
"kirish, ularni yangilash yoki o'chirish mumkinligini bilish uchun `Odoo "
"moliya maxfiylik siyosati sahifasini <https://production.odoofin.com/"
"privacy#basiq>`_ o'qing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:44
msgid "`CDR compliance <https://api.basiq.io/docs/cdr-compliance>`_"
msgstr "`CDR muvofiqligi <https://api.basiq.io/docs/cdr-compliance>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:49
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/ponto.rst:53
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:574
msgid "Connection with Odoo"
msgstr "Odoo bilan ulanish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:51
msgid ""
"When :ref:`connecting a bank to Odoo <accounting/bank-synchronization/first-"
"synchronization>` using Basiq as the third-party provider, follow these "
"steps:"
msgstr ""
"Basiq'dan uchinchi tomon provayderi sifatida foydalanib :ref:`bankni Odoo'ga "
"ulashda <accounting/bank-synchronization/first-synchronization>` quyidagi "
"bosqichlarga amal qiling:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:54
msgid ""
"When connecting to the desired bank, make sure Basiq is selected as the "
"third-party :guilabel:`Provider`."
msgstr ""
"Kerakli bankka ulanishda uchinchi tomon :guilabel:`Provider` sifatida Basiq "
"tanlanganligiga ishonch hosil qiling."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:56
msgid "Select the :guilabel:`Type of account` and click :guilabel:`Connect`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Type of account` ni tanlang va :guilabel:`Connect` tugmasini "
"bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:57
msgid ""
"Fill out the additional information when prompted, and :guilabel:`Continue`."
msgstr ""
"So'ralganda qo'shimcha ma'lumotlarni to'ldiring va :guilabel:`Continue` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:58
msgid ""
"Agree to share data by declaring that you are using this service for "
"business purposes, and then :guilabel:`Approve`."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu xizmatdan biznes maqsadlarida foydalanayotganingizni bildirib, "
"ma'lumotlarni ulashishga rozilik bering, so'ngra :guilabel:`Approve` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:60
msgid ""
"In the pop-up window, log in to Basiq using your **Basiq credentials**. Upon "
"a successful connection, you will be redirected to the Odoo "
"Accounting :guilabel:`Dashboard`."
msgstr ""
"Qalqib chiquvchi oynada **Basiq hisob ma'lumotlaringiz** yordamida Basiq'ga "
"kiring. Ulanish muvaffaqiyatli amalga oshgach, siz Odoo "
"Accounting :guilabel:`Dashboard` sahifasiga yo'naltirilasiz."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:62
msgid ""
"Select the specific bank account to connect to, and click :guilabel:`Connect "
"Bank`."
msgstr ""
"Ulanish uchun aniq bank hisobini tanlang va :guilabel:`Connect Bank` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:63
msgid ""
"Access your **Bank Reconciliation** dashboard by clicking your **Bank** "
"journal to verify if the synchronization was successful."
msgstr ""
"Sinxronizatsiya muvaffaqiyatli o'tganini tekshirish uchun **Bank** "
"jurnalingizni bosib, **Bank solishtirmasi (rekonsiliatsiya)** boshqaruv "
"paneliga kiring."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization/basiq.rst:67
msgid ""
"Repeat the process for all banking institutions and accounts that need to be "
"synchronized with your database."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazangiz bilan sinxronlanishi kerak bo'lgan barcha bank "
"muassasalari va hisoblar uchun jarayonni takrorlang."

