msgid ""
"From draft invoice to profit and loss report, the process involves several "
"steps once the goods (or services) have been ordered/shipped (or rendered) "
"to a customer, depending on the invoicing policy:"
msgstr ""
"Qoralama hisob-fakturadan foyda va zarar hisobotigacha bo'lgan jarayon, "
"tovarlar (yoki xizmatlar) mijozga buyurtma qilingan/jo'natilgan (yoki "
"ko'rsatilgan) bo'lgach, hisob-faktura yozish siyosatiga qarab bir necha "
"bosqichni o'z ichiga oladi:"

