#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:28
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:373
msgid "Invoice creation"
msgstr "Hisob-faktura yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:30
msgid ""
"Draft invoices can be created directly from documents like sales orders or "
"purchase orders or manually from the :guilabel:`Customer Invoices` journal "
"in the :guilabel:`Accounting Dashboard`."
msgstr ""
"Qoralama hisob-fakturalarni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri savdo buyurtmalari yoki xarid "
"buyurtmalari kabi hujjatlardan yoki :guilabel:`Accounting Dashboard` "
"dagi :guilabel:`Customer Invoices` jurnalidan qo'lda yaratish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:33
msgid ""
"An invoice must include the required information to enable the customer to "
"pay promptly for their goods and services. Make sure the following fields "
"are appropriately completed:"
msgstr ""
"Hisob-faktura mijoz o'z tovarlari va xizmatlari uchun o'z vaqtida to'lov "
"qilishi uchun zarur ma'lumotlarni o'z ichiga olishi kerak. Quyidagi "
"maydonlar to'g'ri to'ldirilganligiga ishonch hosil qiling:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:36
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Customer`: When a customer is selected, Odoo automatically pulls "
"information from the customer record like the invoice "
"address, :doc:`preferred payment terms <customer_invoices/"
"payment_terms>`, :doc:`fiscal positions <taxes/fiscal_positions>`, "
"receivable account, and more onto the invoice. To change these values for "
"this specific invoice, edit them directly on the invoice. To change them for "
"future invoices, change the values on the contact record."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Customer`: Mijoz tanlanganda, Odoo mijoz yozuvidan hisob-faktura "
"manzili, :doc:`afzal ko'rilgan to'lov shartlari <customer_invoices/"
"payment_terms>`, :doc:`soliq pozitsiyalari <taxes/fiscal_positions>`, "
"debitorlik hisobi va boshqa ma'lumotlarni avtomatik ravishda hisob-fakturaga "
"olib keladi. Ushbu qiymatlarni aynan shu hisob-faktura uchun o'zgartirish "
"uchun ularni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri hisob-fakturada tahrirlang. Kelajakdagi "
"hisob-fakturalar uchun o'zgartirish uchun esa qiymatlarni kontakt yozuvida "
"o'zgartiring."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:42
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Invoice Date`: If not set manually, this field is automatically "
"set as the current date upon confirmation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Invoice Date`: Agar qo'lda o'rnatilmagan bo'lsa, bu maydon "
"tasdiqlash paytida avtomatik ravishda joriy sana sifatida o'rnatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:44
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Due Date` or :doc:`payment terms <customer_invoices/"
"payment_terms>`: To specify when the customer has to pay the invoice."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Due Date` yoki :doc:`to'lov shartlari <customer_invoices/"
"payment_terms>`: Mijoz hisob-fakturani qachon to'lashi kerakligini belgilash "
"uchun."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:46
msgid ":guilabel:`Journal`: Automatically set and can be changed if needed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Journal`: Avtomatik ravishda o'rnatiladi va zarurat bo'lsa "
"o'zgartirilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:47
msgid ""
":doc:`Currency <get_started/multi_currency>`. If the invoice's currency "
"differs from the company's currency, the currency exchange rate is "
"automatically displayed."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Valyuta <get_started/multi_currency>`. Agar hisob-fakturaning "
"valyutasi kompaniya valyutasidan farq qilsa, valyuta kursi avtomatik "
"ravishda ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:50
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:93
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Invoice Lines` tab:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Invoice Lines` varag'ida:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:52
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product`: Click :guilabel:`Add a line`, then search for and "
"select the product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Product`: :guilabel:`Add a line` tugmasini bosing, so'ngra "
"mahsulotni qidirib toping va tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:53
msgid ":guilabel:`Quantity`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Quantity`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:54
msgid ":guilabel:`Price`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Price`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:55
msgid ":doc:`Taxes <taxes>` (if applicable)"
msgstr ":doc:`Soliqlar <taxes>` (agar qo'llanilsa)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:57
msgid ""
"To access the product catalog and view all items in an organized display, "
"click :doc:`Catalog </applications/essentials/product_catalog>`. When the "
"products and quantities are selected, click :guilabel:`Back to Invoice` to "
"return to the invoice; the selected catalog items will appear in the invoice "
"lines."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulot katalogiga kirish va barcha elementlarni tartibli ko'rinishda "
"ko'rish uchun :doc:`Katalog </applications/essentials/product_catalog>` ni "
"bosing. Mahsulotlar va miqdorlar tanlangach, hisob-fakturaga qaytish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Back to Invoice` tugmasini bosing; tanlangan katalog "
"elementlari hisob-faktura qatorlarida paydo bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:63
msgid ""
"To display the total amount of the invoice in words, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` and activate "
"the :guilabel:`Total amount of invoice in letters` option."
msgstr ""
"Hisob-fakturaning umumiy summasini so'zlar bilan ko'rsatish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` yo'lidan "
"o'ting va :guilabel:`Total amount of invoice in letters` opsiyasini "
"faollashtiring."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:67
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Journal Items` tab displays the accounting entries created. "
"Additional invoice information such as the :guilabel:`Customer "
"Reference`, :guilabel:`Payment Reference`, :doc:`Fiscal Positions <taxes/"
"fiscal_positions>`, :doc:`Incoterms <customer_invoices/incoterms>`, and more "
"can be added or modified in the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Journal Items` varag'i yaratilgan buxgalteriya yozuvlarini "
"ko'rsatadi. :guilabel:`Customer Reference`, :guilabel:`Payment "
"Reference`, :doc:`Soliq pozitsiyalari <taxes/"
"fiscal_positions>`, :doc:`Incoterms <customer_invoices/incoterms>` kabi "
"qo'shimcha hisob-faktura ma'lumotlarini va boshqalarni :guilabel:`Other "
"Info` varag'ida qo'shish yoki o'zgartirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:73
msgid ""
"Odoo initially creates invoices in :guilabel:`Draft` status. Draft invoices "
"have no accounting impact until they are :ref:`confirmed <accounting/invoice/"
"confirmation>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo hisob-fakturalarni dastlab :guilabel:`Draft` holatida yaratadi. "
"Qoralama hisob-fakturalar :ref:`tasdiqlanmaguncha <accounting/invoice/"
"confirmation>` buxgalteriya hisobiga ta'sir qilmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:77
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/overview.rst:47
msgid ":doc:`/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:82
msgid "Invoice confirmation"
msgstr "Hisob-fakturani tasdiqlash"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:84
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Confirm` when the invoice is completed. The invoice's "
"status changes to :guilabel:`Posted`, and a journal entry is generated based "
"on the invoice configuration. On confirmation, Odoo assigns each invoice a "
"unique number from a defined :doc:`sequence <customer_invoices/sequence>`."
msgstr ""
"Hisob-faktura to'ldirilgach, :guilabel:`Confirm` tugmasini bosing. Hisob-"
"fakturaning holati :guilabel:`Posted` ga o'zgaradi va hisob-faktura "
"konfiguratsiyasi asosida jurnal yozuvi yaratiladi. Tasdiqlashda Odoo har bir "
"hisob-fakturaga belgilangan :doc:`ketma-ketlik <customer_invoices/sequence>` "
"asosida noyob raqam beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:90
msgid ""
"Once confirmed, an invoice can no longer be updated. Click :guilabel:`Reset "
"to draft` if changes are needed."
msgstr ""
"Tasdiqlangandan so'ng hisob-fakturani endi o'zgartirib bo'lmaydi. "
"O'zgartirishlar kerak bo'lsa, :guilabel:`Reset to draft` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:92
msgid ""
"If required, invoices and other journal entries can be locked once posted "
"using the :ref:`Secure posted entries with hash <data-inalterability/"
"restricted>` feature."
msgstr ""
"Zarur bo'lsa, hisob-fakturalar va boshqa jurnal yozuvlarini o'tkazilgandan "
"so'ng :ref:`Secure posted entries with hash <data-inalterability/"
"restricted>` funksiyasi yordamida qulflash mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:98
msgid "Invoice sending"
msgstr "Hisob-fakturani yuborish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:100
msgid ""
"To set a preferred :guilabel:`Invoice sending` method for a customer, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Customers` and select the "
"customer. In the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab of the contact form, select the "
"preferred :guilabel:`Invoice sending` method in the :guilabel:`Customer "
"Invoices` section."
msgstr ""
"Mijoz uchun afzal ko'rilgan :guilabel:`Invoice sending` usulini belgilash "
"uchun :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Customers` yo'lidan "
"o'ting va mijozni tanlang. Kontakt formasining :guilabel:`Accounting` "
"varag'ida, :guilabel:`Customer Invoices` bo'limida afzal "
"ko'rilgan :guilabel:`Invoice sending` usulini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:106
msgid ""
"Sending letters in Odoo requires :doc:`In-App Purchase (IAP) <../../"
"essentials/in_app_purchase>` credit or tokens."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'da xatlar yuborish uchun :doc:`In-App Purchase (IAP) <../../essentials/"
"in_app_purchase>` krediti yoki tokenlari talab qilinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:109
msgid ""
"To send the invoice to the customer, navigate back to the invoice record and "
"follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Hisob-fakturani mijozga yuborish uchun hisob-faktura yozuviga qaytib, "
"quyidagi qadamlarni bajaring:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:111
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:439
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary.rst:163
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/jordan.rst:180
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:130
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:321
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:364
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Send`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Send` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:112
msgid ""
"If the :ref:`default invoice layout <studio/pdf-reports/default-layout>` has "
"not been customized yet, a :guilabel:`Configure your document layout` pop-up "
"window appears. Configure the layout and click :guilabel:`Continue`."
msgstr ""
"Agar :ref:`standart hisob-faktura maketi <studio/pdf-reports/default-"
"layout>` hali moslashtirilmagan bo'lsa, :guilabel:`Configure your document "
"layout` qalqib chiquvchi oynasi paydo bo'ladi. Maketni sozlang "
"va :guilabel:`Continue` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:117
msgid "The document layout can be changed at any time in the general settings."
msgstr ""
"Hujjat maketini istalgan vaqtda umumiy sozlamalarda o'zgartirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:118
msgid ""
"To add a QR code for banking app payments to the invoice, enable "
"the :guilabel:`QR Code` option in the :guilabel:`Configure Your Document "
"Layout` window. To modify this option, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Customer "
"Payments` section, and enable/disable the :guilabel:`QR Codes` option."
msgstr ""
"Bank ilovasi orqali to'lovlar uchun hisob-fakturaga QR kod qo'shish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Configure Your Document Layout` oynasida :guilabel:`QR "
"Code` opsiyasini yoqing. Ushbu opsiyani o'zgartirish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` yo'lidan "
"o'ting, :guilabel:`Customer Payments` bo'limigacha pastga tushing "
"va :guilabel:`QR Codes` opsiyasini yoqing/o'chiring."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:123
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Send` window:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Send` oynasida:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:125
msgid ""
"If a preferred :guilabel:`Invoice sending` method was set in the contact "
"form, it is selected by default. Select another one if needed."
msgstr ""
"Agar kontakt formasida afzal ko'rilgan :guilabel:`Invoice sending` usuli "
"belgilangan bo'lsa, u standart bo'yicha tanlangan bo'ladi. Kerak bo'lsa, "
"boshqasini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:127
msgid ""
"If no preferred :guilabel:`Invoice sending` method was set in the contact "
"form, select the method to use for sending the invoice to the customer."
msgstr ""
"Agar kontakt formasida afzal ko'rilgan :guilabel:`Invoice sending` usuli "
"belgilanmagan bo'lsa, hisob-fakturani mijozga yuborish uchun ishlatiladigan "
"usulni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:130
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Send` if the :guilabel:`by Email` option is selected, or "
"click :guilabel:`Download`."
msgstr ""
"Agar :guilabel:`by Email` opsiyasi tanlangan bo'lsa, :guilabel:`Send` "
"tugmasini bosing yoki :guilabel:`Download` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:136
msgid "Sending multiple invoices"
msgstr "Bir nechta hisob-fakturani yuborish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:138
msgid ""
"To send multiple invoices, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --"
"> Invoices`, select them in the :guilabel:`Invoices` list view and "
"click :guilabel:`Send`. The :guilabel:`Send` window displays the number of "
"selected invoice to send by email."
msgstr ""
"Bir nechta hisob-fakturani yuborish uchun :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Customers --> Invoices` yo'lidan o'ting, ularni :guilabel:`Invoices` ro'yxat "
"ko'rinishida tanlang va :guilabel:`Send` tugmasini bosing. :guilabel:`Send` "
"oynasida elektron pochta orqali yuboriladigan tanlangan hisob-fakturalar "
"soni ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:142
msgid ""
"After clicking :guilabel:`Send`, a banner is added to the selected invoices "
"to indicate they are part of an ongoing send batch. This helps prevent the "
"process from being triggered manually again, as it may take some time to "
"complete for exceptionally large batches."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Send` tugmasi bosilgandan so'ng, tanlangan hisob-fakturalarga "
"ularning davom etayotgan yuborish partiyasiga tegishli ekanligini "
"ko'rsatuvchi banner qo'shiladi. Bu jarayonning qo'lda qayta ishga "
"tushirilishining oldini olishga yordam beradi, chunki juda katta partiyalar "
"uchun jarayon yakunlanishi biroz vaqt olishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:146
msgid ""
"To check all invoices that have not yet been sent, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Invoices`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Invoices` list view, click into the search bar and filter "
"on :guilabel:`Not Sent`."
msgstr ""
"Hali yuborilmagan barcha hisob-fakturalarni tekshirish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Invoices` yo'lidan "
"o'ting. :guilabel:`Invoices` ro'yxat ko'rinishida qidiruv paneliga bosing "
"va :guilabel:`Not Sent` bo'yicha filtrlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:153
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:189
msgid "Payment and reconciliation"
msgstr "To'lov va solishtirma (rekonsiliatsiya)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:155
msgid ""
"In Odoo, an invoice is considered :guilabel:`Paid` when the associated "
"accounting entry has been reconciled with a corresponding bank transaction."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'da hisob-faktura unga bog'liq buxgalteriya yozuvi tegishli bank "
"tranzaksiyasi bilan solishtirilganda :guilabel:`Paid` deb hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:159
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:208
msgid ":doc:`payments`"
msgstr ":doc:`payments`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:160
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:19
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:209
msgid ":doc:`bank/reconciliation`"
msgstr ":doc:`bank/reconciliation`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:165
msgid "Payment follow-up"
msgstr "To'lov bo'yicha eslatma (follow-up)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:167
msgid ""
"Odoo's :doc:`follow-up actions <payments/follow_up>` help companies follow "
"up on customer invoices. Different actions can be set up to remind customers "
"to pay their outstanding invoices, depending on how much the customer is "
"overdue. These actions are bundled into follow-up levels that trigger when "
"an invoice is overdue by a certain number of days. If there are multiple "
"overdue invoices for the same customer, the actions are performed on the "
"most overdue invoice."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'ning :doc:`eslatma amallari <payments/follow_up>` kompaniyalarga mijoz "
"hisob-fakturalarini nazorat qilishda yordam beradi. Mijozning to'lovi "
"qanchalik kechikkanligiga qarab, mijozlarga to'lanmagan hisob-fakturalarini "
"to'lashni eslatish uchun turli amallarni sozlash mumkin. Ushbu amallar hisob-"
"faktura ma'lum kunga kechikkanda ishga tushadigan eslatma darajalariga "
"birlashtirilgan. Agar bitta mijozda bir nechta muddati o'tgan hisob-faktura "
"bo'lsa, amallar eng ko'p kechikkan hisob-faktura bo'yicha bajariladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:181
msgid "Partner reports"
msgstr "Hamkor hisobotlari"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:186
msgid "Partner Ledger"
msgstr "Hamkor daftari"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:188
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Partner Ledger` report shows the balance of customers and "
"suppliers. To access it, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> "
"Partner Ledger`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Partner Ledger` hisoboti mijozlar va yetkazib beruvchilarning "
"balansini ko'rsatadi. Unga kirish uchun :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Reporting --> Partner Ledger` yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:194
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:103
msgid "Aged Receivable"
msgstr "Muddati o'tgan debitorlik qarzlari"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:196
msgid ""
"To review outstanding customer invoices and their related due dates, use "
"the :ref:`Aged Receivable <accounting/reporting/aged-receivable>` report. To "
"access it, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Aged "
"Receivable`."
msgstr ""
"To'lanmagan mijoz hisob-fakturalari va ularga tegishli to'lov muddatlarini "
"ko'rib chiqish uchun :ref:`Aged Receivable <accounting/reporting/aged-"
"receivable>` hisobotidan foydalaning. Unga kirish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Aged Receivable` yo'lidan "
"o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:203
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:111
msgid "Aged Payable"
msgstr "Muddati o'tgan kreditorlik qarzlari"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:205
msgid ""
"To review outstanding vendor bills and their related due dates, use "
"the :ref:`Aged Payable <accounting/reporting/aged-payable>` report. To "
"access it, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Aged Payable`."
msgstr ""
"To'lanmagan yetkazib beruvchi hisoblari va ularga tegishli to'lov "
"muddatlarini ko'rib chiqish uchun :ref:`Aged Payable <accounting/reporting/"
"aged-payable>` hisobotidan foydalaning. Unga kirish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Aged Payable` yo'lidan "
"o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:212
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:49
msgid "Profit and Loss"
msgstr "Foyda va zarar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:214
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Profit and Loss <accounting/reporting/profit-and-loss>` statement "
"shows details of income and expenses."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Foyda va zarar <accounting/reporting/profit-and-loss>` hisoboti "
"daromadlar va xarajatlar tafsilotlarini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:222
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Balance Sheet <accounting/reporting/balance-sheet>` summarizes the "
"company's assets, liabilities, and equity at a specific time."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Balans hisoboti <accounting/reporting/balance-sheet>` kompaniyaning "
"muayyan vaqtdagi aktivlari, majburiyatlari va kapitalini umumlashtiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:3
msgid "Cash discounts and tax reduction"
msgstr "Naqd chegirmalar va soliqni kamaytirish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:5
msgid ""
"**Cash discounts** are reductions in the amount a customer must pay for "
"goods or services offered as an incentive for paying their invoice promptly. "
"These discounts are typically a percentage of the total invoice amount and "
"are applied if the customer pays within a specified time. Cash discounts can "
"help a company maintain a steady cash flow."
msgstr ""
"**Naqd chegirmalar** — mijoz tovarlar yoki xizmatlar uchun to'lashi kerak "
"bo'lgan summani kamaytirish bo'lib, hisob-fakturani o'z vaqtida to'lashni "
"rag'batlantirish maqsadida taklif etiladi. Bu chegirmalar odatda umumiy "
"hisob-faktura summasining foizi sifatida belgilanadi va mijoz belgilangan "
"muddat ichida to'lasa qo'llaniladi. Naqd chegirmalar kompaniyaga barqaror "
"pul oqimini saqlashga yordam berishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:11
msgid ""
"You issue a €100 invoice on the 1st of January. The full payment is due "
"within 30 days, and you also offer a 2% discount if your customer pays you "
"within seven days."
msgstr ""
"Siz 1-yanvarda €100 lik hisob-faktura chiqarasiz. To'liq to'lov 30 kun "
"ichida amalga oshirilishi kerak, shuningdek, mijozingiz yetti kun ichida "
"to'lasa, 2% chegirma taklif qilasiz."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:14
msgid ""
"The customer can pay €98 up to the 8th of January. After that date, they "
"would have to pay €100 by the 31st of January."
msgstr ""
"Mijoz 8-yanvargacha €98 to'lashi mumkin. Bu sanadan keyin esa 31-yanvargacha "
"€100 to'lashi kerak bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:17
msgid ""
"A :ref:`tax reduction <cash-discounts/tax-reductions>` can also be applied "
"depending on the country or region."
msgstr ""
"Mamlakat yoki mintaqaga qarab :ref:`soliqni kamaytirish <cash-discounts/tax-"
"reductions>` ham qo'llanilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:21
msgid ":doc:`payment_terms`"
msgstr ":doc:`payment_terms`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:22
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/batch.rst:23
msgid ":doc:`../payments`"
msgstr ":doc:`../payments`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:29
msgid ""
"To grant cash discounts to customers, you must first verify the :ref:`gain "
"and loss accounts <cash-discounts/gain-loss-accounts>`. Then, "
"configure :ref:`payment terms <cash-discounts/payment-terms>` and add a cash "
"discount by checking the :guilabel:`Early Discount` checkbox and filling in "
"the discount percentage, discount days, and :ref:`tax reduction <cash-"
"discounts/tax-reductions>` fields."
msgstr ""
"Mijozlarga naqd chegirmalar berish uchun avval :ref:`foyda va zarar "
"hisoblarini <cash-discounts/gain-loss-accounts>` tekshirishingiz kerak. "
"So'ngra :ref:`to'lov shartlarini <cash-discounts/payment-terms>` sozlang "
"va :guilabel:`Early Discount` katagini belgilab, chegirma foizi, chegirma "
"kunlari va :ref:`soliqni kamaytirish <cash-discounts/tax-reductions>` "
"maydonlarini to'ldirib, naqd chegirma qo'shing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:38
msgid "Cash discount gain/loss accounts"
msgstr "Naqd chegirma foyda/zarar hisoblari"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:40
msgid ""
"With a cash discount, the amount you earn depends on whether the customer "
"benefits from the cash discount or not. This inevitably leads to gains and "
"losses, which are recorded on default accounts."
msgstr ""
"Naqd chegirmada siz oladigan summa mijozning naqd chegirmadan foydalanish-"
"foydalanmasligiga bog'liq. Bu muqarrar ravishda foyda va zararlarga olib "
"keladi, ular standart hisoblarda qayd etiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:43
msgid ""
"To modify these accounts, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration "
"--> Settings`, and, in the :guilabel:`Default Accounts` section, select the "
"accounts you want to use for the :guilabel:`Cash Discount Gain account` "
"and :guilabel:`Cash Discount Loss account`."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu hisoblarni o'zgartirish uchun :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Settings` yo'lidan o'ting va :guilabel:`Default Accounts` "
"bo'limida :guilabel:`Cash Discount Gain account` va :guilabel:`Cash Discount "
"Loss account` uchun ishlatmoqchi bo'lgan hisoblarni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:50
msgid "Payment terms"
msgstr "To'lov shartlari"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:52
msgid ""
"Cash discounts are defined on :doc:`payment terms <payment_terms>`. "
"Configure them to your liking by going to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Payment Terms`, and make sure to fill out the discount "
"percentage, discount days, and :ref:`tax reduction <cash-discounts/tax-"
"reductions>` fields."
msgstr ""
"Naqd chegirmalar :doc:`to'lov shartlarida <payment_terms>` "
"belgilanadi. :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Payment Terms` "
"yo'lidan o'tib, ularni o'zingizga mos qilib sozlang hamda chegirma foizi, "
"chegirma kunlari va :ref:`soliqni kamaytirish <cash-discounts/tax-"
"reductions>` maydonlarini to'ldirishni unutmang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:None
msgid ""
"Configuration of payment terms named \"2/7 Net 30\". The field \"Description "
"on Invoices\"\n"
"reads: \"Payment terms: 30 Days, 2% Early Payment Discount under 7 days\"."
msgstr ""
"\"2/7 Net 30\" deb nomlangan to'lov shartlari konfiguratsiyasi. "
"\"Description on Invoices\"\n"
"maydonida shunday yozilgan: \"Payment terms: 30 Days, 2% Early Payment "
"Discount under 7 days\"."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:64
msgid "Tax reductions"
msgstr "Soliqni kamaytirishlar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:66
msgid ""
"Depending on the country or region, the base amount used to compute the tax "
"can vary, which can lead to a **tax reduction**. Since tax reductions are "
"set on individual payment terms, each term can use a specific tax reduction."
msgstr ""
"Mamlakat yoki mintaqaga qarab, soliqni hisoblash uchun ishlatiladigan asos "
"summa turlicha bo'lishi mumkin, bu esa **soliqni kamaytirishga** olib "
"kelishi mumkin. Soliqni kamaytirishlar alohida to'lov shartlarida "
"belgilanganligi sababli, har bir shart o'ziga xos soliq kamaytirishdan "
"foydalanishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:70
msgid ""
"To configure how the tax reduction is applied, go to a payment term with "
"the :guilabel:`Early Discount` checkbox enabled, and select one of the three "
"following options:"
msgstr ""
"Soliqni kamaytirish qanday qo'llanilishini sozlash uchun :guilabel:`Early "
"Discount` katagi yoqilgan to'lov shartiga o'ting va quyidagi uchta opsiyadan "
"birini tanlang:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:75
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:94
msgid "Always (upon invoice)"
msgstr "Har doim (hisob-faktura asosida)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:74
msgid ""
"The tax is always reduced. The base amount used to compute the tax is the "
"discounted amount, whether the customer benefits from the discount or not."
msgstr ""
"Soliq har doim kamaytiriladi. Soliqni hisoblash uchun ishlatiladigan asos "
"summa — mijoz chegirmadan foydalanadimi yoki yo'qmi, chegirma qilingan "
"summadir."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:80
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:109
msgid "On early payment"
msgstr "Erta to'lovda"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:78
msgid ""
"The tax is reduced only if the customer pays early. The base amount used to "
"compute the tax is the same as the sale: if the customer benefits from the "
"reduction, then the tax is reduced. This means that, depending on the "
"customer, the tax amount can vary after the invoice is issued."
msgstr ""
"Soliq faqat mijoz erta to'lagan taqdirda kamaytiriladi. Soliqni hisoblash "
"uchun ishlatiladigan asos summa sotuv bilan bir xil: agar mijoz "
"kamaytirishdan foydalansa, soliq kamaytiriladi. Bu shuni anglatadiki, "
"mijozga qarab, hisob-faktura chiqarilgandan keyin soliq summasi o'zgarishi "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:84
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:124
msgid "Never"
msgstr "Hech qachon"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:83
msgid ""
"The tax is never reduced. The base amount used to compute the tax is the "
"full amount, whether the customer benefits from the discount or not."
msgstr ""
"Soliq hech qachon kamaytirilmaydi. Soliqni hisoblash uchun ishlatiladigan "
"asos summa — mijoz chegirmadan foydalanadimi yoki yo'qmi, to'liq summadir."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:88
msgid ""
