"bilan integratsiyalashib, barcha hisob-fakturalar soliq organlariga xavfsiz "
"topshirish uchun texnik va huquqiy standartlarga javob berishini "
"ta'minlaydi. Odoo korxonalarga elektron hisob-fakturalarni milliy muvofiqlik "
"uchun FACe platformasiga hamda mintaqaviy davlat boshqaruvi tranzaksiyalari "
"uchun e-Factura Euskadi tizimiga uzluksiz topshirish imkonini beradi. "
"Shuningdek, Odoo Bask o'lkasiga xos TicketBAI tashabbusiga muvofiqlikni "
"qo'llab-quvvatlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/basque_country.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Secure storage and retrieval**: In accordance with regulations requiring "
"invoices to be stored for a minimum of 6 years, Odoo provides a secure, "
