"(Universal Business Language)` formatidagi XML kabi standart elektron hisob-"
"faktura formatlarini qo'llab-quvvatlaydi, ular davlat xaridi tranzaksiyalari "
"uchun Xorvatiyaning :abbr:`CIS (Central Invoice System)` tizimi va B2B "
"tranzaksiyalari uchun e-Račun platformasi bilan to'liq mos keladi. Bundan "
"tashqari, Odoo Peppol tarmog'iga ulangan har qanday platforma orqali "
"elektron hisob-fakturalarni uzatish imkonini beradi, chunki *Servis eRačun "
"za državu* ga Peppol orqali kirish mumkin, bu esa ham Xorvatiya, ham Yevropa "
"Ittifoqi standartlariga muvofiqlikni ta'minlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/croatia.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Secure storage and retrieval**: In accordance with Croatian regulations to "
