"o'zgartirishdan himoyalangan tizimda xavfsiz arxivlaydi va ularni auditlar "
"paytida oson olish imkonini ta'minlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/croatia.rst:50
