msgstr ""
"Odoo Invoicing — Estoniyaning tartibga solish standartlariga moslashtirilgan "
"xavfsiz, samarali va qonuniy talablarga javob beradigan elektron hisob-"
"faktura yechimlari bo'yicha ishonchli hamkoringiz."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/estonia.rst:11
msgid "Legal framework for e-invoicing in Estonia"
msgstr "Estoniyada elektron hisob-faktura uchun huquqiy asos"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/estonia.rst:13
msgid ""
"In Estonia, businesses must comply with e-invoicing regulations to ensure "
"secure, authentic, and storable transactions. The main legal framework "
"governing e-invoicing in Estonia is the `Accounting Act <https://"
"www.riigiteataja.ee/en/eli/ee/514052021001/consolide/current>`_ and its "
"provisions related to e-invoicing, which align with `EU Directive 2014/55/EU "
"<https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A32014L0055>`_ "
"on e-invoicing in public procurement. Since 2019, :abbr:`B2G (business-to-"
"government)` transactions must use electronic invoices via Estonia's Rik's e-"
"Invoicing System, the government's platform for public sector e-invoicing. "
"Estonia is also part of the Peppol network, which ensures standardized cross-"
"border e-invoicing across Europe. Additionally, the use of e-invoicing is "
"encouraged for B2B transactions, promoting better transparency, efficiency, "
"and compliance with VAT requirements."
msgstr ""
"Estoniyada bizneslar xavfsiz, ishonchli va saqlanadigan tranzaksiyalarni "
"ta'minlash uchun elektron hisob-faktura qoidalariga rioya qilishlari kerak. "
"Estoniyada elektron hisob-fakturani tartibga soluvchi asosiy huquqiy asos — "
"bu `Accounting Act <https://www.riigiteataja.ee/en/eli/ee/514052021001/"
"consolide/current>`_ (Buxgalteriya hisobi to'g'risidagi qonun) va uning "
"elektron hisob-fakturaga oid qoidalari bo'lib, ular davlat xaridlarida "
"elektron hisob-faktura bo'yicha `EU Directive 2014/55/EU <https://eur-"
"lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A32014L0055>`_ direktivasiga "
"mos keladi. 2019-yildan boshlab :abbr:`B2G (business-to-government)` "
"tranzaksiyalari hukumatning davlat sektori elektron hisob-fakturasi uchun "
"platformasi bo'lgan Estoniyaning Rik elektron hisob-faktura tizimi orqali "
"elektron hisob-fakturalardan foydalanishi shart. Estoniya, shuningdek, butun "
"Yevropa bo'ylab standartlashtirilgan transchegaraviy elektron hisob-"
"fakturani ta'minlaydigan Peppol tarmog'ining bir qismidir. Bundan tashqari, "
"B2B tranzaksiyalari uchun elektron hisob-fakturadan foydalanish "
"rag'batlantiriladi, bu esa yaxshiroq shaffoflik, samaradorlik va QQS "
"talablariga muvofiqlikni targ'ib qiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/estonia.rst:24
msgid "Compliance with Estonian e-invoicing regulations"
msgstr "Estoniya elektron hisob-faktura qoidalariga muvofiqlik"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/estonia.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Supported formats**: Odoo supports standard e-invoice formats, such as XML "
"in :abbr:`UBL (Universal Business Language)` format, which is fully "
"compatible with Estonia's Rik’s e-Invoicing System for public procurement "
"transactions. Additionally, Odoo enables seamless transmission of e-invoices "
"through platforms connected to the Peppol network, ensuring compliance with "
"Estonian and EU e-invoicing standards."
msgstr ""
"**Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan formatlar**: Odoo :abbr:`UBL (Universal Business "
"Language)` formatidagi XML kabi standart elektron hisob-faktura formatlarini "
"qo'llab-quvvatlaydi, bu format davlat xaridi tranzaksiyalari uchun "
"Estoniyaning Rik elektron hisob-faktura tizimi bilan to'liq mos keladi. "
"Bundan tashqari, Odoo Peppol tarmog'iga ulangan platformalar orqali elektron "
"hisob-fakturalarni uzluksiz uzatish imkonini beradi va Estoniya hamda "
"Yevropa Ittifoqi elektron hisob-faktura standartlariga muvofiqlikni "
"ta'minlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/estonia.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Secure storage and retrival**: In accordance with Estonian regulations to "
"store invoices for a minimum of seven years, Odoo securely archives all "
"invoices in a tamper-proof system, making them easily retrievable during "
"audits."
msgstr ""
"**Xavfsiz saqlash va olish**: Hisob-fakturalarni kamida yetti yil saqlash "
"bo'yicha Estoniya qoidalariga muvofiq, Odoo barcha hisob-fakturalarni "
"o'zgartirishdan himoyalangan tizimda xavfsiz arxivlaydi va ularni auditlar "
"paytida oson olish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/estonia.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Automatic VAT calculation and reporting**: Odoo Invoicing automates VAT "
"calculations and ensures invoices are formatted to meet Denmark’s legal "
"requirements for :abbr:`B2G (business-to-government)` and B2B transactions, "
"helping businesses compliant with local tax laws."
msgstr ""
"**Avtomatik QQS hisoblash va hisobot berish**: Odoo Invoicing QQS hisob-"
"kitoblarini avtomatlashtiradi va hisob-fakturalar Daniyaning :abbr:`B2G "
"(business-to-government)` va B2B tranzaksiyalari uchun qonuniy talablariga "
"javob beradigan tarzda formatlanishini ta'minlaydi, bu esa bizneslarga "
"mahalliy soliq qonunlariga rioya qilishda yordam beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/estonia.rst:43
msgid ""
"This page provides an overview of Estonian e-invoicing laws and how Odoo "
