#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/guatemala.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Supported formats**: Odoo supports most mandatory FEL document types in "
"SAT-compliant XML, including invoices (:abbr:`FACT`), credit notes "
"(:abbr:`NCRE`), and debit notes (:abbr:`NDEB`). Each document is "
"automatically submitted to a certified certifier (Infile), digitally signed, "
"and validated by the SAT in real time."
msgstr ""
"**Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan formatlar**: Odoo SAT talablariga mos XML "
"formatidagi ko'pchilik majburiy FEL hujjat turlarini, jumladan hisob-"
"fakturalar (:abbr:`FACT`), kredit-notalar (:abbr:`NCRE`) va debet-notalarni "
"(:abbr:`NDEB`) qo'llab-quvvatlaydi. Har bir hujjat avtomatik ravishda "
"sertifikatlangan sertifikatlovchiga (Infile) yuboriladi, raqamli imzolanadi "
"va SAT tomonidan real vaqt rejimida tasdiqlanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/guatemala.rst:41
msgid ""
"**Secure storage and retrieval**: In accordance with Guatemalan regulations, "
"Odoo provides centralized and secure storage of certified documents, "
"including their XML and PDF graphical representations, with full access for "
"audits and control processes."
msgstr ""
