#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/hungary.rst:13
msgid ""
"In Hungary, businesses must adhere to e-invoicing regulations to ensure "
"secure, authentic, and storable transactions. The primary legal framework is "
"the Hungarian VAT Act (Act CXXVII of 2007), which mandates real-time "
"reporting of invoices to the NAV Online invoice system, Hungary's government "
"e-invoicing platform. As of 2021, all B2B and B2C invoices must be reported "
"in real-time, regardless of value. Hungary's regulations do not currently "
"require :abbr:`B2G (business-to-government)` e-invoicing, but public sector "
"invoicing is encouraged via the Peppol network. Common formats for e-"
"invoicing include XML for NAV submissions and other structured formats to "
"streamline compliance."
msgstr ""
"Vengriyada korxonalar xavfsiz, haqiqiy va saqlanadigan tranzaksiyalarni "
"ta'minlash uchun elektron hisob-faktura qoidalariga rioya qilishlari shart. "
"Asosiy huquqiy hujjat — Vengriya QQS to'g'risidagi qonuni (2007-yilgi CXXVII-"
"son qonun) bo'lib, u hisob-fakturalar to'g'risida Vengriya hukumatining "
"elektron hisob-faktura platformasi bo'lgan NAV Online hisob-faktura tizimiga "
"real vaqt rejimida hisobot berishni majburiy qiladi. 2021-yildan boshlab "
"barcha B2B va B2C hisob-fakturalari, qiymatidan qat'i nazar, real vaqt "
"rejimida hisobot qilinishi kerak. Vengriya qoidalari hozirda :abbr:`B2G "
"(business-to-government)` elektron hisob-faktura yuritishni talab qilmaydi, "
"ammo davlat sektorida hisob-faktura yuritish Peppol tarmog'i orqali "
"rag'batlantiriladi. Elektron hisob-faktura yuritishning keng tarqalgan "
"formatlariga NAV ga topshirish uchun XML va muvofiqlikni soddalashtiruvchi "
"boshqa tuzilmalangan formatlar kiradi."

