msgstr "Irlandiyada elektron hisob-faktura yuritishning huquqiy asoslari"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/ireland.rst:13
msgid ""
"In Ireland, businesses must comply with e-invoicing regulations to ensure "
"secure, authentic, and storable transactions. The legal framework for e-"
"invoicing is primarily shaped by `EU Directive 2014/55/EU <https://eur-"
"lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A32014L0055>`_, which "
"mandates the use of electronic invoicing in :abbr:`B2G (business-to-"
"government)` transactions. Irish public sector bodies must accept electronic "
"invoices that comply with the European Standard EN 16931. E-invoicing in the "
"public sector is facilitated through the Peppol network, providing a "
"streamlined and standardized platform for invoicing. While not mandatory for "
"B2B transactions, e-invoicing is increasingly encouraged to enhance "
"efficiency, transparency, and compliance."
msgstr ""
"Irlandiyada korxonalar xavfsiz, haqiqiy va saqlanadigan tranzaksiyalarni "
"ta'minlash uchun elektron hisob-faktura qoidalariga rioya qilishlari shart. "
"Elektron hisob-faktura yuritishning huquqiy asoslari asosan :abbr:`B2G "
"(business-to-government)` tranzaksiyalarida elektron hisob-fakturalardan "
"foydalanishni majburiy qiluvchi `EU Directive 2014/55/EU <https://eur-"
"lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A32014L0055>`_ direktivasi "
"asosida shakllangan. Irlandiya davlat sektori tashkilotlari EN 16931 Yevropa "
"standartiga mos elektron hisob-fakturalarni qabul qilishlari shart. Davlat "
"sektorida elektron hisob-faktura yuritish Peppol tarmog'i orqali amalga "
"oshiriladi, bu hisob-faktura yuritish uchun soddalashtirilgan va "
"standartlashtirilgan platformani ta'minlaydi. B2B tranzaksiyalari uchun "
"majburiy bo'lmasa-da, samaradorlik, shaffoflik va muvofiqlikni oshirish "
"maqsadida elektron hisob-faktura yuritish tobora ko'proq "
"rag'batlantirilmoqda."

