#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/italy.rst:13
msgid ""
"Italy has one of the most advanced e-invoicing frameworks in Europe, "
"governed by the `Italian budget law <https://www.gazzettaufficiale.it/eli/id/"
"2022/12/29/22G00211/sg>`_ and regulations issued by the Agenzia delle "
"Entrate. Since 2019, e-invoicing is mandatory for B2B, B2C, and :abbr:`B2G "
"(business-to-government)` transactions. All e-invoices must be submitted "
"through the :abbr:`Sdi (Sistema di Interscambio)`, the Italian government's "
"centralized exchange system. The format for e-invoices is FatturaPA, a "
"structured XML format specifically designed for compliance with Italian "
"regulations. As part of its compliance with `EU Directive 2014/55/EU "
"<https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A32014L0055>`_, "
"Italy also supports Peppol standards for cross-border e-invoicing."
msgstr ""
"Italiya Yevropadagi eng ilg'or elektron hisob-faktura tizimlaridan biriga "
"ega bo'lib, u `Italian budget law <https://www.gazzettaufficiale.it/eli/id/"
"2022/12/29/22G00211/sg>`_ va Agenzia delle Entrate tomonidan chiqarilgan "
"qoidalar bilan tartibga solinadi. 2019-yildan boshlab elektron hisob-faktura "
"yuritish B2B, B2C va :abbr:`B2G (business-to-government)` tranzaksiyalari "
"uchun majburiydir. Barcha elektron hisob-fakturalar Italiya hukumatining "
"markazlashtirilgan almashinuv tizimi bo'lgan :abbr:`Sdi (Sistema di "
"Interscambio)` orqali topshirilishi kerak. Elektron hisob-fakturalar formati "
"— Italiya qoidalariga muvofiqlik uchun maxsus ishlab chiqilgan tuzilmalangan "
"XML formati bo'lgan FatturaPA. `EU Directive 2014/55/EU <https://eur-"
"lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A32014L0055>`_ direktivasiga "
"muvofiqlik doirasida Italiya transchegaraviy elektron hisob-faktura yuritish "
"uchun Peppol standartlarini ham qo'llab-quvvatlaydi."

