#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:200
msgid ""
"In other words, returns to vendors are perceived by Odoo as another form of "
"a product exiting the warehouse. To Odoo, because the table is valued at $12 "
"per unit, the inventory value is reduced by `$12` when the product is "
"returned; the initial purchase price of `$10` is unrelated to the table's "
"average cost."
msgstr ""
"Boshqacha aytganda, yetkazib beruvchilarga qaytarishlar Odoo tomonidan "
"mahsulotning ombordan chiqishining yana bir shakli sifatida qabul qilinadi. "
"Odoo uchun stol birligi $12 dan baholangani sababli, mahsulot qaytarilganda "
"zaxira qiymati `$12` ga kamayadi; dastlabki `$10` xarid narxi stolning "
"o'rtacha tannarxiga aloqador emas."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:206
msgid ""
"To return a single table that was purchased for `$10`, navigate to the "
"receipt in the *Inventory* app for the :ref:`8 tables purchased in Exercise "
"1 <inventory/avg_cost/ex-1>` by going to the :guilabel:`Inventory Overview`, "
"clicking on :guilabel:`Receipts`, and selecting the desired receipt."
msgstr ""
"`$10` ga sotib olingan bitta stolni qaytarish uchun *Inventory* "
"ilovasida :ref:`1-mashqda sotib olingan 8 ta stol <inventory/avg_cost/ex-1>` "
"uchun qabul hujjatiga o'ting: buning uchun :guilabel:`Inventory Overview` "
"sahifasiga o'tib, :guilabel:`Receipts` ustiga bosing va kerakli qabul "
"hujjatini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:211
msgid ""
"Then, click :guilabel:`Return` on the validated delivery order, and modify "
"the quantity to `1` in the reverse transfer window. This creates an outgoing "
"shipment for the table. Select :guilabel:`Validate` to confirm the outgoing "
"shipment."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra tasdiqlangan yetkazib berish buyurtmasida :guilabel:`Return` "
"tugmasini bosing va teskari ko'chirish oynasida miqdorni `1` ga "
"o'zgartiring. Bu stol uchun chiquvchi jo'natma yaratadi. Chiquvchi "
"jo'natmani tasdiqlash uchun :guilabel:`Validate` tugmasini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:215
msgid ""
"Return to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Reporting --> Inventory Valuation` "
"to see how the outgoing shipment decreases the inventory value by $12."
msgstr ""
"Chiquvchi jo'natma zaxira qiymatini $12 ga qanday kamaytirishini ko'rish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Inventory --> Reporting --> Inventory Valuation` "
"sahifasiga qayting."

