#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:288
msgid "Product reception"
msgstr "Mahsulotni qabul qilish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:291
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Xulosa"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:293
msgid ""
"At product reception, Odoo ensures companies can pay for goods that were "
"purchased by preemptively moving an amount matching the price of received "
"goods into the :doc:`liability account </applications/finance/accounting/"
"get_started/cheat_sheet>`, **Stock Input**. Then, once the bill has been "
"received, the amount in the holding account is transferred to *Accounts "
"Payable*. Transfers into this account means the bill has been paid. **Stock "
"Input** is reconciled once the vendor bill is received."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulot qabul qilinganda, Odoo kompaniyalar sotib olingan tovarlar uchun "
"to'lay olishini ta'minlash maqsadida qabul qilingan tovarlar narxiga teng "
"summani oldindan :doc:`majburiyat hisobiga </applications/finance/accounting/"
"get_started/cheat_sheet>`, ya'ni **Stock Input** hisobiga o'tkazadi. Keyin, "
"hisob qabul qilingach, vaqtinchalik saqlash hisobidagi summa *Accounts "
"Payable* hisobiga o'tkaziladi. Ushbu hisobga o'tkazmalar hisob to'langanini "
"anglatadi. **Stock Input** yetkazib beruvchi hisobi qabul qilingach "
"solishtiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:300
msgid ""
"Inventory valuation is a method of calculating how much each in-stock "
"product is worth internally. Since there is a difference between the price "
"the product is **valuated at** and the price the product was actually "
"**purchased for**, the **Inventory Valuation** account is unrelated to the "
"crediting and debiting operations of the **Stock Input** account."
msgstr ""
"Zaxiralarni baholash — ombordagi har bir mahsulotning ichki qiymatini "
"hisoblash usulidir. Mahsulot **baholangan** narx bilan mahsulot aslida "
"**sotib olingan** narx o'rtasida farq bo'lgani sababli, **Inventory "
"Valuation** hisobi **Stock Input** hisobining kredit va debet "
"operatsiyalariga bog'liq emas."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:305
msgid "To conceptualize all this, follow the breakdown below."
msgstr "Bularning barchasini tushunish uchun quyidagi tahlilni kuzatib boring."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:308
msgid "Accounts balanced at received products"
msgstr "Mahsulotlar qabul qilinganda hisoblarning balanslanishi"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:310
msgid ""
"In this example, a company starts with zero units of a product, `table`, in "
"stock. Then, 8 tables are received from the vendor:"
msgstr ""
"Ushbu misolda kompaniya omborda `table` mahsulotining nol birligi bilan "
"boshlaydi. Keyin yetkazib beruvchidan 8 ta stol qabul qilinadi:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:313
msgid ""
"The **Stock Input** account stores `$80` of credit owed to the vendor. The "
"amount in this account is unrelated to the inventory value."
msgstr ""
"**Stock Input** hisobida yetkazib beruvchiga qarz bo'lgan `$80` kredit "
"saqlanadi. Ushbu hisobdagi summa zaxira qiymatiga bog'liq emas."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:315
msgid ""
"`$80` worth of tables came **in** (**debit** the *Inventory Value* account "
"`$80`), and"
msgstr ""
"`$80` qiymatidagi stollar **kirib** keldi (*Inventory Value* hisobini `$80` "
"ga **debetlang**), va"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:316
msgid ""
"`$80` must be paid **out** for received goods (**credit** the *Stock Input* "
"account `$80`)."
msgstr ""
"qabul qilingan tovarlar uchun `$80` **to'lanishi** kerak (*Stock Input* "
"hisobini `$80` ga **kreditlang**)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:319
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:362
msgid "In Odoo"
msgstr "Odoo'da"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:321
msgid ""
"Odoo generates an accounting journal entry when shipments that use |AVCO| "
"costing method are received. Configure a :guilabel:`Price Difference "
"Account` by selecting the :guilabel:`➡️ (arrow)` icon next to "
"the :guilabel:`Product Category` field on the product page."
msgstr ""
"|AVCO| tannarx usulidan foydalanadigan yuk jo'natmalari qabul qilinganda, "
"Odoo buxgalteriya jurnal yozuvini yaratadi. Mahsulot "
"sahifasidagi :guilabel:`Product Category` maydoni yonidagi :guilabel:`➡️ "
"(arrow)` belgisini tanlab, :guilabel:`Price Difference Account` hisobini "
"sozlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:325
msgid ""
"Under :guilabel:`Account Properties`, create a new :guilabel:`Price "
"Difference Account` by typing in the name of the account and "
"clicking :guilabel:`Create and Edit`. Then set the account :guilabel:`Type` "
"as `Expenses`, and click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Account Properties` bo'limida hisob nomini kiritib "
"va :guilabel:`Create and Edit` tugmasini bosib, yangi :guilabel:`Price "
"Difference Account` yarating. Keyin hisobning :guilabel:`Type` qiymatini "
"`Expenses` deb belgilang va :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:None
msgid "Create price difference account."
msgstr "Narx farqi hisobini yaratish."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:333
msgid ""
"Then, receive the shipment in the *Purchase* app or *Inventory* app, and "
"navigate to the :menuselection:`Accounting app --> Accounting --> Journal "
"Entries`. In the list, find the :guilabel:`Reference` that matches the "
"warehouse reception operation for the relevant product."
msgstr ""
"Keyin, yuk jo'natmasini *Purchase* ilovasida yoki *Inventory* ilovasida "
"qabul qiling va :menuselection:`Accounting app --> Accounting --> Journal "
"Entries` yo'lidan o'ting. Ro'yxatda tegishli mahsulot uchun omborga qabul "
"qilish operatsiyasiga mos keladigan :guilabel:`Reference` yozuvini toping."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:None
msgid "Show accounting entry of 8 tables from the list."
msgstr "Ro'yxatdan 8 ta stolning buxgalteriya yozuvini ko'rsatish."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:341
msgid ""
"Click on the line for 8 tables. This accounting journal entry shows that "
"when the 8 tables were received, the `Stock Valuation` account increased by "
"`$80`. Conversely, the **Stock Input** account (set as `Stock Interim "
"(Received)` account by default) is credited `$80`."
msgstr ""
"8 ta stol uchun qatorni bosing. Ushbu buxgalteriya jurnal yozuvi 8 ta stol "
"qabul qilinganda `Stock Valuation` hisobi `$80` ga oshganini ko'rsatadi. "
"Aksincha, **Stock Input** hisobi (standart bo'yicha `Stock Interim "
"(Received)` hisobi sifatida belgilangan) `$80` ga kreditlanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:None
msgid "Debit stock valuation and credit stock input 80 dollars."
msgstr "Zaxira baholashni debetlash va zaxira kirimini 80 dollarga kreditlash."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:350
msgid "Accounts balanced at received vendor bill"
msgstr "Yetkazib beruvchi hisobi qabul qilinganda hisoblarning balanslanishi"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:352
msgid ""
"In this example, a company starts with zero units of a product, table, in "
"stock. Then, 8 tables are received from the vendor. When the bill is "
"received from vendor for 8 tables:"
msgstr ""
"Ushbu misolda kompaniya omborda stol mahsulotining nol birligi bilan "
"boshlaydi. Keyin yetkazib beruvchidan 8 ta stol qabul qilinadi. 8 ta stol "
"uchun yetkazib beruvchidan hisob qabul qilinganda:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:355
msgid ""
"Use `$80` in the **Stock Input** account to pay the bill. This cancels out "
"and the account now holds `$0`."
msgstr ""
"Hisobni to'lash uchun **Stock Input** hisobidagi `$80` dan foydalaning. Bu "
"o'zaro qoplanadi va endi hisobda `$0` qoladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:357
msgid "Debit **Stock Input** `$80` (to reconcile this account)."
msgstr ""
"**Stock Input** hisobini `$80` ga debetlang (ushbu hisobni solishtirish "
"uchun)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:358
msgid ""
"Credit **Accounts payable** `$80`. This account stores the amount the "
"company owes others, so accountants use the amount to write checks to "
"vendors."
msgstr ""
"**Accounts payable** hisobini `$80` ga kreditlang. Ushbu hisobda kompaniya "
"boshqalarga qarz bo'lgan summa saqlanadi, shuning uchun buxgalterlar bu "
"summadan yetkazib beruvchilarga chek yozish uchun foydalanadilar."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:364
msgid ""
"Once the vendor requests payment, navigate to the :menuselection:`Purchase "
"app --> Orders --> Purchase` and select the :abbr:`PO (Purchase Order)` for "
"8 tables. Inside the :abbr:`PO (Purchase Order)`, select :guilabel:`Create "
"Bill`."
msgstr ""
"Yetkazib beruvchi to'lovni so'raganidan so'ng, :menuselection:`Purchase app "
"--> Orders --> Purchase` yo'lidan o'ting va 8 ta stol uchun :abbr:`PO "
"(Purchase Order)` ni tanlang. :abbr:`PO (Purchase Order)` "
"ichida :guilabel:`Create Bill` ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:368
msgid ""
"Switch to the :guilabel:`Journal Items` tab to view how `$80` is transferred "
"from the holding account, `Stock Interim (Received)` to `Accounts "
"Payable`. :guilabel:`Confirm` the bill to record the payment to the vendor."
msgstr ""
"`$80` vaqtinchalik saqlash hisobi bo'lgan `Stock Interim (Received)` dan "
"`Accounts Payable` ga qanday o'tkazilishini ko'rish uchun :guilabel:`Journal "
"Items` varag'iga o'ting. Yetkazib beruvchiga to'lovni qayd etish uchun "
"hisobni :guilabel:`Confirm` qiling."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:None
msgid "Show bill linked to the purchase order for 8 tables."
msgstr "8 ta stol uchun xarid buyurtmasiga bog'langan hisobni ko'rsatish."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:377
msgid "On product delivery"
msgstr "Mahsulot yetkazib berilganda"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:379
msgid ""
"In the :ref:`above example table <inventory/avg_price/price-table>`, when 10 "
"products are delivered to a customer, the **Stock Input** account is "
"untouched because there are no new products coming in. To put it simply:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Yuqoridagi misol jadvalida <inventory/avg_price/price-table>` mijozga "
"10 ta mahsulot yetkazib berilganda, **Stock Input** hisobi o'zgarishsiz "
"qoladi, chunki yangi kirib kelayotgan mahsulotlar yo'q. Sodda qilib aytganda:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:383
msgid ""
"**Inventory valuation** is credited `$120`. Subtracting from inventory "
"valuation represents `$120` worth of products exiting the company."
msgstr ""
"**Inventory valuation** hisobi `$120` ga kreditlanadi. Zaxira baholashdan "
"ayirish `$120` qiymatidagi mahsulotlar kompaniyadan chiqib ketayotganini "
"anglatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:385
msgid "Debit **Accounts Receivable** to record revenue from the sale."
msgstr ""
"Sotuvdan tushgan daromadni qayd etish uchun **Accounts Receivable** hisobini "
"debetlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:None
msgid "Show journal items linked to sale order."
msgstr "Sotuv buyurtmasiga bog'langan jurnal elementlarini ko'rsatish."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:393
msgid ""
"In the accounting journal entry invoicing a customer for 10 tables, the "
"accounts **Product Sales**, **Tax Received**, and **Accounts Receivable** "
"all pertain to the sale of the product. **Accounts Receivable** is the "
"account where the customer payment will be received."
msgstr ""
"Mijozga 10 ta stol uchun hisob-faktura yozadigan buxgalteriya jurnal "
"yozuvida **Product Sales**, **Tax Received** va **Accounts Receivable** "
"hisoblarining barchasi mahsulot sotuviga tegishli. **Accounts Receivable** — "
"bu mijoz to'lovi qabul qilinadigan hisobdir."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:397
msgid ""
"Anglo-Saxon accounting recognizes the cost of goods sold (COGS) once the "
"sale is made. So, up until the product is sold, scrapped, or returned, costs "
"of keeping the product in stock are not accounted for. The **Expense** "
"account is debited `$120` to log the costs of storing 10 tables during this "
"period of time."
msgstr ""
"Anglo-sakson buxgalteriya hisobi sotilgan tovarlar tannarxini (COGS) sotuv "
"amalga oshirilgach tan oladi. Shuning uchun mahsulot sotilgunga, hisobdan "
"chiqarilgunga yoki qaytarilgunga qadar mahsulotni omborda saqlash "
"xarajatlari hisobga olinmaydi. Ushbu davr mobaynida 10 ta stolni saqlash "
"xarajatlarini qayd etish uchun **Expense** hisobi `$120` ga debetlanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:403
msgid "On product return"
msgstr "Mahsulot qaytarilganda"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:405
msgid ""
"In the :ref:`above example table <inventory/avg_price/price-table>`, when "
"returning 1 product to a vendor purchased at `$10`, a company expects `$10` "
"in the **Accounts Payable** account from the vendor. However, **Stock "
"Input** account must be debited `$12` because the average cost is `$12` at "
"the time of the return. The missing `$2` is accounted for in "
"the :guilabel:`Price Difference Account`, which is set up in the "
"product's :guilabel:`Product Category`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Yuqoridagi misol jadvalida <inventory/avg_price/price-table>` `$10` ga "
"sotib olingan 1 ta mahsulot yetkazib beruvchiga qaytarilganda, kompaniya "
"yetkazib beruvchidan **Accounts Payable** hisobida `$10` kutadi. Biroq, "
"**Stock Input** hisobi `$12` ga debetlanishi kerak, chunki qaytarish vaqtida "
"o'rtacha tannarx `$12` ni tashkil etadi. Yetishmayotgan `$2` "
"mahsulotning :guilabel:`Product Category` bo'limida "
"sozlangan :guilabel:`Price Difference Account` hisobida hisobga olinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:412
msgid ""
"Behavior of *price difference accounts* varies from localization. In this "
"case, the account is intended to store differences between vendor price and "
"*automated* inventory valuation methods."
msgstr ""
"*Narx farqi hisoblari*ning xatti-harakati lokalizatsiyaga qarab farq qiladi. "
"Bu holatda hisob yetkazib beruvchi narxi va *avtomatlashtirilgan* "
"zaxiralarni baholash usullari o'rtasidagi farqlarni saqlash uchun "
"mo'ljallangan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:415
msgid "Summary:"
msgstr "Xulosa:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:417
msgid ""
"Debit **Stock Input** account `$10` to move the table from stock to stock "
"input. This move is to indicate that the table is to be processed for an "
"outgoing shipment."
msgstr ""
"Stolni zaxiradan zaxira kirimiga o'tkazish uchun **Stock Input** hisobini "
"`$10` ga debetlang. Ushbu harakat stol chiquvchi yuk jo'natmasi uchun qayta "
"ishlanishini bildiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:419
msgid ""
"Debit **Stock Input** an additional `$2` to account for the **Price "
"Difference**."
msgstr ""
"**Price Difference** ni hisobga olish uchun **Stock Input** hisobini "
"qo'shimcha `$2` ga debetlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:420
msgid "Credit **Stock Valuation** `$12` because the item is leaving the stock."
msgstr ""
"**Stock Valuation** hisobini `$12` ga kreditlang, chunki mahsulot zaxiradan "
"chiqmoqda."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:None
msgid "2 dollar difference expensed in Price Difference account."
msgstr "2 dollarlik farq Narx farqi hisobiga xarajat qilingan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:426
msgid "Once the vendor's refund is received,"
msgstr "Yetkazib beruvchining qaytarma to'lovi qabul qilingach,"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:428
msgid ""
"Credit **Stock Input** account `$10` to reconcile the price of the table."
msgstr ""
"Stol narxini solishtirish uchun **Stock Input** hisobini `$10` ga kreditlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:429
msgid ""
"Debit **Accounts Payable** `$10` to have the accountants collect and "
"register the payment in their journal."
msgstr ""
"Buxgalterlar to'lovni yig'ib, o'z jurnallarida ro'yxatga olishlari uchun "
"**Accounts Payable** hisobini `$10` ga debetlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:None
msgid "Return to get 10 dollars back."
msgstr "10 dollarni qaytarib olish uchun qaytarish."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:3
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/cheat_sheet.rst:79
