#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/cheat_sheet.rst:192
msgid ""
"Bank reconciliation is the matching of bank statement lines (provided by "
"your bank) with transactions recorded internally (payments to suppliers or "
"from customers). For each line in a bank statement, it can be:"
msgstr ""
"Bank solishtirmasi (rekonsiliatsiya) — bu bank ko'chirmasi qatorlarini "
"(bankingiz tomonidan taqdim etilgan) ichki qayd etilgan tranzaksiyalar "
"(yetkazib beruvchilarga yoki mijozlardan to'lovlar) bilan moslashtirishdir. "
"Bank ko'chirmasidagi har bir qator uchun quyidagilar bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/cheat_sheet.rst:196
msgid ""
"**matched with a previously recorded payment**: a payment is registered when "
"a check is received from a customer, then matched when checking the bank "
"statement."
msgstr ""
"**avval qayd etilgan to'lov bilan moslashtiriladi**: mijozdan chek olinganda "
"to'lov ro'yxatdan o'tkaziladi, so'ngra bank ko'chirmasi tekshirilganda "
"moslashtiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/cheat_sheet.rst:198
msgid ""
"**recorded as a new payment**: the payment's journal entry is created and "
"reconciled with the related invoice when processing the bank statement."
msgstr ""
"**yangi to'lov sifatida qayd etiladi**: bank ko'chirmasini qayta ishlash "
"vaqtida to'lovning jurnal yozuvi yaratiladi va tegishli hisob-faktura bilan "
"solishtiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/cheat_sheet.rst:200
msgid "**recorded as another transaction**: bank transfer, direct charge, etc."
msgstr ""
"**boshqa tranzaksiya sifatida qayd etiladi**: bank o'tkazmasi, to'g'ridan-"
"to'g'ri yechib olish va hokazo."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/cheat_sheet.rst:202
msgid ""
"Odoo should automatically reconcile most transactions; only a few should "
"need manual review. When the bank reconciliation process is finished, the "
"balance on the bank account in Odoo should match the bank statement's "
"balance."
msgstr ""
"Odoo ko'pchilik tranzaksiyalarni avtomatik ravishda solishtirishi kerak; "
"faqat ayrimlari qo'lda ko'rib chiqishni talab qilishi mumkin. Bank "
"solishtirmasi jarayoni tugagach, Odoo'dagi bank hisobi balansi bank "
"ko'chirmasidagi balansga mos kelishi kerak."

