#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/follow_up.rst:132
msgid ""
"To get a comprehensive overview of a customer's account status, click "
"the :guilabel:`Customer Statement` smart button on the customer's form. This "
"statement corresponds to the :ref:`Partner Ledger <accounting/invoices/"
"partner-ledger>` report's portion specific to that customer."
msgstr ""
"Mijoz hisobining holati haqida to'liq ma'lumot olish uchun mijoz "
"formasidagi :guilabel:`Customer Statement` smart tugmasini bosing. Ushbu "
"ko'chirma :ref:`Hamkorlar daftari <accounting/invoices/partner-ledger>` "
"hisobotining aynan shu mijozga tegishli qismiga mos keladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/follow_up.rst:136
msgid ""
"To send it to the customer, click :guilabel:`Send`, change "
"the :guilabel:`Email Template` if needed, and click :guilabel:`Print & Send`."
msgstr ""
"Uni mijozga yuborish uchun :guilabel:`Send` tugmasini bosing, kerak "
"bo'lsa :guilabel:`Email Template` maydonini o'zgartiring va :guilabel:`Print "
"& Send` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/follow_up.rst:139
msgid ""
"To view the customer statements for multiple customers at once, select the "
"customers from the :guilabel:`Customers` list view, click :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)`, and select :guilabel:`Open Customer Statements`."
msgstr ""
"Bir vaqtning o'zida bir nechta mijozlarning ko'chirmalarini ko'rish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Customers` ro'yxat ko'rinishidan mijozlarni "
"tanlang, :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` tugmasini bosing "
"va :guilabel:`Open Customer Statements` bandini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/follow_up.rst:143
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/follow_up.rst:159
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:160
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:223
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`PDF` or :guilabel:`XLSX` to generate a PDF or XLSX file, "
"respectively."
msgstr ""
"Mos ravishda PDF yoki XLSX fayl yaratish uchun :guilabel:`PDF` "
"yoki :guilabel:`XLSX` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/follow_up.rst:148
msgid "Follow-up report"
msgstr "Eslatma hisoboti"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/follow_up.rst:150
msgid ""
"To get a complete overview of a customer's due invoices, separating those "
"that are due from those that are overdue, click the :ref:`Customer Statement "
"<accounting/follow_up/customer-statement>` smart button on the customer's "
"form. Then, click :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Report: Customer Statement` and "
"select :guilabel:`Follow-Up Report`."
msgstr ""
"Mijozning to'lanishi kerak bo'lgan hisob-fakturalari haqida to'liq ma'lumot "
"olish, muddati kelganlarini muddati o'tganlaridan ajratgan holda ko'rish "
"uchun mijoz formasidagi :ref:`Mijoz ko'chirmasi <accounting/follow_up/"
"customer-statement>` smart tugmasini bosing. So'ngra, :icon:`fa-"
"book` :guilabel:`Report: Customer Statement` tugmasini bosing "
"va :guilabel:`Follow-Up Report` bandini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/follow_up.rst:155
msgid ""
"To view the follow-up report for all customers at once, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Partner Ledger`. Then, "
"click :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Report:` and select :guilabel:`Follow-Up "
"Report`."
msgstr ""
"Barcha mijozlar uchun eslatma hisobotini bir vaqtning o'zida ko'rish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Partner Ledger` yo'lidan "
"o'ting. So'ngra, :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Report:` tugmasini bosing "
"va :guilabel:`Follow-Up Report` bandini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/online.rst:5
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:796
#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:5
msgid "Online payments"
msgstr "Onlayn to'lovlar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/online.rst:7
msgid ""
"To make it more convenient for your customers to pay the invoices you issue, "
"you can activate the **Invoice Online Payment** feature, which adds a *Pay "
"Now* button on their **Customer Portal**. This allows your customers to see "
"their invoices online and pay directly with their favorite payment method, "
"making the payment process much easier."
msgstr ""
"Mijozlaringizga siz taqdim etgan hisob-fakturalarni to'lashni qulayroq "
"qilish uchun **Invoice Online Payment** funksiyasini faollashtirishingiz "
"mumkin, u mijozlarning **Customer Portal** sahifasiga *Pay Now* tugmasini "
"qo'shadi. Bu mijozlaringizga hisob-fakturalarini onlayn ko'rish va o'zlari "
"yoqtirgan to'lov usuli bilan to'g'ridan-to'g'ri to'lash imkonini beradi, "
"natijada to'lov jarayoni ancha osonlashadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/online.rst:None
msgid "Payment provider choice after having clicked on \"Pay Now\""
msgstr "\"Pay Now\" tugmasi bosilgandan keyin to'lov provayderini tanlash"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/online.rst:19
msgid ""
"Make sure your :doc:`payment providers are correctly configured <../../"
"payment_providers>`."
msgstr ""
":doc:`To'lov provayderlaringiz to'g'ri sozlanganligiga <../../"
"payment_providers>` ishonch hosil qiling."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/online.rst:22
msgid ""
"By default, :ref:`Wire Transfer <payment_providers/bank_payments/"
"wire_transfer>` is the only payment provider activated, but you still have "
"to fill out the payment details."
msgstr ""
"Standart holatda :ref:`Bank o'tkazmasi <payment_providers/bank_payments/"
"wire_transfer>` yagona faollashtirilgan to'lov provayderi hisoblanadi, ammo "
"siz baribir to'lov tafsilotlarini to'ldirishingiz kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/online.rst:25
msgid ""
"To activate the Invoice Online Payment, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Settings --> Customer Payments`, enable **Invoice Online "
"Payment**, and click on *Save*."
msgstr ""
"Hisob-fakturani onlayn to'lash funksiyasini faollashtirish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings --> Customer "
"Payments` yo'lidan o'ting, **Invoice Online Payment** funksiyasini yoqing va "
"*Save* tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/online.rst:29
msgid "Customer Portal"
msgstr "Mijoz portali"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/online.rst:31
msgid ""
"After issuing the invoice, click on :guilabel:`Send` and send the invoice by "
"email to the customer. They will receive an email with a link that redirects "
"them to the invoice on their **Customer Portal**."
msgstr ""
"Hisob-fakturani taqdim etgandan so'ng, :guilabel:`Send` tugmasini bosing va "
"hisob-fakturani mijozga elektron pochta orqali yuboring. Ular o'zlarining "
"**Customer Portal** sahifasidagi hisob-fakturaga yo'naltiruvchi havolali "
"elektron xat oladilar."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/online.rst:None
msgid "Email with a link to view the invoice online on the Customer Portal."
msgstr ""
"Mijoz portalida hisob-fakturani onlayn ko'rish uchun havolali elektron xat."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/online.rst:38
msgid "They can choose which Payment Provider to use by clicking on *Pay Now*."
msgstr ""
"Ular *Pay Now* tugmasini bosish orqali qaysi to'lov provayderidan "
"foydalanishni tanlashlari mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/online.rst:None
msgid "\"Pay now\" button on an invoice in the Customer Portal."
msgstr "Mijoz portalidagi hisob-fakturada \"Pay now\" tugmasi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/online.rst:45
msgid ":doc:`/applications/finance/payment_providers`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/finance/payment_providers`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:3
msgid "Pay by checks"
msgstr "Chek orqali to'lash"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:5
msgid ""
"Once you decide to pay a supplier bill, you can select to pay by check. You "
"can then print all the payments registered by check. Finally, the bank "
"reconciliation process will match the checks you sent to suppliers with "
"actual bank statements."
msgstr ""
"Yetkazib beruvchi hisobini to'lashga qaror qilganingizdan so'ng, chek orqali "
"to'lashni tanlashingiz mumkin. Keyin chek orqali ro'yxatga olingan barcha "
"to'lovlarni chop etishingiz mumkin. Nihoyat, bank solishtirmasi "
"(rekonsiliatsiya) jarayoni siz yetkazib beruvchilarga yuborgan cheklarni "
"haqiqiy bank ko'chirmalari bilan moslashtiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:15
msgid "Activate checks payment methods"
msgstr "Chek to'lov usullarini faollashtirish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:17
msgid ""
"To activate the checks payment method, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, and scroll down to the :guilabel:`Vendor "
"Payments` section. There, you can activate the payment method as well as set "
"up the :guilabel:`Check Layout`."
msgstr ""
"Chek to'lov usulini faollashtirish uchun :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Settings` yo'lidan o'ting va :guilabel:`Vendor Payments` "
"bo'limigacha pastga aylantiring. U yerda to'lov usulini faollashtirishingiz "
"hamda :guilabel:`Check Layout` sozlamasini o'rnatishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:22
msgid ""
"Once the :guilabel:`Checks` setting is activated, the **Checks** payment "
"method is automatically set up in the :guilabel:`Outgoing Payments` tabs of "
"**bank** journals."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Checks` sozlamasi faollashtirilgandan so'ng, **Checks** to'lov "
"usuli **bank** jurnallarining :guilabel:`Outgoing Payments` varaqlarida "
"avtomatik ravishda o'rnatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:24
msgid ""
"Some countries require specific modules to print checks; such modules may be "
"installed by default. For instance, the :ref:`US Checks Layout module "
"<l10n_us/optional-modules>` is required to :ref:`print US checks <l10n_us/"
"writing-checks>`."
msgstr ""
"Ba'zi mamlakatlar cheklarni chop etish uchun maxsus modullarni talab qiladi; "
"bunday modullar standart holatda o'rnatilgan bo'lishi mumkin. "
"Masalan, :ref:`AQSH cheklarini chop etish <l10n_us/writing-checks>` "
"uchun :ref:`US Checks Layout moduli <l10n_us/optional-modules>` talab "
"qilinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:31
msgid "Pay a supplier bill with a check"
msgstr "Yetkazib beruvchi hisobini chek bilan to'lash"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:33
msgid "Paying a supplier with a check is done in three steps:"
msgstr ""
"Yetkazib beruvchiga chek bilan to'lash uch bosqichda amalga oshiriladi:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:35
msgid "registering a payment"
msgstr "to'lovni ro'yxatga olish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/pay_checks.rst:36
