msgstr ":guilabel:`Return on investment (per annum)`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:73
msgid ""
"The ratio of the net profit to the amount of assets the company used to make "
"those profits."
msgstr ""
"Sof foydaning kompaniya ushbu foydani olish uchun ishlatgan aktivlar "
"miqdoriga nisbati."

