msgstr ""
"O'zgarmaslik funksiyalarini istalgan jurnalda :ref:`o'tkazilgan yozuvlarni "
"xesh bilan himoyalash <data-inalterability/restricted>` opsiyasini "
"faollashtirish yoki :ref:`yozuvlarni himoyalash ustasi <data-inalterability/"
"wizard>` yordamida yoqish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/data_inalterability.rst:36
msgid ""
"Two indicators are added to the journal entry's form view. They show whether "
"the entry is secured or not."
msgstr ""
