"(masalan, bog'liq hamkorlar, bitta kompaniya ichidagi bo'linmalar va "
"h.k.), :doc:`ota va bola turidagi kontaktlardan <../../../essentials/"
"contacts>` foydalanishni ko'rib chiqing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:33
msgid "Tax return periodicity"
msgstr "Soliq deklaratsiyasi davriyligi"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:35
msgid ""
"The configuration of the tax return periodicity allows Odoo to compute tax "
"returns correctly and automatically send reminders to make sure that "
"deadlines are met."
msgstr ""
"Soliq deklaratsiyasi davriyligini sozlash Odoo'ga soliq deklaratsiyalarini "
"to'g'ri hisoblash va muddatlarga rioya qilinishini ta'minlash uchun "
"eslatmalarni avtomatik yuborish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:38
msgid ""
