msgstr ""
"Soliqni :doc:`soliq pozitsiyalariga <taxes/fiscal_positions>` muvofiq boshqa "
"soliqlarni :ref:`almashtirish <taxes/tax-mapping>` uchun qanday sozlash."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:187
msgid ""
"To open a tax's configuration, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Taxes`, then click the tax name."
msgstr ""
"Soliq konfiguratsiyasini ochish uchun :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Taxes` yo'lidan o'ting, so'ngra soliq nomini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:193
