"bo'lsa, ushbu modullarni alohida o'rnating: mos ravishda :guilabel:`Avatax "
"for geo localization` va :guilabel:`Amazon/Avatax Bridge` "
"modullarida :guilabel:`Install` tugmasini bosing."

