":guilabel:`Cust/vendor code`: Odoo'dagi mijoz/yetkazib beruvchi kodi "
"(masalan, `Contact18`)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:110
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Currency`: the standardized abbreviation for the currency the "
"amount total is in."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Currency`: umumiy summa ifodalangan valyutaning standart "
"qisqartmasi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:111
msgid ":guilabel:`Doc date`: the document's date of creation."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Doc date`: hujjatning yaratilgan sanasi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:112
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Doc status`: any of the following "
"options, :guilabel:`All`, :guilabel:`Voided`, :guilabel:`Committed`, :guilabel:`Uncommitted`, "
"or :guilabel:`Locked`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Doc status`: quyidagi variantlardan istalgan "
"biri: :guilabel:`All`, :guilabel:`Voided`, :guilabel:`Committed`, :guilabel:`Uncommitted` "
"yoki :guilabel:`Locked`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:114
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Doc type`: any of the following "
"selections, :guilabel:`All`, :guilabel:`Sales Invoice`, :guilabel:`Purchase "
"Invoice`, :guilabel:`Return Invoice`, :guilabel:`Inventory Transfer Inbound "
"Invoice`, :guilabel:`Inventory Transfer Outbound Invoice`, "
"or :guilabel:`Customs Invoice`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Doc type`: quyidagi tanlovlardan istalgan "
"biri: :guilabel:`All`, :guilabel:`Sales Invoice`, :guilabel:`Purchase "
"Invoice`, :guilabel:`Return Invoice`, :guilabel:`Inventory Transfer Inbound "
"Invoice`, :guilabel:`Inventory Transfer Outbound Invoice` "
"yoki :guilabel:`Customs Invoice`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:119
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Last modified`: timestamp of the last time the document was "
"modified."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Last modified`: hujjat oxirgi marta o'zgartirilgan vaqt belgisi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:120
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Location code`: the location code used to calculate the tax, "
"based on the delivery address."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Location code`: yetkazib berish manziliga asoslanib, soliqni "
"hisoblash uchun ishlatiladigan joylashuv kodi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:122
msgid ":guilabel:`PO number`: the purchase order number."
msgstr ":guilabel:`PO number`: xarid buyurtmasi raqami."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:123
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reference code`: the Odoo reference code (e.g. NV/2024/00003)"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Reference code`: Odoo mos yozuvlar kodi (masalan, NV/2024/00003)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:124
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Region`: the region of the country,which varies based on "
"the :guilabel:`Country` selection."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Region`: mamlakat mintaqasi bo'lib, u :guilabel:`Country` "
"tanloviga qarab o'zgaradi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:126
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Salesperson code`: the numeric ID of the user assigned to the "
"sales order in Odoo."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Salesperson code`: Odoo'da sotuv buyurtmasiga tayinlangan "
"foydalanuvchining raqamli identifikatori."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:127
msgid ":guilabel:`Tax date`: the month/day/year of the tax calculation."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Tax date`: soliq hisob-kitobining oy/kun/yil sanasi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:128
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax override type`: where an exemption would appear, should there "
"be none, the field populates with :guilabel:`None`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tax override type`: imtiyoz ko'rsatiladigan joy; agar imtiyoz "
"bo'lmasa, maydon :guilabel:`None` qiymati bilan to'ldiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:131
msgid "To add a new column click the :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Column`."
msgstr ""
"Yangi ustun qo'shish uchun :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Column` tugmasini "
"bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:134
msgid ""
"For more information on *AvaTax* transactions, refer to this Avalara "
"documentation: `Transactions <https://community.avalara.com/support/s/"
"document-item?"
"language=en_US&bundleId=qvv1656594440497&topicId=transactions.html&_LANG=enus>`_."
msgstr ""
"*AvaTax* tranzaksiyalari haqida ko'proq ma'lumot olish uchun ushbu Avalara "
"hujjatlariga murojaat qiling: `Transactions <https://community.avalara.com/"
"support/s/document-item?"
"language=en_US&bundleId=qvv1656594440497&topicId=transactions.html&_LANG=enus>`_."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:138
msgid "Import-export"
msgstr "Import-eksport"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:140
msgid ""
"While on the :ref:`avalara/portal-transactions`, click :icon:`fa-"
"download` :guilabel:`Import transactions` or :icon:`fa-"
"upload` :guilabel:`Export transactions` to import or export transactions."
msgstr ""
":ref:`avalara/portal-transactions` sahifasida turib, tranzaksiyalarni import "
"yoki eksport qilish uchun :icon:`fa-download` :guilabel:`Import "
"transactions` yoki :icon:`fa-upload` :guilabel:`Export transactions` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:146
msgid ""
"To access reporting, navigate to the :menuselection:`Reports` link in the "
"top menu of the Avalara management console. Next, select from one of the "
"available reporting tabs: :guilabel:`Transactions "
"reports`, :guilabel:`Liability & tax return reports`, "
"or :guilabel:`Exemption reports`."
msgstr ""
"Hisobotlarga kirish uchun Avalara boshqaruv konsolining yuqori "
"menyusidagi :menuselection:`Reports` havolasi yo'lidan o'ting. Keyin mavjud "
"hisobot varaqlaridan birini tanlang: :guilabel:`Transactions "
"reports`, :guilabel:`Liability & tax return reports` "
"yoki :guilabel:`Exemption reports`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:151
msgid ""
"Additionally, there is a :guilabel:`Favorites` tab and :guilabel:`Downloads` "
"tab. The :guilabel:`Favorites` tab contains any favorited report "
"configurations for the Avalara user. The :guilabel:`Downloads` tab contains "
"a list view where the user can download the high-volume transaction reports "
"created in the last 30 days."
msgstr ""
"Bundan tashqari, :guilabel:`Favorites` varag'i va :guilabel:`Downloads` "
"varag'i mavjud. :guilabel:`Favorites` varag'ida Avalara foydalanuvchisi "
"uchun sevimlilarga qo'shilgan hisobot konfiguratsiyalari "
"joylashgan. :guilabel:`Downloads` varag'ida foydalanuvchi oxirgi 30 kun "
"ichida yaratilgan katta hajmdagi tranzaksiya hisobotlarini yuklab olishi "
"mumkin bo'lgan ro'yxat ko'rinishi mavjud."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:156
msgid ""
"Make a selection for the :guilabel:`Report Category`, and "
"the :guilabel:`Report Name`, under the :guilabel:`Select a report` section."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Select a report` bo'limida :guilabel:`Report Category` "
"va :guilabel:`Report Name` uchun tanlov qiling."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:159
msgid ""
"Next, fill out the :guilabel:`Select report details` section. These options "
"will vary based on the tab selected above."
msgstr ""
"Keyin :guilabel:`Select report details` bo'limini to'ldiring. Ushbu "
"opsiyalar yuqorida tanlangan varaqqa qarab o'zgaradi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:162
msgid ""
"Depending on the report size, the following two options are available in the "
"section labeled, :guilabel:`Select the approximate number of transactions "
"for your report`: :guilabel:`Create and download the report instantly` (for "
"small reports) and :guilabel:`Create and download the report in the "
"background` (for larger reports). Select one or the other depending on the "
"volume of transactions in this report."
msgstr ""
"Hisobot hajmiga qarab, :guilabel:`Select the approximate number of "
"transactions for your report` deb nomlangan bo'limda quyidagi ikki variant "
"mavjud: :guilabel:`Create and download the report instantly` (kichik "
"hisobotlar uchun) va :guilabel:`Create and download the report in the "
"background` (kattaroq hisobotlar uchun). Ushbu hisobotdagi tranzaksiyalar "
"hajmiga qarab birini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:168
msgid ""
"Finally, under the section labeled, :guilabel:`Report preview and export` "
"make a selection of the file type to download. Either a :guilabel:`.PDF` "
"or :guilabel:`.XLS` can be chosen. Alternatively, the file can be previewed "
"by selecting the :guilabel:`Preview` option."
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, :guilabel:`Report preview and export` deb nomlangan bo'limda yuklab "
"olinadigan fayl turini tanlang. :guilabel:`.PDF` yoki :guilabel:`.XLS` "
"tanlanishi mumkin. Muqobil ravishda, faylni :guilabel:`Preview` opsiyasini "
"tanlash orqali oldindan ko'rish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:172
msgid ""
"After making all the configurations, click :guilabel:`Create report` to "
"download the report. Click :icon:`fa-star-o` :guilabel:`Make this report a "
"favorite` to save the report configuration to the user's favorites."
msgstr ""
"Barcha sozlamalarni bajargandan so'ng, hisobotni yuklab olish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Create report` tugmasini bosing. Hisobot konfiguratsiyasini "
"foydalanuvchining sevimlilariga saqlash uchun :icon:`fa-star-"
"o` :guilabel:`Make this report a favorite` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:176
msgid ""
"After the report is created, click :icon:`fa-download` :guilabel:`Download` "
"to download the file to the device."
msgstr ""
"Hisobot yaratilgandan so'ng, faylni qurilmaga yuklab olish uchun :icon:`fa-"
"download` :guilabel:`Download` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:180
msgid ""
"Select a pre-configured report from the :guilabel:`Frequently used reports` "
"section of the reporting dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Hisobot boshqaruv panelining :guilabel:`Frequently used reports` bo'limidan "
"oldindan sozlangan hisobotni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:183
msgid ""
"Access this list by clicking on the :guilabel:`Reports` option in the top "
"menu of the Avalara management console, and scroll to the bottom of the page."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu ro'yxatga kirish uchun Avalara boshqaruv konsolining yuqori "
"menyusidagi :guilabel:`Reports` opsiyasini bosing va sahifaning pastki "
"qismiga o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:187
msgid ""
"`See Avalara's documentation: Reports in AvaTax <https://"
"community.avalara.com/support/s/document-item?"
"language=en_US&bundleId=rjq1671176624730&topicId=Reports_in_AvaTax.html&_LANG=enus>`_."
msgstr ""
"`Avalara hujjatlariga qarang: Reports in AvaTax <https://"
"community.avalara.com/support/s/document-item?"
"language=en_US&bundleId=rjq1671176624730&topicId=Reports_in_AvaTax.html&_LANG=enus>`_."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:191
msgid "Add more jurisdictions"
msgstr "Ko'proq yurisdiksiyalar qo'shish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:193
msgid ""
"Additional jurisdictions (tax locations) can be added in the Avalara "
"management console. Navigate to either Avalara's `sandbox <https://"
"sandbox.admin.avalara.com/>`_ or `production <https://admin.avalara.com/>`_ "
"environment. This will depend on which type of account was set in "
"the :doc:`integration <../avatax>`."
msgstr ""
"Qo'shimcha yurisdiksiyalarni (soliq joylashuvlarini) Avalara boshqaruv "
"konsolida qo'shish mumkin. Avalara'ning `sandbox <https://"
"sandbox.admin.avalara.com/>`_ yoki `production <https://admin.avalara.com/"
">`_ muhitiga o'ting. Bu :doc:`integratsiyada <../avatax>` qanday turdagi "
"hisob o'rnatilganiga bog'liq bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:198
msgid ""
"Next, navigate to :menuselection:`Settings --> Where you collect tax`. "
"Choose between the three different tabs, depending on the business need. The "
"first tab is :guilabel:`Sales and use tax`, where tax can be collected for "
"the United States. Click the :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Add to where you "
"collect sales and use tax` to add another location where the company "
"collects sales and use tax."
msgstr ""
"Keyin :menuselection:`Settings --> Where you collect tax` yo'lidan o'ting. "
"Biznes ehtiyojiga qarab uchta turli varaqdan birini tanlang. Birinchi "
"varaq :guilabel:`Sales and use tax` bo'lib, u yerda Qo'shma Shtatlar uchun "
"soliq yig'ish mumkin. Kompaniya sotuv va foydalanish solig'ini yig'adigan "
"yana bir joyni qo'shish uchun :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Add to where you "
"collect sales and use tax` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:203
msgid ""
"The second option, is the :guilabel:`VAT/GST` tab where the :icon:`fa-"
"plus` :guilabel:`Add a country or territory where you collect VAT/GST` can "
"be selected to add another country or territory where the company collects "
"VAT/GST."
msgstr ""
"Ikkinchi variant — :guilabel:`VAT/GST` varag'i bo'lib, u yerda kompaniya QQS/"
"GST yig'adigan yana bir mamlakat yoki hududni qo'shish uchun :icon:`fa-"
"plus` :guilabel:`Add a country or territory where you collect VAT/GST` "
"tanlanishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:207
msgid ""
"Finally, on the far-right, is the :guilabel:`Customs duty` tab, where a "
"country can be added where the company collects customs duty. Simply click "
"on the :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Add a country where you calculate customs "
"duty` icon below the tab."
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, eng o'ng tomonda :guilabel:`Customs duty` varag'i joylashgan "
"bo'lib, u yerda kompaniya bojxona to'lovini yig'adigan mamlakatni qo'shish "
"mumkin. Buning uchun varaq ostidagi :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Add a country "
"where you calculate customs duty` belgisini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:None
msgid ""
"AvaTax management console, on the Where you collect tax page, with the add "
"button and\n"
"sales and use tax tab highlighted."
msgstr ""
"AvaTax boshqaruv konsoli, Where you collect tax sahifasida, qo'shish tugmasi "
"va\n"
"sotuv va foydalanish solig'i varag'i ajratib ko'rsatilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:217
msgid ""
"`See Avalara's documentation: Add local jurisdiction taxes <https://"
"community.avalara.com/support/s/document-item?"
"language=en_US&bundleId=bla1700809896571_bla1700809896571&topicId=nbw1698727575499.html&_LANG=enus>`_."
msgstr ""
"`Avalara hujjatlariga qarang: Add local jurisdiction taxes <https://"
"community.avalara.com/support/s/document-item?"
"language=en_US&bundleId=bla1700809896571_bla1700809896571&topicId=nbw1698727575499.html&_LANG=enus>`_."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:221
msgid "Tax exemption certificate"
msgstr "Soliqdan ozod qilish sertifikati"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:223
msgid ""
"Tax exemption certificates for customers can be added into the Avalara "
"management console, so that *AvaTax* is aware of which customers may be "
"exempt from paying certain taxes. To add an *exception certificate* navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Exemptions --> Customer certificates`. From there, click "
"on the :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Add a certificate` to configure an "
"exemption."
msgstr ""
"Mijozlar uchun soliqdan ozod qilish sertifikatlarini Avalara boshqaruv "
"konsoliga qo'shish mumkin, shunda *AvaTax* qaysi mijozlar ma'lum soliqlarni "
"to'lashdan ozod qilinishi mumkinligini biladi. *Istisno sertifikatini* "
"qo'shish uchun :menuselection:`Exemptions --> Customer certificates` "
"yo'lidan o'ting. U yerdan ozod qilishni sozlash uchun :icon:`fa-"
"plus` :guilabel:`Add a certificate` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:229
msgid ""
"An Avalara subscription to Exemption Certificate Management (ECM) is "
"required in order to attach certificate images, and to be ready for an "
"audit. For more on subscribing to this add-on, visit `Avalara <https://"
"community.avalara.com/support/s/document-item?"
"language=en_US&bundleId=hff1682048150115_hff1682048150115&topicId=fol1682356576230.html&_LANG=enus>`_."
msgstr ""
"Sertifikat rasmlarini biriktirish va auditga tayyor bo'lish uchun "
"Avalara'ning Exemption Certificate Management (ECM) obunasi talab qilinadi. "
"Ushbu qo'shimchaga obuna bo'lish haqida ko'proq ma'lumot olish uchun "
"`Avalara <https://community.avalara.com/support/s/document-item?"
"language=en_US&bundleId=hff1682048150115_hff1682048150115&topicId=fol1682356576230.html&_LANG=enus>`_ "
"sahifasiga tashrif buyuring."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:235
msgid "End-of-year operations"
msgstr "Yil oxiri operatsiyalari"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:237
msgid ""
"Avalara's services include tax return services, for when it is time to file "
"taxes at the end of the year. To access Avalara's tax services log, into the "
"`management portal <https://admin.avalara.com/>`_. Then, from the main "
"dashboard, click :guilabel:`Returns`. Avalara will prompt the Avalara user "
"to log in for security purposes, and redirect the user to the *Returns* "
"portal."
msgstr ""
"Avalara xizmatlari yil oxirida soliq topshirish vaqti kelganda soliq "
"deklaratsiyasi xizmatlarini o'z ichiga oladi. Avalara'ning soliq "
"xizmatlariga kirish uchun `boshqaruv portaliga <https://admin.avalara.com/"
">`_ kiring. Keyin asosiy boshqaruv panelidan :guilabel:`Returns` tugmasini "
"bosing. Avalara xavfsizlik maqsadida Avalara foydalanuvchisidan tizimga "
"kirishni so'raydi va foydalanuvchini *Returns* portaliga yo'naltiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:None
msgid "Avalara portal with the returns shortcut highlighted."
msgstr "Avalara portali, deklaratsiyalar yorlig'i ajratib ko'rsatilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:247
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Get started` to begin the tax return process. For more "
"information, refer to this Avalara documentation: `About Managed Returns "
"<https://community.avalara.com/support/s/document-item?"
"language=en_US&bundleId=hps1656397152776_hps1656397152776&topicId=Learn_about_Managed_Returns.html&_LANG=enus>`_."
msgstr ""
"Soliq deklaratsiyasi jarayonini boshlash uchun :guilabel:`Get started` "
"tugmasini bosing. Ko'proq ma'lumot olish uchun ushbu Avalara hujjatlariga "
"murojaat qiling: `About Managed Returns <https://community.avalara.com/"
"support/s/document-item?"
"language=en_US&bundleId=hps1656397152776_hps1656397152776&topicId=Learn_about_Managed_Returns.html&_LANG=enus>`_."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:252
msgid ""
"Alternatively, click on the :menuselection:`Returns` button in the top menu "
"of the Avalara management console."
msgstr ""
"Muqobil ravishda, Avalara boshqaruv konsolining yuqori "
"menyusidagi :menuselection:`Returns` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:256
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:163
msgid ":doc:`../avatax`"
msgstr ":doc:`../avatax`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avalara_portal.rst:257
msgid ":doc:`avatax_use`"
msgstr ":doc:`avatax_use`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:3
msgid "AvaTax use"
msgstr "AvaTax'dan foydalanish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:5
msgid ""
"AvaTax is a tax calculation software that can be integrated with Odoo in the "
"United States and Canada. Once the :doc:`integration setup <../avatax>` is "
"complete, the calculated tax is simple and automatic."
msgstr ""
"AvaTax — bu Qo'shma Shtatlar va Kanadada Odoo bilan integratsiya qilinishi "
"mumkin bo'lgan soliq hisoblash dasturi. :doc:`Integratsiya sozlamasi <../"
"avatax>` tugallangandan so'ng, soliq hisoblash oddiy va avtomatik tarzda "
"amalga oshiriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:12
msgid "Tax calculation"
msgstr "Soliq hisoblash"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:14
msgid ""
"Automatically calculate taxes on Odoo quotations and invoices with AvaTax by "
"confirming the documents during the sales flow. Alternatively, calculate the "
"taxes manually by clicking the :guilabel:`Compute Taxes` button, while these "
"documents are in draft stage."
msgstr ""
"Sotuv jarayonida hujjatlarni tasdiqlash orqali Odoo takliflari va hisob-"
"fakturalaridagi soliqlarni AvaTax bilan avtomatik hisoblang. Muqobil "
"ravishda, ushbu hujjatlar qoralama bosqichida bo'lganida :guilabel:`Compute "
"Taxes` tugmasini bosish orqali soliqlarni qo'lda hisoblang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:19
msgid ""
"Clicking the :guilabel:`Compute Taxes` button recalculates taxes, if any "
"product lines are edited on the invoice."
msgstr ""
"Agar hisob-fakturada biror mahsulot qatori tahrirlangan "
"bo'lsa, :guilabel:`Compute Taxes` tugmasini bosish soliqlarni qayta "
"hisoblaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:None
msgid "Sales quotation with the confirm and compute taxes button highlighted."
msgstr ""
"Sotuv taklifi, tasdiqlash va soliqlarni hisoblash tugmalari ajratib "
"ko'rsatilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:26
msgid ""
"The tax calculation is triggered during the following :ref:`automatic "
"trigger <avatax/automatic-triggers>` and :ref:`manual trigger <avatax/manual-"
"triggers>` circumstances."
msgstr ""
"Soliq hisoblash quyidagi :ref:`avtomatik trigger <avatax/automatic-"
"triggers>` va :ref:`qo'lda trigger <avatax/manual-triggers>` holatlarida "
"ishga tushadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:32
msgid "Automatic triggers"
msgstr "Avtomatik triggerlar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:34
msgid ""
"When the sales rep sends the quote by email with :guilabel:`Send by email` "
"button (pop-up)."
msgstr ""
"Sotuv vakili taklifnomani :guilabel:`Send by email` tugmasi (qalqib "
"chiquvchi oyna) orqali elektron pochta bilan yuborganda."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:35
msgid "When the customer views the online quote on the portal."
msgstr "Mijoz portalda onlayn taklifnomani ko'rganda."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:36
msgid "When a quote is confirmed and becomes a sales order."
msgstr "Taklifnoma tasdiqlanib, sotuv buyurtmasiga aylanganda."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:37
msgid "When the customer views the invoice on the portal."
msgstr "Mijoz portalda hisob-fakturani ko'rganda."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:38
msgid "When a draft invoice is validated."
msgstr "Qoralama hisob-faktura tasdiqlanganda."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:39
msgid "When the customer views the subscription in the portal."
msgstr "Mijoz portalda obunani ko'rganda."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:40
msgid "When a subscription generates an invoice."
msgstr "Obuna hisob-faktura yaratganda."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:41
msgid "When the customer gets to the last screen of the eCommerce checkout."
msgstr ""
"Mijoz eCommerce buyurtmani rasmiylashtirishning oxirgi ekraniga yetganda."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:46
msgid "Manual triggers"
msgstr "Qo'lda ishga tushiriladigan triggerlar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:48
msgid ":guilabel:`Compute Taxes` button at the bottom of the quote."
msgstr "Taklifnomaning pastki qismidagi :guilabel:`Compute Taxes` tugmasi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:49
msgid ":guilabel:`Compute Taxes` button at the top of the invoice."
msgstr "Hisob-fakturaning yuqori qismidagi :guilabel:`Compute Taxes` tugmasi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:51
msgid "Use each of these buttons to manually re-calculate the sales tax."
msgstr ""
"Sotuv solig'ini qo'lda qayta hisoblash uchun ushbu tugmalarning har biridan "
"foydalaning."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:54
msgid ""
"Use the :guilabel:`Avalara Partner Code` field that is available on customer "
"records, quotations, and invoices to cross-reference data in Odoo and "
"AvaTax. This field is located under the :menuselection:`Other info` tab of "
"the sales order or quotation in the :guilabel:`Sales` section."
msgstr ""
"Odoo va AvaTax'dagi ma'lumotlarni o'zaro solishtirish uchun mijoz yozuvlari, "
"taklifnomalar va hisob-fakturalarda mavjud bo'lgan :guilabel:`Avalara "
"Partner Code` maydonidan foydalaning. Ushbu maydon sotuv buyurtmasi yoki "
"taklifnomaning :menuselection:`Other info` varag'idagi :guilabel:`Sales` "
"bo'limida joylashgan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:58
msgid ""
"On the customer record, navigate to *Contacts app* and select a contact. "
"Then open the :guilabel:`Sales & Purchase` tab and the :guilabel:`Avalara "
"Partner Code` under the :guilabel:`Sales` section."
msgstr ""
"Mijoz yozuvida *Contacts app* ilovasiga o'ting va kontaktni tanlang. "
"So'ngra :guilabel:`Sales & Purchase` varag'ini va :guilabel:`Sales` "
"bo'limidagi :guilabel:`Avalara Partner Code` maydonini oching."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:63
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Automatic Tax Mapping (AvaTax)` fiscal position is also "
"applied on those Odoo documents, like subscriptions."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Automatic Tax Mapping (AvaTax)` soliq pozitsiyasi obunalar kabi "
"ushbu Odoo hujjatlariga ham qo'llaniladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:67
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:167
msgid ":doc:`../fiscal_positions`"
msgstr ":doc:`../fiscal_positions`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:70
msgid "AvaTax synchronization"
msgstr "AvaTax sinxronizatsiyasi"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:72
msgid ""
"Synchronization occurs with AvaTax, when the *invoice* is created in Odoo. "
"This means the sales tax is recorded with Avalara (AvaTax software "
"developer)."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'da *hisob-faktura* yaratilganda AvaTax bilan sinxronizatsiya amalga "
"oshiriladi. Bu sotuv solig'i Avalara'da (AvaTax dasturiy ta'minotini ishlab "
"chiquvchi) qayd etilishini anglatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:75
msgid ""
"To do so, navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Orders --> Quotations`. "
"Select a quotation from the list."
msgstr ""
"Buning uchun :menuselection:`Sales app --> Orders --> Quotations` yo'lidan "
"o'ting. Ro'yxatdan taklifnomani tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:78
msgid ""
"After confirming a quotation and validating the delivery, "
"click :guilabel:`Create Invoice`. Indicate whether it is "
"a :guilabel:`Regular invoice`, :guilabel:`Down payment (percentage)`, "
"or :guilabel:`Down payment (fixed amount)`."
msgstr ""
"Taklifnomani tasdiqlab, yetkazib berishni tasdiqlagandan "
"so'ng, :guilabel:`Create Invoice` tugmasini bosing. Bu :guilabel:`Regular "
"invoice`, :guilabel:`Down payment (percentage)` yoki :guilabel:`Down payment "
"(fixed amount)` ekanligini ko'rsating."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:82
msgid ""
"Then click :guilabel:`Create and view invoice`. The recorded taxes can be "
"seen in the :guilabel:`Journal Items` tab of the invoice. There will be "
"different taxes depending on the location of the :guilabel:`Delivery "
"Address`."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra :guilabel:`Create and view invoice` tugmasini bosing. Qayd etilgan "
"soliqlarni hisob-fakturaning :guilabel:`Journal Items` varag'ida ko'rish "
"mumkin. :guilabel:`Delivery Address` joylashuviga qarab turli soliqlar "
"bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:None
msgid "Journal items highlighted on a invoice in Odoo."
msgstr "Odoo'da hisob-fakturada ajratib ko'rsatilgan jurnal elementlari."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:90
msgid ""
"Finally, press the :guilabel:`Confirm` button to complete the invoice and "
"synchronize with the AvaTax portal."
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, hisob-fakturani yakunlash va AvaTax portali bilan sinxronlash "
"uchun :guilabel:`Confirm` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:94
msgid ""
"An invoice cannot be :guilabel:`Reset to draft` because this causes de-"
"synchronization with the AvaTax Portal. Instead, click :guilabel:`Add credit "
"note` and state: `Sync with AvaTax Portal`. See this "
"documentation: :doc:`../../../accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes`."
msgstr ""
"Hisob-fakturani :guilabel:`Reset to draft` holatiga qaytarib bo'lmaydi, "
"chunki bu AvaTax Portali bilan sinxronizatsiyaning buzilishiga olib keladi. "
"Buning o'rniga :guilabel:`Add credit note` tugmasini bosing va `Sync with "
"AvaTax Portal` deb yozing. Ushbu hujjatga qarang: :doc:`../../../accounting/"
"customer_invoices/credit_notes`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:99
msgid "Fixed price discounts"
msgstr "Belgilangan narxdagi chegirmalar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:101
msgid ""
"Add a fixed price discount to a valuable customer, by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Add a line` on the customer's invoice. Add the product "
"discount, and set the :guilabel:`Price` to either a positive or negative "
"value. To recalculate the taxes, click :guilabel:`Compute Taxes`."
msgstr ""
"Qadrli mijozga belgilangan narxdagi chegirma qo'shish uchun mijozning hisob-"
"fakturasida :guilabel:`Add a line` tugmasini bosing. Mahsulot chegirmasini "
"qo'shing va :guilabel:`Price` qiymatini musbat yoki manfiy qilib belgilang. "
"Soliqlarni qayta hisoblash uchun :guilabel:`Compute Taxes` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:106
msgid ""
"Tax calculation can even be done on negative subtotals and credit notes."
msgstr ""
"Soliq hisoblash hatto manfiy oraliq summalar va kredit-notalar bo'yicha ham "
"amalga oshirilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:109
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "Jurnalga yozish (loglash)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:111
msgid ""
"It is possible to log Avalara/*AvaTax* actions in Odoo for further analysis, "
"or verification of functionality. Logging is accessible through the *AvaTax* "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Keyingi tahlil yoki funksionallikni tekshirish uchun Odoo'da Avalara/"
"*AvaTax* amallarini loglash mumkin. Loglash *AvaTax* sozlamalari orqali "
"mavjud."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:114
msgid ""
"To start logging *AvaTax* actions, first, navigate to "
"the :menuselection:`Accounting app --> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr ""
"*AvaTax* amallarini loglashni boshlash uchun "
"avval :menuselection:`Accounting app --> Configuration --> Settings` "
"yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:117
msgid ""
"Then, in the :guilabel:`Taxes` section, under the :guilabel:`AvaTax` "
"settings, click :guilabel:`Start logging for 30 minutes`."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra :guilabel:`Taxes` bo'limida, :guilabel:`AvaTax` sozlamalari "
"ostida :guilabel:`Start logging for 30 minutes` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:120
msgid ""
"Upon starting the log process, Odoo will log all Avalara/*AvaTax* actions "
"performed in the database."
msgstr ""
"Loglash jarayoni boshlanganda, Odoo ma'lumotlar bazasida bajarilgan barcha "
"Avalara/*AvaTax* amallarini jurnalga yozadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:122
msgid ""
"To view the logs, click on :guilabel:`Show logs` to the right of "
"the :guilabel:`Start logging for 30 minutes`. This reveals a detailed list "
"of Avalara/*AvaTax* actions. This list is sortable by the following columns:"
msgstr ""
"Loglarni ko'rish uchun :guilabel:`Start logging for 30 minutes` tugmasining "
"o'ng tomonidagi :guilabel:`Show logs` tugmasini bosing. Bu Avalara/*AvaTax* "
"amallarining batafsil ro'yxatini ochadi. Ushbu ro'yxatni quyidagi ustunlar "
"bo'yicha saralash mumkin:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:126
msgid ":guilabel:`Created on`: timestamp of the *AvaTax* calculation."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Created on`: *AvaTax* hisob-kitobining vaqt belgisi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:127
msgid ":guilabel:`Created by`: numeric value of the user in the database."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Created by`: ma'lumotlar bazasidagi foydalanuvchining raqamli "
"qiymati."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:128
msgid ":guilabel:`Database name`: name of the database."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Database name`: ma'lumotlar bazasining nomi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:129
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Type`: two values can be chosen for this "
"field, :guilabel:`Server` or :guilabel:`Client`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Type`: ushbu maydon uchun ikkita qiymat tanlanishi "
"mumkin: :guilabel:`Server` yoki :guilabel:`Client`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:131
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Name`: Avalara service name. In this case, it will be *AvaTax*."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Name`: Avalara xizmatining nomi. Bu holda u *AvaTax* bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:132
msgid ":guilabel:`Level`: by default, this will be `INFO`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Level`: standart bo'yicha bu `INFO` bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:133
msgid ":guilabel:`Path`: indicates the path taken to make the calculation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Path`: hisob-kitobni amalga oshirish uchun bosib o'tilgan yo'lni "
"ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:134
msgid ":guilabel:`Line`: indicates the line the calculation is made on."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Line`: hisob-kitob amalga oshirilgan qatorni ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:135
msgid ":guilabel:`Function`: indicates the calculation taken on the line."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Function`: qatorda bajarilgan hisob-kitobni ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:None
msgid "Avalara logging page with top row of list highlighted."
msgstr ""
"Ro'yxatning yuqori qatori ajratib ko'rsatilgan Avalara loglash sahifasi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:141
msgid ""
"Click into the log line to reveal another field, called :guilabel:`Message`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Message` deb nomlangan yana bir maydonni ochish uchun log "
"qatoriga bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:143
msgid ""
"This field populates a raw transcription of the transaction, which involves "
"the creation (or adjustment) of a sales invoice using the Avalara *AvaTax* "
"API."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu maydon tranzaksiyaning xom transkripsiyasini ko'rsatadi, bu Avalara "
"*AvaTax* API yordamida sotuv hisob-fakturasini yaratish (yoki tuzatish)ni "
"o'z ichiga oladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:146
msgid ""
"The transaction includes details, such as addresses for shipping from and "
"to, line items describing the products or services, tax codes, tax amounts, "
"and other relevant information."
msgstr ""
"Tranzaksiya jo'natish va yetkazib berish manzillari, mahsulot yoki "
"xizmatlarni tavsiflovchi qator elementlari, soliq kodlari, soliq summalari "
"va boshqa tegishli ma'lumotlar kabi tafsilotlarni o'z ichiga oladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:149
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Message` contains the calculated taxes for different "
"jurisdictions and confirms the creation (or adjustment) of the transaction."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Message` turli yurisdiksiyalar uchun hisoblangan soliqlarni o'z "
"ichiga oladi va tranzaksiyaning yaratilishi (yoki tuzatilishi)ni tasdiqlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:153
msgid ""
"Custom fields can be made using Odoo *Studio*. Click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-"
"v` :guilabel:`(ellipsis)` menu to the far-right of the header row. Then "
"click :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Add custom field`. This action opens Odoo "
"*Studio*."
msgstr ""
"Maxsus maydonlarni Odoo *Studio* yordamida yaratish mumkin. Sarlavha "
"qatorining eng o'ng tomonidagi :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(ellipsis)` "
"menyusini bosing. So'ngra :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Add custom field` "
"tugmasini bosing. Ushbu amal Odoo *Studio*ni ochadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:158
msgid ""
"Odoo *Studio* requires a *custom* pricing plan. Consult the database's "
"customer success manager for more information on switching plans. Or to see "
"if Odoo *Studio* is included in the database's current pricing plan. See "
"this documentation: :doc:`../../../../studio`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo *Studio* *maxsus* narx rejasini talab qiladi. Rejalarni almashtirish "
"haqida ko'proq ma'lumot olish uchun ma'lumotlar bazasining mijozlar "
"muvaffaqiyati menejeri bilan maslahatlashing. Yoki Odoo *Studio* ma'lumotlar "
"bazasining joriy narx rejasiga kiritilganligini bilib oling. Ushbu hujjatga "
"qarang: :doc:`../../../../studio`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avatax/avatax_use.rst:164
msgid ":doc:`avalara_portal`"
msgstr ":doc:`avalara_portal`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/cash_basis.rst:3
msgid "Cash basis taxes"
msgstr "Kassa usulidagi soliqlar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/cash_basis.rst:5
msgid ""
"Cash basis taxes are due when the payment is made, as opposed to standard "
"taxes that are due when the invoice is confirmed. Reporting your income and "
"expenses to the government based on the cash basis method is mandatory in "
"some countries and under some conditions."
msgstr ""
"Kassa usulidagi soliqlar to'lov amalga oshirilganda to'lanadi, hisob-faktura "
"tasdiqlanganda to'lanadigan standart soliqlardan farqli o'laroq. Ba'zi "
"mamlakatlarda va ma'lum sharoitlarda daromadlar va xarajatlarni davlatga "
"kassa usuli asosida hisobot berish majburiydir."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/cash_basis.rst:10
msgid ""
"You sell a product in the 1st quarter of your fiscal year, and the payment "
"is received in the 2nd quarter. Based on the cash basis method, the tax you "
"must pay is for the 2nd quarter."
msgstr ""
"Siz mahsulotni moliya yilingizning 1-choragida sotasiz, to'lov esa 2-"
"chorakda qabul qilinadi. Kassa usuliga ko'ra, siz to'lashingiz kerak bo'lgan "
"soliq 2-chorak uchundir."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/cash_basis.rst:16
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` and under "
"the :guilabel:`Taxes` section, enable :guilabel:`Cash Basis`."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` yo'lidan o'ting "
"va :guilabel:`Taxes` bo'limida :guilabel:`Cash Basis` funksiyasini yoqing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/cash_basis.rst:19
msgid ""
"Then, define the :guilabel:`Tax Cash Basis Journal`. Click on the external "
"link button next to the journal to update its default properties such as "
"the :guilabel:`Journal Name`, :guilabel:`Type` or :guilabel:`Short Code`."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra :guilabel:`Tax Cash Basis Journal` jurnalini belgilang. "
"Jurnalning :guilabel:`Journal Name`, :guilabel:`Type` yoki :guilabel:`Short "
"Code` kabi standart xususiyatlarini yangilash uchun jurnal yonidagi tashqi "
"havola tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/cash_basis.rst:None
msgid "Select your Tax Cash Basis Journal and click on the external link"
msgstr "Tax Cash Basis Journal jurnalingizni tanlang va tashqi havolani bosing"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/cash_basis.rst:28
msgid ""
"By default, the journal entries of the :guilabel:`Cash Basis Taxes` journal "
"are named using the :guilabel:`CABA` short code."
msgstr ""
"Standart bo'yicha :guilabel:`Cash Basis Taxes` jurnalining jurnal "
"yozuvlari :guilabel:`CABA` qisqa kodi yordamida nomlanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/cash_basis.rst:31
msgid ""
"Once this is done, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> "
"Accounting: Taxes` to configure your taxes. You can "
"either :guilabel:`Create` a new tax or update an existing one by clicking on "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Bu bajarilgandan so'ng, soliqlaringizni sozlash "
"uchun :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Accounting: Taxes` "
"yo'lidan o'ting. Siz yangi soliq :guilabel:`Create` qilishingiz yoki "
"mavjudini ustiga bosish orqali yangilashingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/cash_basis.rst:35
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Account` column reflects the proper transitional accounts to "
"post taxes until the payment is registered."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Account` ustuni to'lov ro'yxatga olinguncha soliqlarni o'tkazish "
"uchun tegishli o'tkinchi hisoblarni aks ettiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/cash_basis.rst:None
msgid ""
"Fill in the account column with a transitional accounts where taxes go until "
"the payment\n"
"is registered"
msgstr ""
"Hisob ustunini to'lov ro'yxatdan o'tkazilgunga qadar soliqlar joylashadigan "
"o'tish hisoblari bilan to'ldiring"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/cash_basis.rst:43
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Advanced Options` tab, decide of the :guilabel:`Tax "
"Exigilibity`. Select :guilabel:`Based on Payment`, so the tax is due when "
"the payment of the invoice is received. You can then also define "
"the :guilabel:`Cash Basis Transition Account` where the tax amount is "
"recorded as long as the original invoice has not been reconciled."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Advanced Options` varag'ida :guilabel:`Tax Exigilibity` bo'yicha "
"qaror qabul qiling. :guilabel:`Based on Payment` variantini tanlang, shunda "
