"- 500, 0) * 0.20`"
msgstr ""
"Mahsulotning sotuv narxi $1000, va biz :guilabel:`Formula` maydoni "
"`min(base, 500) * 0.10 + max(base - 500, 0) * 0.20` "
"bo'lgan :guilabel:`Custom Formula` solig'ini qo'llaymiz"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:189
