#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:54
msgid "Fleet"
msgstr "Avtopark"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:56
msgid ""
"Odoo calculates commuting emissions using data from the Fleet and Employees "
"apps."
msgstr ""
"Odoo ishga qatnov chiqindilarini Fleet va Employees ilovalari "
"ma'lumotlaridan foydalanib hisoblaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:58
msgid "Employee commuting emissions formula"
msgstr "Xodimlarning ishga qatnov chiqindilari formulasi"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:60
msgid ""
"`Days` × `Home-work distance` × `2` × (`Number of office days` / `7`) × "
"`Vehicle model CO₂ emissions`"
msgstr ""
"`Days` × `Home-work distance` × `2` × (`Number of office days` / `7`) × "
"`Vehicle model CO₂ emissions`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:63
msgid "To ensure accurate calculations:"
msgstr "Aniq hisob-kitoblarni ta'minlash uchun:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:65
msgid ""
"Define the average number of days per week the employees commute to the "
"office by going to :menuselection:`ESG --> Configuration --> Settings` and "
"filling in the :guilabel:`Weekly Office Attendance`."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`ESG --> Configuration --> Settings` yo'lidan o'tib "
"va :guilabel:`Weekly Office Attendance` maydonini to'ldirib, xodimlarning "
"haftasiga ofisga qatnaydigan o'rtacha kunlar sonini belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:68
msgid ""
"Set the emissions of each vehicle model by going to :menuselection:`Fleet --"
"> Configuration --> Models`, selecting a model, and entering "
"its :guilabel:`CO₂ Emissions`."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Fleet --> Configuration --> Models` yo'lidan o'tib, modelni "
"tanlab va uning :guilabel:`CO₂ Emissions` qiymatini kiritib, har bir "
"avtomobil modelining chiqindilarini belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:70
msgid ""
"Set each employee's home-to-work distance by opening "
"the :guilabel:`Employees` app, selecting an employee, and filling in the "
"employee's :guilabel:`Home-Work Distance`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Employees` ilovasini ochib, xodimni tanlab va "
"xodimning :guilabel:`Home-Work Distance` maydonini to'ldirib, har bir "
"xodimning uydan ishgacha bo'lgan masofasini belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:74
msgid ""
"The employee vehicle's :guilabel:`Start Date` and, if "
"applicable, :guilabel:`End Date`, are used to calculate the emissions. "
"Ensure they are set by opening the :guilabel:`Employees` app, selecting an "
"employee, and clicking the :guilabel:`Cars` smart button."
msgstr ""
"Chiqindilarni hisoblash uchun xodim avtomobilining :guilabel:`Start Date` "
"va, agar mavjud bo'lsa, :guilabel:`End Date` qiymatlaridan "
"foydalaniladi. :guilabel:`Employees` ilovasini ochib, xodimni tanlab "
"va :guilabel:`Cars` aqlli tugmasini bosib, ularning belgilanganligiga "
"ishonch hosil qiling."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:78
msgid ""
"To access the employee commuting emissions pivot table, go "
"to :menuselection:`ESG --> Collect --> Employee Commuting`."
msgstr ""
"Xodimlarning ishga qatnov chiqindilari yig'ma jadvaliga kirish "
"uchun :menuselection:`ESG --> Collect --> Employee Commuting` yo'lidan "
"o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:None
msgid "The employee commuting emissions pivot table"
msgstr "Xodimlarning ishga qatnov chiqindilari yig'ma jadvali"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:84
msgid ""
"To add the data to the emitted emissions, click :guilabel:`Add Emissions`, "
"define the :guilabel:`Emissions Period` that should be covered, and "
"click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlarni chiqarilgan chiqindilarga qo'shish uchun :guilabel:`Add "
"Emissions` tugmasini bosing, qamrab olinishi kerak "
"bo'lgan :guilabel:`Emissions Period` ni belgilang va :guilabel:`Save` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:90
msgid "Manual input"
msgstr "Qo'lda kiritish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:92
msgid ""
"You can manually enter emissions for activities that not tracked "
"automatically (e.g., employee lunches, waste, etc.). To do so, go "
"to :menuselection:`ESG --> Collect --> Emitted Emissions` and "
"click :guilabel:`New`, then:"
msgstr ""
"Avtomatik kuzatilmaydigan faoliyatlar (masalan, xodimlarning tushliklari, "
"chiqindilar va h.k.) uchun chiqindilarni qo'lda kiritishingiz mumkin. Buning "
"uchun :menuselection:`ESG --> Collect --> Emitted Emissions` yo'lidan o'ting "
"va :guilabel:`New` tugmasini bosing, so'ngra:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:96
msgid "Name the activity."
msgstr "Faoliyatga nom bering."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:97
msgid "Select a :guilabel:`Date`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Date` ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:98
msgid "Select an :guilabel:`Emission factor`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Emission factor` ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:99
msgid "Enter a :guilabel:`Quantity`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Quantity` ni kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:101
msgid ""
"Once saved, the entry appears under :menuselection:`ESG --> Collect --> "
"Emitted Emissions` and is included in the carbon footprint report."
msgstr ""
"Saqlangandan so'ng, yozuv :menuselection:`ESG --> Collect --> Emitted "
"Emissions` bo'limida paydo bo'ladi va uglerod izi hisobotiga kiritiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:105
msgid "Emission factors"
msgstr "Chiqindi omillari"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:107
msgid ""
"An emission factor is a coefficient that indicates the rate at which a "
"specific activity emits greenhouse gases into the atmosphere."
msgstr ""
"Chiqindi omili — bu muayyan faoliyatning atmosferaga issiqxona gazlarini "
"chiqarish darajasini ko'rsatuvchi koeffitsiyent."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:111
msgid "Source database"
msgstr "Manba ma'lumotlar bazasi"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:113
msgid ""
"Import the data from a certified emission factors database by going "
"to :menuselection:`ESG --> Configuration --> Source Databases`. "
"Click :guilabel:`Download` on the `ADEME <https://www.ademe.fr/en/our-"
"missions/data>`_ database to import its emission factors and sources."
msgstr ""
"Sertifikatlangan chiqindi omillari ma'lumotlar bazasidan ma'lumotlarni "
"import qilish uchun :menuselection:`ESG --> Configuration --> Source "
"Databases` yo'lidan o'ting. `ADEME <https://www.ademe.fr/en/our-missions/"
"data>`_ ma'lumotlar bazasining chiqindi omillari va manbalarini import "
"qilish uchun undagi :guilabel:`Download` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:118
msgid "Main components of an emission factor"
msgstr "Chiqindi omilining asosiy tarkibiy qismlari"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:121
msgid "Source"
msgstr "Manba"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:123
msgid ""
"Each emission factor is assigned to a scope, following the GHG Protocol:"
msgstr ""
"Har bir chiqindi omili GHG Protokoliga muvofiq muayyan qamrov (scope) ga "
"biriktiriladi:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:125
msgid ""
"Scope 1 – Direct emissions (e.g., fuel burned on-site or in company vehicles)"
msgstr ""
"Scope 1 – To'g'ridan-to'g'ri chiqindilar (masalan, joyida yoki kompaniya "
"avtomobillarida yoqilgan yoqilg'i)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:126
msgid ""
"Scope 2 – Indirect emissions from purchased energy (e.g., electricity or "
"heat)"
msgstr ""
"Scope 2 – Sotib olingan energiyadan bilvosita chiqindilar (masalan, elektr "
"energiyasi yoki issiqlik)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:127
msgid ""
"Scope 3 – All other indirect emissions across the value chain (e.g., "
"purchased goods, travel, waste)"
msgstr ""
"Scope 3 – Qiymat zanjiri bo'ylab barcha boshqa bilvosita chiqindilar "
"(masalan, sotib olingan tovarlar, safarlar, chiqindilar)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:130
msgid ""
"Scopes can be structured hierarchically (parent-child) for more detailed "
"categorization, such as \"Scope 3: Others Indirect > Purchased Goods > "
"Electronics\"."
msgstr ""
"Qamrovlar batafsilroq turkumlash uchun ierarxik tarzda (ota-bola) tuzilishi "
"mumkin, masalan, \"Scope 3: Others Indirect > Purchased Goods > "
"Electronics\"."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:134
msgid "Uncertainty"
msgstr "Noaniqlik"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:136
msgid ""
"Uncertainty represents the potential margin of error in an emission factor. "
"It reflects how precise or reliable the factor is when estimating emissions "
"for a given activity, based on the quality of data, assumptions used, and "
"calculation methodology."
msgstr ""
"Noaniqlik chiqindi omilidagi ehtimoliy xatolik chegarasini ifodalaydi. U "
"ma'lumotlar sifati, qo'llanilgan taxminlar va hisoblash metodologiyasiga "
"asoslanib, muayyan faoliyat uchun chiqindilarni baholashda omilning "
"qanchalik aniq yoki ishonchli ekanligini aks ettiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:140
msgid ""
"It helps you assess the confidence level of the emissions data used in the "
"reporting."
msgstr ""
"U hisobotda ishlatiladigan chiqindilar ma'lumotlarining ishonchlilik "
"darajasini baholashga yordam beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:143
msgid "Compute method"
msgstr "Hisoblash usuli"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:145
msgid ""
"The compute method determines whether emissions are calculated using "
"physical quantities (e.g., kg, liters, units) or monetary values (e.g., € "
"spent). In physical mode, the system uses the quantity from the transaction "
"(e.g., 10 units × :abbr:`EF (emission factor)` per unit). In monetary mode, "
"it uses the transaction amount (e.g., €500 × :abbr:`EF (emission factor)` "
"per €)."
msgstr ""
"Hisoblash usuli chiqindilar jismoniy miqdorlar (masalan, kg, litr, dona) "
"yoki pul qiymatlari (masalan, sarflangan €) yordamida hisoblanishini "
"belgilaydi. Jismoniy rejimda tizim tranzaksiyadagi miqdordan foydalanadi "
"(masalan, 10 dona × har bir dona uchun :abbr:`EF (emission factor)`). Pul "
"rejimida esa tranzaksiya summasidan foydalanadi (masalan, €500 × har bir € "
"uchun :abbr:`EF (emission factor)`)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:151
msgid "Gas emissions lines"
msgstr "Gaz chiqindilari qatorlari"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:153
msgid ""
"Each emission factor can include multiple gas emission lines, representing "
"the different greenhouse gases involved in the activity. The ESG app "
"includes the six main gases from the Kyoto Protocol — CO₂, CH₄, N₂O, HFCs, "
"PFCs, SF₆ — each with a predefined Global Warming Potential (GWP) used to "
"convert them into a common unit: CO₂-equivalent (kgCO₂e)."
msgstr ""
"Har bir chiqindi omili faoliyatda ishtirok etuvchi turli issiqxona gazlarini "
"ifodalovchi bir nechta gaz chiqindisi qatorlarini o'z ichiga olishi mumkin. "
"ESG ilovasi Kioto Protokolidagi oltita asosiy gazni — CO₂, CH₄, N₂O, HFClar, "
"PFClar, SF₆ — o'z ichiga oladi, ularning har biri umumiy birlikka, ya'ni CO₂-"
"ekvivalentga (kgCO₂e) aylantirish uchun ishlatiladigan oldindan belgilangan "
"Global isish potensialiga (GWP) ega."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:159
msgid ""
"Add more specific gases by going to :menuselection:`ESG --> Configuration --"
"> Gases`."
msgstr ""
"Yanada aniq gazlarni qo'shish uchun :menuselection:`ESG --> Configuration --"
"> Gases` yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:161
msgid ""
"Each gas line can be linked to an activity type such as production, "
"transport, or use, allowing for detailed breakdowns in your emissions "
"reporting."
msgstr ""
"Har bir gaz qatori ishlab chiqarish, transport yoki foydalanish kabi "
"faoliyat turiga bog'lanishi mumkin, bu esa chiqindilar hisobotingizda "
"batafsil taqsimotlar olish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:164
msgid ""
"The final emission factor value is the sum of all these gases’ emissions "
"converted into CO₂-equivalents."
msgstr ""
"Yakuniy chiqindi omili qiymati ushbu barcha gazlar chiqindilarining CO₂-"
"ekvivalentlarga aylantirilgan yig'indisidan iborat."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:168
msgid "Assignation rules"
msgstr "Biriktirish qoidalari"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:170
msgid ""
"Assignation rules allow emission factors to be automatically applied to "
"relevant activity data based on specific criteria: the product, partner, and/"
"or account involved in the transaction."
msgstr ""
"Tayinlash qoidalari emissiya omillarini muayyan mezonlar asosida tegishli "
"faoliyat ma'lumotlariga avtomatik ravishda qo'llash imkonini beradi: "
"tranzaksiyada ishtirok etuvchi mahsulot, hamkor va/yoki hisob."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:174
msgid ""
"You have assigned an emission factor to the *Zenith Pro Computer* product "
"and later receive a vendor bill for 150 units; the system automatically "
"applies the assigned emission factor, multiplying the emission factor's "
"emissions (kgCO₂e) by 150."
msgstr ""
"Siz *Zenith Pro Computer* mahsulotiga emissiya omilini tayinladingiz va "
"keyinroq 150 dona uchun yetkazib beruvchi hisobini olasiz; tizim tayinlangan "
"emissiya omilini avtomatik ravishda qo'llaydi va emissiya omilining "
"emissiyalarini (kgCO₂e) 150 ga ko'paytiradi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:178
msgid ""
"To define assignation rules on emissions factors, go to :menuselection:`ESG "
"--> Configuration --> Emission Factors` and select an emission factor. Under "
"the :guilabel:`Assignations` tab, click :guilabel:`Add a line`, and select a "
"record for one or more of the following "
"attributes: :guilabel:`Product`, :guilabel:`Partner`, "
"and :guilabel:`Account`."
msgstr ""
"Emissiya omillari bo'yicha tayinlash qoidalarini belgilash "
"uchun :menuselection:`ESG --> Configuration --> Emission Factors` yo'lidan "
"o'ting va emissiya omilini tanlang. :guilabel:`Assignations` "
"varag'ida :guilabel:`Add a line` tugmasini bosing va quyidagi atributlardan "
"bir yoki bir nechtasi uchun yozuv "
"tanlang: :guilabel:`Product`, :guilabel:`Partner` va :guilabel:`Account`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:183
msgid "All attributes have to match for the rule to be applied."
msgstr "Qoida qo'llanilishi uchun barcha atributlar mos kelishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:186
msgid ""
"Ensure the unit of measure set next to the product's :guilabel:`Cost` "
"matches the emission factor's :guilabel:`Unit of Measure`."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulotning :guilabel:`Cost` maydoni yonida belgilangan o'lchov birligi "
"emissiya omilining :guilabel:`Unit of Measure` qiymatiga mos kelishiga "
"ishonch hosil qiling."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:None
msgid "A product's unit of measure"
msgstr "Mahsulotning o'lchov birligi"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:192
msgid ""
"If the field is not displayed, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Settings` and enable the :guilabel:`Units of Measure & "
"Packagings` option."
msgstr ""
"Agar maydon ko'rsatilmasa, :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> "
"Settings` yo'lidan o'ting va :guilabel:`Units of Measure & Packagings` "
"opsiyasini yoqing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:196
msgid ""
"Accounting journal entries with a missing emission factor can be found by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Emissions to define` under the :guilabel:`Collect "
"Emissions` card on the dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Emissiya omili ko'rsatilmagan buxgalteriya jurnal yozuvlarini boshqaruv "
"panelidagi :guilabel:`Collect Emissions` kartasi "
"ostidagi :guilabel:`Emissions to define` tugmasini bosish orqali topish "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:200
msgid "Rules priority"
msgstr "Qoidalar ustuvorligi"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:202
msgid ""
"When multiple assignation rules match, Odoo prioritizes the most specific "
"rule based on the following criteria:"
msgstr ""
"Bir nechta tayinlash qoidasi mos kelganda, Odoo quyidagi mezonlar asosida "
"eng aniq qoidaga ustuvorlik beradi:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:205
msgid ""
"Attribute specificity: Odoo first evaluates rules by the most precise "
"attribute, following this priority hierarchy (from most to least specific):"
msgstr ""
"Atribut aniqligi: Odoo avval qoidalarni eng aniq atribut bo'yicha baholaydi "
"va quyidagi ustuvorlik ierarxiyasiga amal qiladi (eng aniqdan eng kam "
"aniqgacha):"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:208
#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:226
#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:238
#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:257
#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:269
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:98
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:403
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania.rst:113
msgid "Product"
msgstr "Mahsulot"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:212
msgid ""
"Attribute count: if multiple rules share the same level of attribute "
"specificity, Odoo then considers the number of attributes in the rule. The "
"rule with more attributes defined will take priority."
msgstr ""
"Atributlar soni: agar bir nechta qoida bir xil darajadagi atribut aniqligiga "
"ega bo'lsa, Odoo keyin qoidadagi atributlar sonini hisobga oladi. Ko'proq "
"atribut belgilangan qoida ustuvorlikka ega bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:217
msgid "**Example 1**"
msgstr "**1-misol**"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:219
#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:250
msgid "*Emission factor #1 assignation rule*"
msgstr "*№1 emissiya omilining tayinlash qoidasi*"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:227
#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:239
#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:258
#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:270
msgid "*Any Account*"
msgstr "*Istalgan hisob*"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:228
#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:259
msgid "*Any Partner*"
msgstr "*Istalgan hamkor*"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:229
#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:260
#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:272
msgid "**Zenith Pro Computer**"
msgstr "**Zenith Pro Computer**"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:231
#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:262
msgid "*Emission factor #2 assignation rule*"
msgstr "*№2 emissiya omilining tayinlash qoidasi*"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:240
#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:271
msgid "**Digital Den**"
msgstr "**Digital Den**"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:241
msgid "*Any Product*"
msgstr "*Istalgan mahsulot*"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:243
msgid ""
"Given the assignation rules above, all products purchased from **Digital "
"Den** will be assigned emission factor **#2**, except the **Zenith Pro "
"Computer** product, which will be assigned emission factor **#1**."
msgstr ""
"Yuqoridagi tayinlash qoidalariga ko'ra, **Digital Den** dan sotib olingan "
"barcha mahsulotlarga **№2** emissiya omili tayinlanadi, faqat **Zenith Pro "
"Computer** mahsuloti bundan mustasno bo'lib, unga **№1** emissiya omili "
"tayinlanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:248
msgid "**Example 2**"
msgstr "**2-misol**"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:274
msgid ""
"Given the assignation rules above, any purchased **Zenith Pro Computer** "
"will be assigned emission factor **#1**, except if purchased from the "
"**Digital Den**, which will be assigned emission factor **#2**."
msgstr ""
"Yuqoridagi tayinlash qoidalariga ko'ra, sotib olingan har qanday **Zenith "
"Pro Computer** mahsulotiga **№1** emissiya omili tayinlanadi, faqat "
"**Digital Den** dan sotib olingan bo'lsa, unga **№2** emissiya omili "
"tayinlanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:279
msgid "Apply retroactively"
msgstr "Retroaktiv qo'llash"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:281
msgid ""
"Once your emission factors are configured with assignation rules, you can "
"also apply them retroactively to past activity data."
msgstr ""
"Emissiya omillaringiz tayinlash qoidalari bilan sozlangandan so'ng, ularni "
"o'tgan faoliyat ma'lumotlariga ham retroaktiv tarzda qo'llashingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:284
msgid ""
"To do so, go to :menuselection:`ESG -->  Configuration --> Emission "
"Factors`, select an emission factor, and click :guilabel:`Assign`. Select "
"an :guilabel:`Application Period`, and, if desired, enable "
"the :guilabel:`Replace existing assignations` option."
msgstr ""
"Buning uchun :menuselection:`ESG -->  Configuration --> Emission Factors` "
"yo'lidan o'ting, emissiya omilini tanlang va :guilabel:`Assign` tugmasini "
"bosing. :guilabel:`Application Period` ni tanlang va, agar "
"xohlasangiz, :guilabel:`Replace existing assignations` opsiyasini yoqing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:289
msgid ""
"Apply emission factors in bulk by selecting multiple emission factors "
"in :icon:`oi-view-list` list view and clicking :icon:`fa-cog` "
"(:guilabel:`Actions`) :menuselection:`--> Assign Emission Factors`."
msgstr ""
"Emissiya omillarini ommaviy qo'llash uchun :icon:`oi-view-list` ro'yxat "
"ko'rinishida bir nechta emissiya omilini tanlang va :icon:`fa-cog` "
"(:guilabel:`Actions`) :menuselection:`--> Assign Emission Factors` tugmasini "
"bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:294
msgid "Sex parity and pay gap"
msgstr "Jinslar tengligi va ish haqi farqi"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:296
msgid ""
"Sex parity tracks the distribution of sexes across the workforce, such as "
"comparing women and men in technical vs. administrative roles, permanent vs. "
"temporary contracts, different office locations, or management vs. non-"
"management positions."
msgstr ""
"Jinslar tengligi ishchi kuchi bo'ylab jinslar taqsimotini kuzatib boradi, "
"masalan, texnik va ma'muriy lavozimlardagi, doimiy va vaqtinchalik "
"shartnomalardagi, turli ofis joylashuvlaridagi yoki rahbarlik va rahbarlik "
"bo'lmagan lavozimlardagi ayollar va erkaklarni taqqoslash."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:300
msgid ""
"These insights, based on employee data, are essential for CSRD reporting "
"under ESRS S1 and will also support future VSME standards."
msgstr ""
"Xodimlar ma'lumotlariga asoslangan ushbu tahlillar ESRS S1 doirasidagi CSRD "
"hisoboti uchun muhim bo'lib, kelajakdagi VSME standartlarini ham qo'llab-"
"quvvatlaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:303
msgid ""
"To view a company's sex parity and pay gap measures, set the sex of each "
"employee by opening the :guilabel:`Employees` app and selecting an employee. "
"Under the :guilabel:`Private Information` tab, select the "
"employee's :guilabel:`Gender`."
msgstr ""
"Kompaniyaning jinslar tengligi va ish haqi farqi ko'rsatkichlarini ko'rish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Employees` ilovasini ochib, xodimni tanlab, har bir "
"xodimning jinsini belgilang. :guilabel:`Private Information` varag'ida "
"xodimning :guilabel:`Gender` maydonini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:307
msgid ""
"The pay gap is calculated using the wages set on the employees' Payroll "
"contracts for the same jobs."
msgstr ""
"Ish haqi farqi bir xil ish o'rinlari uchun xodimlarning Payroll "
"shartnomalarida belgilangan ish haqlari yordamida hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:309
msgid "Pay gap formula"
msgstr "Ish haqi farqi formulasi"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:311
msgid ""
"((`Average male salary` – `Average female salary`) / `Average male salary`) "
"× `100`"
msgstr ""
"((`Average male salary` – `Average female salary`) / `Average male salary`) "
"× `100`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:313
msgid ""
"Access the measures by clicking :menuselection:`ESG --> Measure --> Sex "
"Parity / Pay Gap`."
msgstr ""
"Ko'rsatkichlarga kirish uchun :menuselection:`ESG --> Measure --> Sex "
"Parity / Pay Gap` yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:316
msgid ""
"Use the different :ref:`Group By <search/group>` options to break down the "
"data by :guilabel:`Leadership Level`, :guilabel:`Department`, :guilabel:`Job "
"Position`, :guilabel:`Contract Type`, or :guilabel:`Country`."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlarni :guilabel:`Leadership "
"Level`, :guilabel:`Department`, :guilabel:`Job "
"Position`, :guilabel:`Contract Type` yoki :guilabel:`Country` bo'yicha "
"ajratish uchun turli :ref:`Guruhlash <search/group>` opsiyalaridan "
"foydalaning."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:0
msgid "The sex parity graph filtering options"
msgstr "Jinslar tengligi grafigini filtrlash opsiyalari"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:324
msgid "Initiatives"
msgstr "Tashabbuslar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:326
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`ESG --> Act --> Initiatives` to access all "
"the :doc:`Project <../services/project>` features, and start taking action "
"on your impact. You can estimate CO₂ savings for each task, track progress, "
"and assign team members with deadlines."
msgstr ""
"Barcha :doc:`Project <../services/project>` funksiyalariga kirish va "
"ta'siringiz bo'yicha choralar ko'rishni boshlash uchun :menuselection:`ESG --"
"> Act --> Initiatives` yo'lidan o'ting. Har bir vazifa uchun CO₂ "
"tejamkorligini baholashingiz, jarayonni kuzatishingiz va jamoa a'zolarini "
"muddatlar bilan tayinlashingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/esg.rst:331
msgid ""
"Estimated CO₂ reductions do not immediately lower your carbon footprint. The "
"real impact shows only when these reductions are reflected in your "
"operations."
msgstr ""
"Taxmin qilingan CO₂ kamayishlari uglerod izingizni darhol pasaytirmaydi. "
"Haqiqiy ta'sir faqat ushbu kamayishlar operatsiyalaringizda aks etganda "
"ko'rinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:3
msgid "Process expenses"
msgstr "Xarajatlarni qayta ishlash"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:5
msgid ""
"Once expenses have been created and submitted, they must be processed by an "
"authorized database user. In Odoo, most users cannot process expenses; only "
"users with the necessary :doc:`access rights <../../general/users/"
"access_rights>` or permissions can. This means that a user **must** have at "
"least *Team Approver* rights for the **Expenses** app. Employees with the "
"necessary rights can review expenses, approve or refuse them, and provide "
"feedback with an integrated :ref:`refuse expense <expenses/refuse-report>` "
"communication tool."
msgstr ""
"Xarajatlar yaratilib, topshirilgandan so'ng, ular vakolatli ma'lumotlar "
"bazasi foydalanuvchisi tomonidan qayta ishlanishi kerak. Odoo da ko'pchilik "
"foydalanuvchilar xarajatlarni qayta ishlay olmaydi; buni faqat "
"zarur :doc:`kirish huquqlari <../../general/users/access_rights>` yoki "
"ruxsatlarga ega foydalanuvchilar amalga oshira oladi. Bu foydalanuvchi "
"**Expenses** ilovasi uchun kamida *Team Approver* huquqlariga ega bo'lishi "
"**shart** ekanligini anglatadi. Zarur huquqlarga ega xodimlar xarajatlarni "
"ko'rib chiqishi, ularni tasdiqlashi yoki rad etishi hamda "
"integratsiyalangan :ref:`xarajatni rad etish <expenses/refuse-report>` aloqa "
"vositasi orqali fikr-mulohaza bildirishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:13
msgid "View expenses"
msgstr "Xarajatlarni ko'rish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:15
msgid ""
"Users who are able to process expenses (typically managers) can view all "
"expenses they have access rights for in the *Expenses to Process* dashboard. "
"To view the dashboard, navigate to :menuselection:`Expenses app --> My "
"Expenses --> Expenses to Process`."
msgstr ""
"Xarajatlarni qayta ishlay oladigan foydalanuvchilar (odatda menejerlar) "
"kirish huquqiga ega bo'lgan barcha xarajatlarni *Expenses to Process* "
"boshqaruv panelida ko'rishlari mumkin. Boshqaruv panelini ko'rish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Expenses app --> My Expenses --> Expenses to Process` "
"yo'lidan o'ting."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:19
msgid ""
"A list of all expenses with a status of :guilabel:`Submit` appears, while "
"expenses with a status "
"of :guilabel:`Draft`, :guilabel:`Approved`, :guilabel:`Posted`, :guilabel:`In "
"Payment`, :guilabel:`Paid`, or :guilabel:`Refused` are hidden by default. To "
"view expenses with a different status, click the "
"corresponding :guilabel:`Status` button in the side panel."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Submit` holatidagi barcha xarajatlar ro'yxati paydo "
"bo'ladi, :guilabel:`Draft`, :guilabel:`Approved`, :guilabel:`Posted`, :guilabel:`In "
"Payment`, :guilabel:`Paid` yoki :guilabel:`Refused` holatidagi xarajatlar "
"esa standart holatda yashirilgan bo'ladi. Boshqa holatdagi xarajatlarni "
"ko'rish uchun yon paneldagi tegishli :guilabel:`Status` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:None
msgid "Expenses to validate are found on the Expenses to Process dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Tasdiqlanishi kerak bo'lgan xarajatlar Expenses to Process boshqaruv "
"panelida joylashgan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:28
msgid "Approve expenses"
msgstr "Xarajatlarni tasdiqlash"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:30
msgid ""
"Expenses can be approved in two ways: :ref:`individually <expenses/"
"individual>` or :ref:`in bulk <expenses/multiple>`."
msgstr ""
"Xarajatlarni ikki usulda tasdiqlash mumkin: :ref:`alohida <expenses/"
"individual>` yoki :ref:`ommaviy <expenses/multiple>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:34
msgid "Only reports with a status of :guilabel:`Submitted` can be approved."
msgstr "Faqat :guilabel:`Submitted` holatidagi hisobotlarni tasdiqlash mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:39
msgid "Approve individual expenses"
msgstr "Alohida xarajatlarni tasdiqlash"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:41
msgid ""
"To approve an individual expense, navigate to :menuselection:`Expenses app --"
"> My Expenses --> Expenses to Process`, and click on an individual expense "
"to view the details."
msgstr ""
"Alohida xarajatni tasdiqlash uchun :menuselection:`Expenses app --> My "
"Expenses --> Expenses to Process` yo'lidan o'ting va tafsilotlarni ko'rish "
"uchun alohida xarajat ustiga bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:44
msgid ""
"From here, several options are presented: :guilabel:`Post Journal "
"Entries`, :guilabel:`Report in Next "
"Payslip` :guilabel:`Approve`, :guilabel:`Refuse`, :guilabel:`Reset`, :guilabel:`Split "
"Expense`, and :guilabel:`Attach Receipt`. Click :guilabel:`Approve` to "
"approve the expense."
msgstr ""
"Bu yerda bir nechta variant taqdim etiladi: :guilabel:`Post Journal "
"Entries`, :guilabel:`Report in Next "
"Payslip` :guilabel:`Approve`, :guilabel:`Refuse`, :guilabel:`Reset`, :guilabel:`Split "
"Expense` va :guilabel:`Attach Receipt`. Xarajatni tasdiqlash "
"uchun :guilabel:`Approve` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:0
msgid "An individual expense report that can be approved or refused."
msgstr "Tasdiqlash yoki rad etish mumkin bo'lgan alohida xarajat hisoboti."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:54
msgid "Approve multiple expenses"
msgstr "Bir nechta xarajatni tasdiqlash"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:56
msgid ""
"To approve multiple expenses at once, first navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Expenses app --> My Expenses --> Expenses to Process` to "
"view a list of all expenses waiting to be processed. Next, select the "
"expenses to approve by ticking the checkbox next to each expense being "
"approved, or tick the checkbox next to the :guilabel:`Employee` column title "
"to select all the expenses in the list."
msgstr ""
"Bir vaqtning o'zida bir nechta xarajatni tasdiqlash uchun avval qayta "
"ishlanishini kutayotgan barcha xarajatlar ro'yxatini ko'rish "
"maqsadida :menuselection:`Expenses app --> My Expenses --> Expenses to "
"Process` yo'lidan o'ting. Keyin tasdiqlanadigan har bir xarajat yonidagi "
"belgilash katakchasini belgilash orqali tasdiqlanadigan xarajatlarni tanlang "
"yoki ro'yxatdagi barcha xarajatlarni tanlash uchun :guilabel:`Employee` "
"ustuni sarlavhasi yonidagi belgilash katakchasini belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:61
msgid "Next, click the :guilabel:`Approve` button."
msgstr "Keyin :guilabel:`Approve` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:0
msgid "Select multiple expense reports at once."
msgstr "Bir vaqtning o'zida bir nechta xarajat hisobotini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:67
msgid ""
"Team managers can view all the expenses for their team members only. While "
"on the :guilabel:`Expenses to Process` page, click the :icon:`fa-caret-"
"down` :guilabel:`(down arrow)` on the right-side of the search bar, then "
"click :guilabel:`My Team` in the :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`Filters` "
"section. This presents all the expenses for only the manager's team."
msgstr ""
"Jamoa menejerlari faqat o'z jamoa a'zolarining barcha xarajatlarini "
"ko'rishlari mumkin. :guilabel:`Expenses to Process` sahifasida "
"bo'lganingizda, qidiruv panelining o'ng tomonidagi :icon:`fa-caret-"
"down` :guilabel:`(down arrow)` belgisini bosing, so'ngra :icon:`fa-"
"filter` :guilabel:`Filters` bo'limidagi :guilabel:`My Team` ni bosing. Bu "
"faqat menejer jamoasining barcha xarajatlarini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:75
msgid "Refuse expenses"
msgstr "Xarajatlarni rad etish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:77
msgid ""
"Expenses can **only** be refused individually, and **not** from "
"the :guilabel:`Expenses to Process` dashboard. To refuse an individual "
"expense, navigate to :menuselection:`Expenses app --> My expenses --> "
"Expenses to Process`, then click on an individual expense to open the "
"detailed expense record."
msgstr ""
"Xarajatlarni **faqat** alohida rad etish mumkin, :guilabel:`Expenses to "
"Process` boshqaruv panelidan **emas**. Alohida xarajatni rad etish "
"uchun :menuselection:`Expenses app --> My expenses --> Expenses to Process` "
"yo'lidan o'ting, so'ngra batafsil xarajat yozuvini ochish uchun alohida "
"xarajat ustiga bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:81
msgid ""
"If more information is needed, such as a missing receipt, communicate any "
"necessary information requests in the *chatter* of the expense record. On "
"the individual expense, click either :guilabel:`Send message` "
"or :guilabel:`Log note` to open a message text box."
msgstr ""
"Agar qo'shimcha ma'lumot kerak bo'lsa, masalan, chek yetishmasa, zarur "
"ma'lumot so'rovlarini xarajat yozuvining *chatter* qismida yetkazing. "
"Alohida xarajatda xabar matni oynasini ochish uchun :guilabel:`Send message` "
"yoki :guilabel:`Log note` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:85
msgid ""
"Type in a message, tagging the proper people, and post it to the *chatter* "
"by clicking :guilabel:`Send` or :guilabel:`Log`, depending on the method of "
"communication. The message is posted in the chatter, and the tagged people "
"are notified via email."
msgstr ""
"Xabar yozing, kerakli odamlarni belgilang va muloqot usuliga "
"qarab :guilabel:`Send` yoki :guilabel:`Log` tugmasini bosib, uni *chatter*ga "
"joylang. Xabar chatterda e'lon qilinadi va belgilangan odamlar elektron "
"pochta orqali xabardor qilinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:90
msgid ""
"The only people that can be tagged in a message are *followers* of the "
"specific expense. To see who is a follower, click the :icon:`fa-user-"
"o` :guilabel:`(Show Followers)` icon to display the followers of the expense "
"report. Additional followers can be added by clicking the :icon:`fa-user-"
"o` :guilabel:`(Show Followers)` icon, then clicking :guilabel:`Add "
"Followers`."
msgstr ""
"Xabarda belgilanishi mumkin bo'lgan yagona odamlar — muayyan xarajatning "
"*kuzatuvchilari*dir. Kim kuzatuvchi ekanini bilish uchun xarajat "
"hisobotining kuzatuvchilarini ko'rsatish maqsadida :icon:`fa-user-"
"o` :guilabel:`(Show Followers)` belgisini bosing. Qo'shimcha "
"kuzatuvchilarni :icon:`fa-user-o` :guilabel:`(Show Followers)` belgisini "
"bosib, so'ngra :guilabel:`Add Followers` tugmasini bosish orqali qo'shish "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:0
msgid "Send messages in the chatter."
msgstr "Chatterda xabarlar yuboring."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:98
msgid ""
"To refuse an expense, click :guilabel:`Refuse`, and a *Refuse Expense* pop-"
"up window loads. Enter a brief explanation for the refusal in "
"the :guilabel:`Reason` field, then click :guilabel:`Refuse`."
msgstr ""
"Xarajatni rad etish uchun :guilabel:`Refuse` tugmasini bosing, shunda "
"*Refuse Expense* qalqib chiquvchi oynasi yuklanadi. :guilabel:`Reason` "
"maydoniga rad etish sababini qisqacha kiriting, so'ngra :guilabel:`Refuse` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:102
msgid ""
"A reason **must** be entered in the :guilabel:`Reason` field, or the expense "
"cannot be refused."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Reason` maydoniga sabab kiritilishi **shart**, aks holda "
"xarajatni rad etib bo'lmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:107
msgid ""
"Once the expense is refused, the status changes to :guilabel:`Refused`, and "
"the only buttons that appear are :guilabel:`Add Receipt` "
"and :guilabel:`Reset`."
msgstr ""
"Xarajat rad etilgach, holat :guilabel:`Refused` ga o'zgaradi va "
"faqat :guilabel:`Add Receipt` hamda :guilabel:`Reset` tugmalari ko'rinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:3
msgid "Expense cards"
msgstr "Xarajat kartalari"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo offers physical and virtual expense cards, allowing for better expense "
"tracking and management. Using expense cards allows for real time expense "
"management, creating expense records as soon as an expense transaction "
"occurs, allowing management greater visibility of expense costs as they are "
"incurred."
msgstr ""
"Odoo jismoniy va virtual xarajat kartalarini taklif etadi, bu esa "
"xarajatlarni yaxshiroq kuzatish va boshqarish imkonini beradi. Xarajat "
"kartalaridan foydalanish xarajatlarni real vaqtda boshqarish imkonini "
"beradi: xarajat tranzaksiyasi sodir bo'lishi bilanoq xarajat yozuvlari "
"yaratiladi va bu rahbariyatga xarajatlarni yuzaga kelishi bilanoq yaxshiroq "
"kuzatish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:10
msgid ""
"The elimination of the need to :doc:`actively create expense records "
"<log_expenses>` allows for a more streamlined expense workflow, with records "
"automatically created as purchases are made."
msgstr ""
":doc:`xarajat yozuvlarini faol ravishda yaratish <log_expenses>` "
"zaruratining bartaraf etilishi xarajatlar ish jarayonini yanada "
"soddalashtiradi: yozuvlar xaridlar amalga oshirilishi bilan avtomatik "
"yaratiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:13
msgid ""
"To use expense cards, first a :ref:`card is configured <expenses/card-"
"configure>`, then it is :ref:`activated <expenses/card-activate>`. Before "
"employees can make purchases with their expense card, a :ref:`Stripe account "
"must be created <expenses/create-stripe>` and configured, then :ref:`funds "
"must be added <expenses/add-funds>` to the company's Stripe account. Once "
"there is money available in the account (this typically takes 2-3 business "
"days for the transfer to Stripe), employees can use their expense cards, and "
"the money is pulled from the company's Stripe account."
msgstr ""
"Xarajat kartalaridan foydalanish uchun avval :ref:`karta sozlanadi <expenses/"
"card-configure>`, so'ngra u :ref:`faollashtiriladi <expenses/card-"
"activate>`. Xodimlar o'z xarajat kartalari bilan xarid qilishlaridan "
"oldin :ref:`Stripe hisobi yaratilishi <expenses/create-stripe>` va "
"sozlanishi kerak, so'ngra kompaniyaning Stripe hisobiga :ref:`mablag' "
"qo'shilishi kerak <expenses/add-funds>`. Hisobda pul mavjud bo'lgach "
"(Stripe'ga o'tkazma odatda 2-3 ish kunini oladi), xodimlar o'z xarajat "
"kartalaridan foydalanishlari mumkin va pul kompaniyaning Stripe hisobidan "
"yechib olinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:21
msgid ""
"To create and use expense cards, both the **Accounting** and **Invoicing** "
"apps **must** be :ref:`installed <general/install>`."
msgstr ""
"Xarajat kartalarini yaratish va ulardan foydalanish uchun ham "
"**Accounting**, ham **Invoicing** ilovalari :ref:`o'rnatilgan <general/"
"install>` bo'lishi **shart**."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:24
msgid ""
"To access confidential card data (card number and CVV for virtual cards; PIN "
"for physical cards), the employee **must** have a :doc:`user <../../general/"
"users>` profile. These details can **only** be accessed through that profile."
msgstr ""
"Kartaning maxfiy ma'lumotlariga (virtual kartalar uchun karta raqami va CVV; "
"jismoniy kartalar uchun PIN) kirish uchun xodimda :doc:`foydalanuvchi <../../"
"general/users>` profili bo'lishi **shart**. Ushbu ma'lumotlarga **faqat** "
"shu profil orqali kirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:29
msgid ""
"Expense cards act like pre-paid debit cards, as they can **only** be used "
"with a connected Stripe account, and **only** if funds are added to that "
"account, to be drawn from."
msgstr ""
"Xarajat kartalari oldindan to'langan debet kartalar kabi ishlaydi, chunki "
"ulardan **faqat** ulangan Stripe hisobi bilan va **faqat** ushbu hisobga "
"yechib olish uchun mablag' qo'shilgan taqdirdagina foydalanish mumkin."

