msgstr ""
":ref:`Taxable Payments Annual Report (TPAR) <australia/tpar>` "
"va :ref:`Business Activity Statement (BAS) <australia/bas>` hisobotini "
"qo'shadi. U :guilabel:`Australia` :ref:`soliq lokalizatsiyasi paketi "
"<fiscal_localizations/packages>` tanlanganda avtomatik ravishda o'rnatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:27
