msgstr "`l10n_au_hr_payroll_account`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:33
msgid ""
"Contains the necessary accounting data for the Australian payroll rules. It "
"is installed automatically when the :ref:`Payroll Entries option <payroll-"
"accounting>` is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Avstraliya ish haqi qoidalari uchun zarur buxgalteriya ma'lumotlarini o'z "
"ichiga oladi. U :ref:`Payroll Entries opsiyasi <payroll-accounting>` "
