#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:72
msgid ""
"The Belgian chart of accounts includes pre-configured accounts as described "
"in the :abbr:`PCMN (Plan Comptable Minimum Normalisé)` or :abbr:`MAR "
"(Minimumindeling van het Algemeen Rekeningenstelsel)`. To add a new account, "
"click :guilabel:`New`. A new line appears. Fill it in, "
"click :guilabel:`Save`, and then :guilabel:`Setup` to configure it further."
msgstr ""
"Belgiya hisoblar rejasi :abbr:`PCMN (Plan Comptable Minimum Normalisé)` "
"yoki :abbr:`MAR (Minimumindeling van het Algemeen Rekeningenstelsel)` "
"hujjatlarida tavsiflangan oldindan sozlangan hisoblarni o'z ichiga oladi. "
"Yangi hisob qo'shish uchun :guilabel:`New` tugmasini bosing. Yangi qator "
"paydo bo'ladi. Uni to'ldiring, :guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing, so'ngra "
"uni qo'shimcha sozlash uchun :guilabel:`Setup` tugmasini bosing."

