#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:63
msgid ""
"The :doc:`chart of accounts (COA) <../accounting/get_started/"
"chart_of_accounts>` for the Canadian localization, in Odoo, has accounts "
"grouped into seven main categories, with corresponding numeric values that "
"prefix individual journal entries:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo da Kanada lokalizatsiyasi uchun :doc:`hisoblar rejasi (COA) <../"
"accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts>` hisoblari yettita asosiy toifaga "
"guruhlangan bo'lib, har bir jurnal yozuvi oldidan qo'yiladigan mos raqamli "
"qiymatlarga ega:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:67
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:117
msgid ""
"**Receivable**: the balance of money (or credit) due to the business for "
"goods or services delivered or used, but not yet paid for by customers. |AR| "
"is indicated by the journal code labeled (or beginning) with :guilabel:`1`."
msgstr ""
"**Debitorlik qarzi**: yetkazib berilgan yoki foydalanilgan tovarlar yoki "
"xizmatlar uchun biznesga tegishli bo'lgan, ammo mijozlar tomonidan hali "
"to'lanmagan pul (yoki kredit) qoldig'i. |AR| :guilabel:`1` bilan belgilangan "
"(yoki boshlanadigan) jurnal kodi bilan ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:70
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:120
msgid ""
"**Payable**: the business's short-term obligations owed to its creditors or "
"suppliers, which have not yet been paid. |AP| is indicated by the journal "
"code labeled (or beginning) with :guilabel:`2`."
msgstr ""
"**Kreditorlik qarzi**: biznesning kreditorlari yoki yetkazib beruvchilari "
"oldidagi hali to'lanmagan qisqa muddatli majburiyatlari. |AP| :guilabel:`2` "
"bilan belgilangan (yoki boshlanadigan) jurnal kodi bilan ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:73
msgid ""
"**Equity**: the amount of money that would be returned to a company's "
"shareholders if all of the assets were liquidated and all of the company's "
"debt was paid off in the case of liquidation. Equity is indicated by the "
"journal code labeled (or beginning) with :guilabel:`3` or :guilabel:`9`."
msgstr ""
"**Kapital**: tugatish holatida barcha aktivlar sotilib, kompaniyaning barcha "
"qarzlari to'langanda kompaniya aksiyadorlariga qaytariladigan pul miqdori. "
"Kapital :guilabel:`3` yoki :guilabel:`9` bilan belgilangan (yoki "
"boshlanadigan) jurnal kodi bilan ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:77
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:126
msgid ""
"**Assets**: items listed on the balance sheet that contains economic value "
"or have the ability to generate cash flows in the future, such as a piece of "
"machinery, a financial security, or a patent. Assets are indicated by the "
"journal code labeled (or beginning) with :guilabel:`1`."
msgstr ""
"**Aktivlar**: balansda ko'rsatilgan, iqtisodiy qiymatga ega bo'lgan yoki "
"kelajakda pul oqimlarini yaratish qobiliyatiga ega bo'lgan obyektlar, "
"masalan, uskuna, moliyaviy qimmatli qog'oz yoki patent. "
"Aktivlar :guilabel:`1` bilan belgilangan (yoki boshlanadigan) jurnal kodi "
"bilan ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:80
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:129
msgid ""
"**Liability**: refers to a company's financial debts or obligations that "
"arise during the course of business operations. Liabilities are indicated by "
"the journal code labeled (or beginning) with :guilabel:`2`."
msgstr ""
"**Majburiyat**: biznes faoliyati davomida yuzaga keladigan kompaniyaning "
"moliyaviy qarzlari yoki majburiyatlarini anglatadi. "
"Majburiyatlar :guilabel:`2` bilan belgilangan (yoki boshlanadigan) jurnal "
"kodi bilan ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:83
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:132
msgid ""
"**Income**: synonymous with *net income*, this is the profit a company "
"retains after paying off all relevant expenses from sales revenue earned. "
"Income is indicated by the journal code labeled (or beginning) "
"with :guilabel:`4` or :guilabel:`6`."
msgstr ""
"**Daromad**: *sof daromad* bilan bir ma'noda bo'lib, bu kompaniya olingan "
"sotuv tushumidan barcha tegishli xarajatlarni to'laganidan keyin qoladigan "
"foyda. Daromad :guilabel:`4` yoki :guilabel:`6` bilan belgilangan (yoki "
"boshlanadigan) jurnal kodi bilan ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:86
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:135
msgid ""
"**Expenses**: the cost of operations that a company incurs to generate "
"revenue. Expenses are indicated by the journal code labeled (or beginning) "
"with a :guilabel:`6`."
msgstr ""
"**Xarajatlar**: kompaniya daromad olish uchun sarflaydigan operatsion "
"xarajatlar. Xarajatlar :guilabel:`6` bilan belgilangan (yoki boshlanadigan) "
"jurnal kodi bilan ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:90
msgid ""
"Predefined accounts are included in Odoo, as part of the |COA| that's "
"installed with the Canadian localization package. The accounts listed below "
"are preconfigured to perform certain operations within Odoo. It is "
"recommended to **not** delete these accounts; however, if changes are "
"needed, rename the accounts instead."
msgstr ""
"Oldindan belgilangan hisoblar Kanada lokalizatsiya paketi bilan "
"o'rnatiladigan |COA| tarkibida Odoo'ga kiritilgan. Quyida keltirilgan "
"hisoblar Odoo ichida muayyan operatsiyalarni bajarish uchun oldindan "
"sozlangan. Ushbu hisoblarni o'chirib **tashlamaslik** tavsiya etiladi; agar "
"o'zgartirishlar kerak bo'lsa, hisoblarning nomini o'zgartiring."

