"sertifikatini yuklash, asosiy ma'lumotlarni sozlash va h.k.), yetkazib "
"berish yo'riqnomalari uchun o'zlarining :abbr:`CAFs (Folio Authorization "
"Code)` kerak bo'ladi. Elektron yetkazib berish yo'riqnomalari "
"uchun :abbr:`CAF (Folio Authorization Code)` olish tafsilotlarini tekshirish "
"uchun :ref:`CAF hujjatlariga <chile/caf-documentation>` murojaat qiling."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:803
msgid ""
