msgstr ""
"Yetkazib beruvchi hisobini sozlash uchun quyidagi Ekvadorga xos maydonlarni "
"ham to'ldirganingizga ishonch hosil qiling:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:526
msgid ":guilabel:`Document Type`: Enter this document type: `(01) Invoice`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Document Type`: ushbu hujjat turini kiriting: `(01) Invoice`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:527
msgid ":guilabel:`Document number`: Enter the document number."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Document number`: hujjat raqamini kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:528
msgid ":guilabel:`Payment Method (SRI)`: Select how to pay the vendor bill."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Payment Method (SRI)`: yetkazib beruvchi hisobini qanday "
"to'lashni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:531
msgid ""
"When creating the purchase withholding, verify that the bases (base amounts) "
"are correct. If the amount of the tax in the :guilabel:`Vendor bill` needs "
"to be edited, click :guilabel:`Edit`. Or, from the :guilabel:`Journal Items` "
"tab, click :guilabel:`Edit` and set the adjustment as desired."
msgstr ""
"Xarid bo'yicha ushlab qolishni yaratishda bazalar (baza summalari) to'g'ri "
"ekanligini tekshiring. Agar :guilabel:`Vendor bill` dagi soliq summasini "
"tahrirlash kerak bo'lsa, :guilabel:`Edit` tugmasini bosing. "
"Yoki :guilabel:`Journal Items` varag'idan :guilabel:`Edit` tugmasini bosing "
"va tuzatishni kerakli tarzda belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:538
msgid "Purchase liquidation"
msgstr "Xarid likvidatsiyasi"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:540
msgid ""
"*Purchase liquidations* are electronic documents sent to the SRI once "
"they're validated. Companies issue them when they make a purchase, but the "
"vendor does not provide an invoice due to one or more of the following "
"reasons:"
msgstr ""
"*Xarid likvidatsiyalari* — tasdiqlangandan so'ng SRI ga yuboriladigan "
"elektron hujjatlardir. Kompaniyalar ularni xarid qilganda, lekin yetkazib "
"beruvchi quyidagi sabablardan biri yoki bir nechtasi tufayli hisob-faktura "
"taqdim etmaganda rasmiylashtiradi:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:544
msgid "Non-residents of Ecuador provided services."
msgstr "Ekvador norezidentlari xizmatlar ko'rsatgan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:545
msgid ""
"Foreign companies provided services without residency or facility in Ecuador."
msgstr ""
"Xorijiy kompaniyalar Ekvadorda rezidentlik yoki filialga ega bo'lmagan holda "
"xizmatlar ko'rsatgan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:546
msgid ""
"Purchase of goods or services from natural persons not registered with a "
"RUC, who cannot issue sales receipts or customer invoices."
msgstr ""
"RUC bilan ro'yxatdan o'tmagan, sotuv cheklari yoki mijoz hisob-fakturalarini "
"bera olmaydigan jismoniy shaxslardan tovarlar yoki xizmatlar xarid qilish."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:548
msgid ""
"Reimbursement for purchasing goods or services must be given to employees in "
"a dependency relationship (full-time employee)."
msgstr ""
"Tovarlar yoki xizmatlarni xarid qilganlik uchun kompensatsiya qaramlik "
"munosabatidagi xodimlarga (to'liq stavkadagi xodim) berilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:550
msgid ""
"Members of collegiate bodies have provided services in the exercise of their "
"function."
msgstr ""
"Kollegial organlar a'zolari o'z vazifalarini bajarish doirasida xizmatlar "
"ko'rsatgan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:552
msgid ""
"In these cases, a :ref:`purchase liquidation journal <localizations/ecuador/"
"purchase-liquidation-journal>` must be created."
msgstr ""
"Bunday hollarda :ref:`xarid likvidatsiyasi jurnali <localizations/ecuador/"
"purchase-liquidation-journal>` yaratilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:558
msgid "Create a purchase liquidation journal"
msgstr "Xarid likvidatsiyasi jurnalini yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:560
msgid ""
"To create a *purchase liquidations* journal, enter the following information:"
msgstr ""
"*Xarid likvidatsiyalari* jurnalini yaratish uchun quyidagi ma'lumotlarni "
"kiriting:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:562
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Journal Name`: Enter this format: `[Emission Entity]-[Emission "
"Point] [Document Type]`, e.g., `001-001 Purchase Liquidations`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Journal Name`: ushbu formatda kiriting: `[Emission Entity]-"
"[Emission Point] [Document Type]`, masalan, `001-001 Purchase Liquidations`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:564
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Type`: Refers to the journal type. Select :guilabel:`Purchase`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Type`: jurnal turini bildiradi. :guilabel:`Purchase` ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:568
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Purchase Liquidations`: Tick this checkbox to enable purchase "
"liquidations."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Purchase Liquidations`: xarid likvidatsiyalarini yoqish uchun "
"ushbu katakka belgi qo'ying."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:576
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Short Code`: Enter a unique 5-digit code for the accounting entry "
"sequence (e.g., `PT001`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Short Code`: buxgalteriya yozuvi ketma-ketligi uchun noyob 5 "
"belgili kod kiriting (masalan, `PT001`)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:585
msgid "Create a purchase liquidation"
msgstr "Xarid likvidatsiyasini yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:587
msgid ""
"Purchase liquidations, created from *purchase orders* or manually from "
"*vendor bills*, must contain the following data:"
msgstr ""
"*Xarid buyurtmalari*dan yoki qo'lda *yetkazib beruvchi hisoblari*dan "
"yaratiladigan xarid likvidatsiyalari quyidagi ma'lumotlarni o'z ichiga "
"olishi kerak:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:591
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Journal`: Select the :guilabel:`Purchase Liquidation` journal "
"with the correct printer point."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Journal`: to'g'ri chop etish nuqtasiga ega :guilabel:`Purchase "
"Liquidation` jurnalini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:593
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Document Type`: Enter this document type: `(03) Purchase "
"Liquidation`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Document Type`: ushbu hujjat turini kiriting: `(03) Purchase "
"Liquidation`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:594
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Document number`: Enter the document number (sequence). This must "
"only be entered once, and the sequence will automatically be assigned to the "
"subsequent documents."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Document number`: hujjat raqamini (ketma-ketlikni) kiriting. Bu "
"faqat bir marta kiritilishi kerak, keyingi hujjatlarga ketma-ketlik "
"avtomatik ravishda tayinlanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:596
msgid ":guilabel:`Payment Method (SRI)`: Select how to pay the invoice."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Payment Method (SRI)`: hisob-fakturani qanday to'lashni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:597
msgid ":guilabel:`Products`: Specify the product with the correct taxes."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Products`: mahsulotni to'g'ri soliqlar bilan ko'rsating."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:599
msgid "Then, validate the :guilabel:`Purchase Liquidation`."
msgstr "So'ngra :guilabel:`Purchase Liquidation` ni tasdiqlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:604
msgid "Purchase withholding"
msgstr "Xarid bo'yicha ushlab qolish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:606
msgid ""
"*Purchase withholdings* are electronic documents sent to the SRI once "
"they're validated. They can only be registered from a validated (posted) "
"invoice."
msgstr ""
"*Xarid bo'yicha ushlab qolishlar* — tasdiqlangandan so'ng SRI ga "
"yuboriladigan elektron hujjatlardir. Ular faqat tasdiqlangan (o'tkazilgan) "
"hisob-fakturadan ro'yxatga olinishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:609
msgid ""
"On the invoice, click :guilabel:`Add Withhold` and complete the following "
"fields in the :guilabel:`Withhold` window:"
msgstr ""
"Hisob-fakturada :guilabel:`Add Withhold` tugmasini bosing "
"va :guilabel:`Withhold` oynasida quyidagi maydonlarni to'ldiring:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:612
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Document number`: Enter the document number (sequence). This must "
"only be entered once, and the sequence will automatically be assigned for "
"the next documents."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Document number`: hujjat raqamini (ketma-ketlikni) kiriting. Bu "
"faqat bir marta kiritilishi kerak, keyingi hujjatlar uchun ketma-ketlik "
"avtomatik ravishda tayinlanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:614
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Withhold lines`: The taxes appear automatically according to the "
"configuration of products and vendors. Review if the taxes and tax support "
"are correct. If not, edit and select the correct taxes and tax support."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Withhold lines`: soliqlar mahsulotlar va yetkazib beruvchilar "
"konfiguratsiyasiga muvofiq avtomatik ravishda paydo bo'ladi. Soliqlar va "
"soliq asosi to'g'riligini tekshiring. Agar noto'g'ri bo'lsa, tahrirlang va "
"to'g'ri soliqlar hamda soliq asosini tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:618
msgid "Then, validate the :guilabel:`Withholding`."
msgstr "So'ngra :guilabel:`Withholding` ni tasdiqlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:621
msgid ""
"Tax support types must be configured on the :guilabel:`Vendor Bill`. To do "
"so, go to the tax applied on the :guilabel:`Vendor Bill` and change "
"the :guilabel:`Tax Support` there."
msgstr ""
"Soliq asosi turlari :guilabel:`Vendor Bill` da sozlanishi kerak. Buning "
"uchun :guilabel:`Vendor Bill` da qo'llangan soliqqa o'ting va u "
"yerda :guilabel:`Tax Support` ni o'zgartiring."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:624
msgid ""
"A withholding tax can be divided into two or more lines, depending on "
"whether two or more withholding percentages apply."
msgstr ""
"Ushlab qolinadigan soliq, ikki yoki undan ortiq ushlab qolish foizlari "
"qo'llanilishiga qarab, ikki yoki undan ortiq qatorlarga bo'linishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:628
msgid ""
"Odoo suggests a VAT withholding of 30% with tax support 01. VAT withholding "
