"elektron hisob-fakturani 2026-yil 1-sentabrdan oldin sozlayotgan "
"bo'lsangiz, :guilabel:`Pilot Phase` variantini yoqing va :guilabel:`Validate "
"Registration` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:187
msgid ""
"Your French e-invoicing ID is now ready to send and receive e-invoices and "
