msgstr ""
"Elektron hisob-faktura tarmog'i orqali yuborishga tayyor bo'lgan barcha "
"hisob-fakturalarni quyidagi usullar bilan ko'rish mumkin:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:270
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Invoices` list view, use the :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` "
