"tugmasini bosing. :guilabel:`Confirmation de la synchronisation de liasse "
"avec Odoo` oynasida summalarni ko'rib chiqing va zarur o'zgartirishlarni "
"kiriting. So'ngra *liasse fiscale*ning Odoo bilan sinxronizatsiyasini "
"tasdiqlash va balansni import qilish uchun :guilabel:`Importer la balance` "
"tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:879
msgid ""
