msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Amount` maydoniga jami :guilabel:`VAT to pay` summasini "
"kiriting; :guilabel:`Amount to pay` maydoni avtomatik ravishda yangilanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:911
msgid ""
