#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:951
msgid "VAT anti-fraud certification"
msgstr "QQS firibgarlikka qarshi sertifikatlash"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:953
msgid ""
"Since January 2018, new anti-fraud legislation has been in effect in France "
"and its overseas territories (DOM-TOM). This legislation establishes "
"specific requirements for the integrity, security, storage, and archiving of "
"sales data. Odoo complies with these legal requirements by providing a "
"module and a downloadable certificate of conformity."
msgstr ""
"2018-yil yanvaridan boshlab Fransiya va uning dengiz orti hududlarida (DOM-"
"TOM) firibgarlikka qarshi yangi qonunchilik amal qilmoqda. Ushbu qonunchilik "
"sotuv ma'lumotlarining yaxlitligi, xavfsizligi, saqlanishi va arxivlanishi "
"bo'yicha maxsus talablarni belgilaydi. Odoo modul va yuklab olinadigan "
"muvofiqlik sertifikatini taqdim etish orqali ushbu qonuniy talablarga rioya "
"qiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:958
msgid ""
"Anti-fraud cash register software, such as Odoo (CGI art. 286, I. 3° bis), "
"is required for companies taxable in France or DOM-TOM, where some customers "
"are private individuals (B2C). This rule applies to all company sizes, but "
"auto-entrepreneurs exempt from VAT are unaffected."
msgstr ""
"Odoo kabi firibgarlikka qarshi kassa dasturi (CGI art. 286, I. 3° bis) "
"Fransiya yoki DOM-TOM hududida soliq to'lovchi bo'lgan, ayrim mijozlari "
"jismoniy shaxslar (B2C) bo'lgan kompaniyalar uchun talab qilinadi. Ushbu "
"qoida barcha o'lchamdagi kompaniyalarga tegishli, ammo QQSdan ozod qilingan "
"yakka tartibdagi tadbirkorlarga ta'sir qilmaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:963
msgid ""
"`Frequently Asked Questions <https://www.economie.gouv.fr/files/files/"
"directions_services/dgfip/controle_fiscal/actualites_reponses/"
"logiciels_de_caisse.pdf>`_"
msgstr ""
