#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:973
msgid "Odoo certification"
msgstr "Odoo sertifikatlashi"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:975
msgid ""
"The tax administration requires all companies to provide a certificate of "
"conformity confirming that their software complies with anti-fraud "
"legislation. In case of non-compliance, a €7,500 fine may be imposed."
msgstr ""
"Soliq ma'muriyati barcha kompaniyalardan o'z dasturiy ta'minoti "
"firibgarlikka qarshi qonunchilikka mos kelishini tasdiqlovchi muvofiqlik "
"sertifikatini taqdim etishni talab qiladi. Talablarga rioya qilinmagan "
"taqdirda 7 500 yevro miqdorida jarima solinishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:980
msgid ""
"This `certificate <https://www.odoo.com/my/contract/french-certification/>`_ "
"is granted by Odoo SA to Odoo Enterprise users with a subscription number."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu `sertifikat <https://www.odoo.com/my/contract/french-certification/>`_ "
"obuna raqamiga ega Odoo Enterprise foydalanuvchilariga Odoo SA tomonidan "
"beriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:983
msgid "To get the certification, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Sertifikat olish uchun quyidagi qadamlarni bajaring:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:985
msgid ""
