msgstr ""
"Agar kompyuteringizda DATEV Belegtransfer dasturi `o'rnatilmagan <https://"
"apps.datev.de/myupdates/download/products/ddc1adec-4b1e-4581-"
"b5b0-504fe0d68fd2>`_ bo'lsa, bu borada yordam so'rab soliq maslahatchingizga "
