msgstr ""
"DATEV ATCH ZIP fayli Odoo hisob-fakturasi yoki yetkazib beruvchi hisobiga "
"bog'langan fayllarni (hisobotlarni) o'z ichiga oladi. Mijoz hisob-"
"fakturalari uchun fayl :guilabel:`Send` tugmasi yordamida yaratilgan "
"bo'lishi kerak. Yetkazib beruvchi hisoblari uchun fayl email taxallusi "
"orqali qabul qilingan yoki :guilabel:`Upload` tugmasi yordamida yuklangan "
"bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:68
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:90
msgid "DATEV ATCH ZIP file"
msgstr "DATEV ATCH ZIP fayli"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:70
