msgstr ""
":guilabel:`E-Faktur UoM code` ni sozlash uchun :menuselection:`Inventory --> "
"Configuration --> UoM Categories` yo'lidan o'ting. Kategoriyani oching va "
"variantlardan mos :guilabel:`E-Faktur UoM Code` ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:None
