msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Contacts --> Configuration --> Bank Accounts` yo'lidan "
"o'ting va QRIS-ni faollashtirmoqchi bo'lgan bank hisobini tanlang. QRIS "
"tomonidan taqdim etilgan ma'lumotlarga asoslanib :guilabel:`QRIS API Key` "
"va :guilabel:`QRIS Merchant ID` maydonlarini o'rnating."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:171
msgid ""
"The account holder's country must be set to `Indonesia` on its contact form."
msgstr ""
"Hisob egasining mamlakati uning kontakt formasida `Indonesia` deb "
"o'rnatilgan bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/indonesia.rst:184
