msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> Automation: Scheduled Actions` "
"yo'lidan o'ting va :guilabel:`KE eTIMS: Receive Customs Imports from the "
"OSCU` amalini qidiring."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/kenya.rst:335
