msgstr ":guilabel:`Name`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:169
msgid ":guilabel:`Production`: `ODOO S.A.`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Production`: `ODOO S.A.`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:170
msgid ":guilabel:`Pre-production`: `OXXX_XXXXA.`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Pre-production`: `OXXX_XXXXA.`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:172
msgid ""
"Grant the following permissions by clicking the :icon:`fa-toggle-"
"on` :guilabel:`(toggle-on)` icon:"
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-toggle-on` :guilabel:`(toggle-on)` belgisini bosish orqali "
"quyidagi ruxsatlarni bering:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:175
msgid ":guilabel:`Representation From`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Representation From`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:176
msgid ":guilabel:`Document - Submit`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Document - Submit`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:177
msgid ":guilabel:`Document - Cancel`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Document - Cancel`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:178
msgid ":guilabel:`Document - Request Rejection`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Document - Request Rejection`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:181
msgid "Access can be revoked in the future if needed."
msgstr "Zarur bo'lsa, kirish huquqini kelajakda bekor qilish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:182
msgid ""
"Odoo, as an intermediary, does not store invoices sent on behalf of the "
"client on the proxy server."
msgstr ""
"Odoo vositachi sifatida mijoz nomidan yuborilgan hisob-fakturalarni proksi "
"serverda saqlamaydi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:185
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Save`. The status for `ODOO S.A.` is "
"then :guilabel:`Active`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Save` tugmasini bosing. Shundan so'ng `ODOO S.A.` uchun "
"holat :guilabel:`Active` bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:0
msgid "MyInvois status active"
msgstr "MyInvois faol holati"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:200
msgid ""
"Open the Settings app, navigate to the :guilabel:`Companies` section, and "
"click :guilabel:`Update Info`. Make sure the :guilabel:`Tax ID` is entered "
"and complete the following fields in the :guilabel:`E-invoicing` section:"
msgstr ""
"Settings ilovasini oching, :guilabel:`Companies` bo'limiga o'ting "
"va :guilabel:`Update Info` tugmasini bosing. :guilabel:`Tax ID` "
"kiritilganligiga ishonch hosil qiling va :guilabel:`E-invoicing` bo'limida "
"quyidagi maydonlarni to'ldiring:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:204
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Identification`: Select the :guilabel:`ID Type` and enter the "
"associated :guilabel:`Identification number` used to register for the "
"digital certificate."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Identification`: :guilabel:`ID Type` ni tanlang va raqamli "
"sertifikat uchun ro'yxatdan o'tishda ishlatilgan "
"tegishli :guilabel:`Identification number` ni kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:206
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Ind. Classification`: Input the 5-digit numeric code that "
"represents the nature and activity of the business."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Ind. Classification`: Biznesning xususiyati va faoliyatini "
"ifodalovchi 5 xonali raqamli kodni kiriting."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:210
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:362
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:425
msgid "Electronic invoicing"
msgstr "Elektron hisob-faktura yuritish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:212
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Malaysian Electronic Invoicing` section, select the "
"relevant :guilabel:`MyInvois mode` based on the environment used for the "
"company's MyInvois registration."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` yo'lidan "
"o'ting. :guilabel:`Malaysian Electronic Invoicing` bo'limida kompaniyaning "
"MyInvois ro'yxatdan o'tishida ishlatilgan muhitga asoslanib "
"tegishli :guilabel:`MyInvois mode` ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:216
msgid ""
"Make sure to allow Odoo to process e-invoices by checking the box, then "
"click :guilabel:`Register`."
msgstr ""
"Katakchani belgilash orqali Odoo'ga elektron hisob-fakturalarni qayta "
"ishlashga ruxsat berganingizga ishonch hosil qiling, "
"so'ngra :guilabel:`Register` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:219
msgid ""
"To change the :abbr:`TIN (tax identification number)` reference, "
"click :guilabel:`Unregister`, change the company's information and make sure "
"the number registered on MyInvois matches, then :guilabel:`Register` again."
msgstr ""
":abbr:`TIN (tax identification number)` ma'lumotnomasini o'zgartirish "
"uchun :guilabel:`Unregister` tugmasini bosing, kompaniya ma'lumotlarini "
"o'zgartiring va MyInvois'da ro'yxatdan o'tgan raqam mos kelishiga ishonch "
"hosil qiling, so'ngra yana :guilabel:`Register` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:224
msgid ""
"For taxpayers with a :abbr:`TIN (tax identification number)` starting with "
"\"IG\" and a :abbr:`ROB (registration of business)` number, combine the TIN "
"and ROB in the **TIN:ROB** format for the :guilabel:`Tax ID` field."
msgstr ""
"\"IG\" bilan boshlanadigan :abbr:`TIN (tax identification number)` "
"va :abbr:`ROB (registration of business)` raqamiga ega soliq to'lovchilar "
"uchun :guilabel:`Tax ID` maydonida TIN va ROB ni **TIN:ROB** formatida "
"birlashtiring."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:228
msgid ""
"To register, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, and in the :guilabel:`Malaysian Electronic Invoicing` section, "
"click :guilabel:`Register`. Once the registration is complete, the **:ROB** "
"can be removed from the :guilabel:`Tax ID`."
msgstr ""
"Ro'yxatdan o'tish uchun :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> "
"Settings` yo'lidan o'ting va :guilabel:`Malaysian Electronic Invoicing` "
"bo'limida :guilabel:`Register` tugmasini bosing. Ro'yxatdan o'tish tugagach, "
"**:ROB** ni :guilabel:`Tax ID` dan olib tashlash mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:232
msgid ""
"Additionally, remember to log into `MyTax account <https://"
"mytax.hasil.gov.my/>`_ and set the :guilabel:`Type of Role` "
"as :guilabel:`Business Owner`."
msgstr ""
"Bundan tashqari, `MyTax account <https://mytax.hasil.gov.my/>`_ tizimiga "
"kirishni va :guilabel:`Type of Role` ni :guilabel:`Business Owner` sifatida "
"belgilashni unutmang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:240
msgid "Access the contact's form and fill in the following fields:"
msgstr "Kontakt formasini oching va quyidagi maydonlarni to'ldiring:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:245
msgid ":guilabel:`Tax ID`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Tax ID`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:246
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Identification`: the :guilabel:`ID Type` and the "
"corresponding :guilabel:`Identification number` of the contact registered on "
"MyTax."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Identification`: MyTax'da ro'yxatdan o'tgan "
"kontaktning :guilabel:`ID Type` va unga mos :guilabel:`Identification "
"number` ma'lumotlari."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:250
msgid ""
"For specific use cases—such as transactions with buyers without a :abbr:`TIN "
"(tax identification number)` or foreign customers—refer to the list of "
"general TINs provided in the **Appendix** of the `e-Invoice Specific "
"Guideline <https://www.hasil.gov.my/en/e-invoice/reference-for-the-"
"implementation-of-e-invoice/guidelines/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Maxsus holatlar uchun — masalan, :abbr:`TIN (tax identification number)` "
"raqamiga ega bo'lmagan xaridorlar yoki xorijiy mijozlar bilan operatsiyalar "
"— `e-Invoice Specific Guideline <https://www.hasil.gov.my/en/e-invoice/"
"reference-for-the-implementation-of-e-invoice/guidelines/>`_ hujjatining "
"**Appendix** qismida keltirilgan umumiy TIN raqamlari ro'yxatiga murojaat "
"qiling."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:260
msgid ""
"All products to be included in e-invoices require a Malaysian classification "
"code. To add it, access the :guilabel:`Product` form and in "
"the :guilabel:`General Information` tab, fill in the :guilabel:`Malaysian "
"classification code` field."
msgstr ""
"Elektron hisob-fakturalarga kiritiladigan barcha mahsulotlar uchun Malayziya "
"tasnif kodi talab qilinadi. Uni qo'shish uchun :guilabel:`Product` formasini "
"oching va :guilabel:`General Information` varag'ida :guilabel:`Malaysian "
"classification code` maydonini to'ldiring."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:265
msgid "Malaysian tax type"
msgstr "Malayziya soliq turi"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:267
msgid ""
"To configure a tax's :guilabel:`Malaysian Tax Type` field, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Accounting --> Taxes` "
"and open the relevant tax in the :guilabel:`Taxes` list view."
msgstr ""
"Soliqning :guilabel:`Malaysian Tax Type` maydonini sozlash "
"uchun :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Accounting --> Taxes` "
"yo'lidan o'ting va :guilabel:`Taxes` ro'yxat ko'rinishida tegishli soliqni "
"oching."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:271
msgid ""
"When an invoice or bill includes a tax with the :guilabel:`Malaysian Tax "
"Type` set to **Tax Exempt**, a :guilabel:`Tax Exemption Reason` must be "
"specified in the :guilabel:`MyInvois` tab before the document is sent."
msgstr ""
"Hisob-faktura yoki yetkazib beruvchi hisobida :guilabel:`Malaysian Tax Type` "
"maydoni **Tax Exempt** qilib belgilangan soliq mavjud bo'lsa, hujjat "
"yuborilishidan oldin :guilabel:`MyInvois` varag'ida :guilabel:`Tax Exemption "
"Reason` ko'rsatilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:None
msgid "MyInvois tax exemption reason"
msgstr "MyInvois soliqdan ozod qilish sababi"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:286
msgid "Send invoices to MyInvois"
msgstr "Hisob-fakturalarni MyInvois'ga yuborish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:288
msgid ""
"Invoices can be sent to MyInvois once they have been confirmed. To do so, "
"click :guilabel:`Send to MyInvois`."
msgstr ""
"Hisob-fakturalar tasdiqlangandan so'ng ularni MyInvois'ga yuborish mumkin. "
"Buning uchun :guilabel:`Send to MyInvois` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:292
msgid ""
"For invoices in foreign currencies, the exchange rate applied to the invoice "
"is sent to :guilabel:`MyInvois`."
msgstr ""
"Xorijiy valyutadagi hisob-fakturalar uchun hisob-fakturaga qo'llangan "
"valyuta kursi :guilabel:`MyInvois` ga yuboriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:296
msgid "Send bills to MyInvois"
msgstr "Yetkazib beruvchi hisoblarini MyInvois'ga yuborish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:298
msgid ""
"Sending a bill to MyInvois is necessary when issuing an e-Invoice on behalf "
"of a supplier. Once a bill is confirmed, click :guilabel:`Send To MyInvois`."
msgstr ""
"Ta'minotchi nomidan elektron hisob-faktura chiqarishda yetkazib beruvchi "
"hisobini MyInvois'ga yuborish zarur. Yetkazib beruvchi hisobi "
"tasdiqlangandan so'ng :guilabel:`Send To MyInvois` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:302
msgid ""
"In `MyInvois <https://preprod.myinvois.hasil.gov.my/content>`_, these vendor "
"bills are categorized as :guilabel:`Self-billed Invoice`."
msgstr ""
"`MyInvois <https://preprod.myinvois.hasil.gov.my/content>`_ tizimida bu "
"yetkazib beruvchi hisoblari :guilabel:`Self-billed Invoice` sifatida "
"tasniflanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:305
msgid ""
"If a :guilabel:`Bill Reference` field is empty, Odoo's vendor bill number is "
"used as the MyInvois number. If a reference is entered in "
"the :guilabel:`Bill Reference` field, that reference is used instead."
msgstr ""
"Agar :guilabel:`Bill Reference` maydoni bo'sh bo'lsa, MyInvois raqami "
"sifatida Odoo'ning yetkazib beruvchi hisobi raqami ishlatiladi. "
"Agar :guilabel:`Bill Reference` maydoniga ma'lumotnoma kiritilgan bo'lsa, "
"uning o'rniga o'sha ma'lumotnoma ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:312
msgid "MyInvois status"
msgstr "MyInvois holati"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:314
msgid ""
"The current MyInvois status of an invoice or bill is shown in "
"the :guilabel:`MyInvois State` field within the :guilabel:`MyInvois` tab."
msgstr ""
"Hisob-faktura yoki yetkazib beruvchi hisobining joriy MyInvois "
"holati :guilabel:`MyInvois` varag'idagi :guilabel:`MyInvois State` maydonida "
"ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:317
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Validation in Progress`: the validation is being processed by "
"MyInvois. A blue :guilabel:`Processing` banner is also displayed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Validation in Progress`: tekshiruv MyInvois tomonidan qayta "
"ishlanmoqda. Shuningdek, ko'k rangli :guilabel:`Processing` banneri "
"ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:319
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Valid`: it is validated by MyInvois. The :guilabel:`Submission "
"UID`, :guilabel:`MyInvois` and :guilabel:`Validation Time` are automatically "
"updated with information from MyInvois."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Valid`: u MyInvois tomonidan tasdiqlangan. :guilabel:`Submission "
"UID`, :guilabel:`MyInvois` va :guilabel:`Validation Time` MyInvois'dan "
"olingan ma'lumotlar bilan avtomatik yangilanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:324
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically checks and updates the status every hour. To update it "
"manually at any time, click :guilabel:`Update MyInvois Status`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo holatni har soatda avtomatik tekshiradi va yangilaydi. Uni istalgan "
"vaqtda qo'lda yangilash uchun :guilabel:`Update MyInvois Status` tugmasini "
"bosing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:332
msgid ""
"Sent invoices can be canceled within 72 hours from :guilabel:`Validation "
"time`. In this case, open the invoice and click :guilabel:`Request Cancel`. "
"In the :guilabel:`Cancel document` window, include the "
"cancellation :guilabel:`Reason`, then click :guilabel:`Update Invoice`. "
"The :guilabel:`MyInvois State` is updated to :guilabel:`cancelled`."
msgstr ""
"Yuborilgan hisob-fakturalarni :guilabel:`Validation time` vaqtidan boshlab "
"72 soat ichida bekor qilish mumkin. Bunday holda, hisob-fakturani oching "
"va :guilabel:`Request Cancel` tugmasini bosing. :guilabel:`Cancel document` "
"oynasida bekor qilish :guilabel:`Reason` sababini kiriting, "
"so'ngra :guilabel:`Update Invoice` tugmasini bosing. :guilabel:`MyInvois "
"State` holati :guilabel:`cancelled` ga yangilanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:338
msgid "Send credit notes to MyInvois"
msgstr "Kredit-notalarni MyInvois'ga yuborish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:340
msgid ""
"Before sending a credit note, the original invoice must be successfully "
"submitted to MyInvois. Otherwise, the credit note's :guilabel:`MyInvois "
"State` is updated to :guilabel:`Invalid`."
msgstr ""
"Kredit-notani yuborishdan oldin asl hisob-faktura MyInvois'ga muvaffaqiyatli "
"taqdim etilgan bo'lishi kerak. Aks holda, kredit-"
"notaning :guilabel:`MyInvois State` holati :guilabel:`Invalid` ga "
"yangilanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:343
msgid ""
"While Odoo uses a single :guilabel:`credit note` document, MyInvois "
"categorizes these into two types: :guilabel:`credit note` "
"and :guilabel:`refund note`, depending on how they are reconciled."
msgstr ""
"Odoo yagona :guilabel:`credit note` hujjatidan foydalansa-da, MyInvois "
"ularni solishtirilish usuliga qarab ikki turga ajratadi: :guilabel:`credit "
"note` va :guilabel:`refund note`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:346
msgid ""
":guilabel:`MyInvois Credit Note`: This is created when an Odoo credit note "
"is reconciled with the original invoice."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`MyInvois Credit Note`: Bu Odoo kredit-notasi asl hisob-faktura "
"bilan solishtirilganda yaratiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:348
msgid ""
":guilabel:`MyInvois Refund Note`: This is created when an Odoo credit note "
"is reconciled with a full payment instead of the original invoice."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`MyInvois Refund Note`: Bu Odoo kredit-notasi asl hisob-faktura "
"o'rniga to'liq to'lov bilan solishtirilganda yaratiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:352
msgid ""
"If a credit note is reconciled with only a partial payment before being "
"sent, it is still categorized as a :guilabel:`credit note` in MyInvois."
msgstr ""
"Agar kredit-nota yuborilishidan oldin faqat qisman to'lov bilan "
"solishtirilgan bo'lsa, u MyInvois'da baribir :guilabel:`credit note` "
"sifatida tasniflanadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:358
msgid ""
"To issue both a credit note and a refund note for the same original invoice:"
msgstr ""
"Bitta asl hisob-faktura uchun ham kredit-nota, ham qaytarish notasini "
"chiqarish uchun:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:357
msgid "Create two separate credit notes in Odoo from the original invoice."
msgstr "Asl hisob-fakturadan Odoo'da ikkita alohida kredit-nota yarating."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:358
msgid ""
"For a MyInvois :guilabel:`Refund Note`: Register a payment before sending it."
msgstr ""
"MyInvois :guilabel:`Refund Note` uchun: Yuborishdan oldin to'lovni "
"ro'yxatdan o'tkazing."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:359
msgid ""
"For a MyInvois :guilabel:`Credit Note`: Do not register a payment before "
"sending it."
msgstr ""
"MyInvois :guilabel:`Credit Note` uchun: Yuborishdan oldin to'lovni "
"ro'yxatdan o'tkazmang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:362
msgid ""
"The same logic applies to credit notes created from bills: if reconciled "
"with a full payment, the credit note becomes a :guilabel:`Self-billed Refund "
"Note`; otherwise, it becomes a :guilabel:`Self-billed Credit Note`."
msgstr ""
"Xuddi shu mantiq yetkazib beruvchi hisoblaridan yaratilgan kredit-notalarga "
"ham tegishli: agar to'liq to'lov bilan solishtirilgan bo'lsa, kredit-"
"nota :guilabel:`Self-billed Refund Note` ga aylanadi; aks holda "
"u :guilabel:`Self-billed Credit Note` bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:367
msgid "Send debit notes to MyInvois"
msgstr "Debet-notalarni MyInvois'ga yuborish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:369
msgid ""
":ref:`Issue a debit note from an existing bill or invoice <accounting/"
"credit_notes/issue-debit-note>` and click :guilabel:`Send To MyInvois`. In "
"MyInvois, it appears then as a :guilabel:`Debit Note` if issued from an "
"invoice or a :guilabel:`Self-billed Debit Note` from a vendor bill."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Mavjud yetkazib beruvchi hisobi yoki hisob-fakturadan debet-nota "
"chiqaring <accounting/credit_notes/issue-debit-note>` va :guilabel:`Send To "
"MyInvois` tugmasini bosing. Keyin MyInvois'da u hisob-fakturadan chiqarilgan "
"bo'lsa :guilabel:`Debit Note` sifatida, yetkazib beruvchi hisobidan "
"chiqarilgan bo'lsa :guilabel:`Self-billed Debit Note` sifatida ko'rinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:376
msgid "POS workflow"
msgstr "POS ish jarayoni"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:378
msgid ""
"Two workflows are available to issue e-invoices in :doc:`Point of Sale "
"<../../sales/point_of_sale>`:"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Point of Sale <../../sales/point_of_sale>` da elektron hisob-"
"fakturalarni chiqarish uchun ikkita ish jarayoni mavjud:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:380
msgid ""
":ref:`Individual e-invoice <malaysia/myinvois/pos_workflow/submit>`: Issue "
"an e-invoice immediately for a specific order using the customer's details."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Individual elektron hisob-faktura <malaysia/myinvois/pos_workflow/"
"submit>`: Mijoz ma'lumotlaridan foydalanib, muayyan buyurtma uchun darhol "
"elektron hisob-faktura chiqaring."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:382
msgid ""
":ref:`Consolidated e-invoice <malaysia/myinvois/pos_workflow/consolidated>`: "
"Create orders as usual, then aggregate them periodically into a single "
"consolidated e-invoice."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Birlashtirilgan elektron hisob-faktura <malaysia/myinvois/pos_workflow/"
"consolidated>`: Buyurtmalarni odatdagidek yarating, so'ngra ularni davriy "
"ravishda bitta birlashtirilgan elektron hisob-fakturaga jamlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:388
msgid "Individual e-invoice"
msgstr "Individual elektron hisob-faktura"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:390
msgid ""
"To issue an individual e-invoice and send it to MyInvois, :doc:`create an "
"invoice </applications/sales/point_of_sale/use/pos_invoices>`, and ensure "
"the selected customer has a valid :abbr:`TIN (tax identification number)` or "
"**Identification Number**."
msgstr ""
"Individual elektron hisob-faktura chiqarish va uni MyInvois'ga yuborish "
"uchun :doc:`hisob-faktura yarating </applications/sales/point_of_sale/use/"
"pos_invoices>` va tanlangan mijozda yaroqli :abbr:`TIN (tax identification "
"number)` yoki **Identification Number** mavjudligiga ishonch hosil qiling."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:395
msgid ""
"If the QR code does not appear on the invoice, the MyInvois validation is "
"still in progress. Odoo automatically retrieves the status in the "
"background. Simply reopen the invoice later to retrieve the validated "
"version with the QR code."
msgstr ""
"Agar hisob-fakturada QR kod ko'rinmasa, MyInvois tasdiqlashi hali davom "
"etmoqda. Odoo holatni fon rejimida avtomatik oladi. QR kodli tasdiqlangan "
"versiyani olish uchun keyinroq hisob-fakturani qayta oching."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:402
msgid "Consolidated e-invoice"
msgstr "Birlashtirilgan elektron hisob-faktura"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:404
