#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:855
msgid ""
"It is important to check the :guilabel:`Is M1 or L?` checkbox if the vehicle "
"has fewer than four wheels or fewer than eight seats."
msgstr ""
"Agar transport vositasining g'ildiraklari to'rttadan kam yoki o'rindiqlari "
"sakkiztadan kam bo'lsa, :guilabel:`Is M1 or L?` katagini belgilash muhimdir."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:None
msgid "Vehicle not selected as an M1 or L type with extra fields shown."
msgstr ""
"M1 yoki L turi sifatida tanlanmagan transport vositasi qo'shimcha maydonlar "
"bilan ko'rsatilgan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:864
msgid ""
"To configure the available products, navigate to :menuselection:`Inventory --"
"> Products` and open the product to be configured."
msgstr ""
"Mavjud mahsulotlarni sozlash uchun :menuselection:`Inventory --> Products` "
"yo'lidan o'ting va sozlanishi kerak bo'lgan mahsulotni oching."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:867
msgid ""
"Make sure that the applicable information in the product form is fully "
"configured. The :guilabel:`Partida Arancelaria` (Tariff Item) field needs to "
"be completed."
msgstr ""
"Mahsulot formasidagi tegishli ma'lumotlar to'liq sozlanganligiga ishonch "
"hosil qiling. :guilabel:`Partida Arancelaria` (Tarif moddasi) maydoni "
"to'ldirilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:871
msgid "Generating a GRE"
msgstr "GRE yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:873
msgid ""
"Once the delivery from inventory is created during the sales workflow, make "
