msgstr ":guilabel:`Reason for Transfer`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:878
msgid ":guilabel:`Departure start date`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Departure start date`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:880
msgid ""
"It is also required to complete the :guilabel:`Vehicle` "
"and :guilabel:`Operator` fields under the :guilabel:`Guia de Remision PE` "
"tab."
msgstr ""
"Shuningdek, :guilabel:`Guia de Remision PE` varag'idagi :guilabel:`Vehicle` "
"va :guilabel:`Operator` maydonlarini to'ldirish talab qilinadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:883
msgid ""
"The delivery transfer has to be marked as *Done* for the :guilabel:`Generar "
"Guia de Remision` button to appear on the left menu of the transfer form."
msgstr ""
"O'tkazma formasining chap menyusida :guilabel:`Generar Guia de Remision` "
"tugmasi paydo bo'lishi uchun yetkazib berish o'tkazmasi *Done* deb "
"belgilanishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:None
msgid "Generar Guia de Remision button on a transfer form in the Done stage."
msgstr ""
"Done bosqichidagi o'tkazma formasidagi Generar Guia de Remision tugmasi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:889
msgid ""
"Once the transfer form is correctly validated by |SUNAT|, the generated XML "
"file becomes available in the chatter. You can now print the delivery slip "
"that shows the transfer details and the QR code validated by |SUNAT|."
msgstr ""
"O'tkazma formasi |SUNAT| tomonidan to'g'ri tasdiqlangach, yaratilgan XML "
"fayl chatterda mavjud bo'ladi. Endi siz o'tkazma tafsilotlari va |SUNAT| "
"tomonidan tasdiqlangan QR kodni ko'rsatuvchi yetkazib berish varaqasini chop "
"etishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:None
msgid "Transfer details and QR code on generated delivery slip."
msgstr ""
"Yaratilgan yetkazib berish varaqasidagi o'tkazma tafsilotlari va QR kod."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:899
msgid "`Diferente prefijo para productos (T001 en algunos, T002 en otros)`"
msgstr "`Diferente prefijo para productos (T001 en algunos, T002 en otros)`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:901
msgid ""
"At the moment, Odoo does not support the automation of prefixes for "
"products. This can be done manually for each product output. This can also "
"be done for non-storable products. However, keep in mind that there will be "
"no traceability."
msgstr ""
"Hozirda Odoo mahsulotlar uchun prefikslarni avtomatlashtirishni qo'llab-"
"quvvatlamaydi. Buni har bir mahsulot chiqishi uchun qo'lda bajarish mumkin. "
"Buni saqlanmaydigan mahsulotlar uchun ham bajarish mumkin. Biroq, kuzatuv "
"imkoniyati bo'lmasligini yodda tuting."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:904
msgid ""
"`2325 - GrossWeightMeasure - El dato no cumple con el formato establecido "
"\"Hace falta el campo\" \"Peso\"\" en el producto`"
msgstr ""
"`2325 - GrossWeightMeasure - El dato no cumple con el formato establecido "
"\"Hace falta el campo\" \"Peso\"\" en el producto`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:907
msgid ""
"This error occurs when the weight on the product is set as `0.00`. To fix "
"this, you need to cancel the waybill and recreate it. Make sure that you fix "
"the weight on the product before creating the new waybill, or it will result "
"in the same error."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu xato mahsulotdagi og'irlik `0.00` deb belgilanganda yuz beradi. Buni "
"tuzatish uchun yuk xatini bekor qilib, qayta yaratishingiz kerak. Yangi yuk "
"xatini yaratishdan oldin mahsulotdagi og'irlikni tuzatganingizga ishonch "
"hosil qiling, aks holda xuddi shu xato yana yuz beradi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:910
msgid ""
"`JSONDecodeError: Expecting value: line 1 column 1 (char 0) when creating a "
"Delivery Guide`"
msgstr ""
"`JSONDecodeError: Expecting value: line 1 column 1 (char 0) when creating a "
"Delivery Guide`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:912
msgid ""
"This error is typically generated due to SOL user issues. Verify the user's "
"connection with the |SUNAT|; the SOL user must be established with the "
"company RUT + user ID. For example `2012188549JOHNSMITH`."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu xato odatda SOL foydalanuvchisi muammolari tufayli yuzaga keladi. "
"Foydalanuvchining |SUNAT| bilan ulanishini tekshiring; SOL foydalanuvchisi "
"kompaniya RUT + foydalanuvchi ID bilan o'rnatilishi kerak. Masalan, "
"`2012188549JOHNSMITH`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:915
msgid ""
"`El número de documento relacionado al traslado de mercancía no cumple con "
"el formato establecido: error: documento relacionado`"
msgstr ""
"`El número de documento relacionado al traslado de mercancía no cumple con "
"el formato establecido: error: documento relacionado`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:918
msgid ""
"The *Related Document Type* and *Related Document Number* fields only apply "
"to invoices and receipts."
msgstr ""
"*Related Document Type* va *Related Document Number* maydonlari faqat hisob-"
"fakturalar va kvitansiyalarga tegishlidir."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:920
msgid "`400 Client error: Bad Request for URL`"
msgstr "`400 Client error: Bad Request for URL`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:922
msgid ""
"This error is not solvable from Odoo; it is advised you reach out to the |"
"SUNAT| and verify the user. It may be necessary to create a new user."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu xatoni Odoo orqali hal qilib bo'lmaydi; |SUNAT| bilan bog'lanib, "
"foydalanuvchini tekshirish tavsiya etiladi. Yangi foydalanuvchi yaratish "
"kerak bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:925
msgid ""
"`Invalid content was found starting with element 'cac:BuyerCustomerParty'`"
msgstr ""
"`Invalid content was found starting with element 'cac:BuyerCustomerParty'`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:927
msgid ""
"This error occurs when the transfer reason is set as *other*. Please select "
"another option. Following to the official documentation of the |SUNAT|'s "
"waybill guide, the transfer reasons *03 (sale with shipment to third party)* "
"or *12 (others)* does not work in Odoo, since you should not have an empty "
"or blank customer."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu xato o'tkazma sababi *other* deb belgilanganda yuz beradi. Iltimos, "
"boshqa variantni tanlang. |SUNAT| yuk xati qo'llanmasining rasmiy "
"hujjatlariga ko'ra, *03 (uchinchi tomonga jo'natish bilan sotish)* yoki *12 "
"(boshqalar)* o'tkazma sabablari Odoo'da ishlamaydi, chunki mijoz bo'sh yoki "
"to'ldirilmagan bo'lmasligi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:931
msgid "`Duda cliente: consumo de créditos IAP al usar GRE 2.0`"
msgstr "`Duda cliente: consumo de créditos IAP al usar GRE 2.0`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:933
msgid ""
"For live clients using IAP, no credit is consumed (in theory) because it "
"does not go through the OSE, i.e., these documents are directly sent to the |"
"SUNAT|."
msgstr ""
"IAP dan foydalanadigan jonli mijozlar uchun kredit sarflanmaydi (nazariy "
"jihatdan), chunki u OSE orqali o'tmaydi, ya'ni ushbu hujjatlar to'g'ridan-"
"to'g'ri |SUNAT| ga yuboriladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:935
msgid "`Errores con formato credenciales GRE 2.0 (traceback error)`"
msgstr "`Errores con formato credenciales GRE 2.0 (traceback error)`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:937
msgid ""
"Odoo currently throws an error with a traceback instead of a message that "
"the credentials are not correctly configured in the database. If this occurs "
"on your database, please verify your credentials."
msgstr ""
"Hozirda Odoo hisob ma'lumotlari ma'lumotlar bazasida to'g'ri sozlanmaganligi "
"haqidagi xabar o'rniga traceback bilan xato chiqaradi. Agar bu sizning "
"ma'lumotlar bazangizda yuz bersa, iltimos, hisob ma'lumotlaringizni "
"tekshiring."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:944
msgid ""
"First, :ref:`install <general/install>` the **Peruvian eCommerce** "
"(`l10n_pe_website_sale`) module."
msgstr ""
"Avvalo, **Peruvian eCommerce** (`l10n_pe_website_sale`) "
"modulini :ref:`o'rnating <general/install>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:946
msgid ""
"The **Peruvian eCommerce** module enables the features and configurations to:"
msgstr ""
"**Peruvian eCommerce** moduli quyidagi funksiyalar va sozlamalarni yoqadi:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:948
msgid "allow clients to create online accounts for **eCommerce** purposes;"
msgstr ""
"mijozlarga **eCommerce** maqsadlari uchun onlayn hisoblar yaratishga ruxsat "
"berish;"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:949
msgid "support required fiscal fields in the **eCommerce** application;"
msgstr ""
"**eCommerce** ilovasida talab qilinadigan soliq maydonlarini qo'llab-"
"quvvatlash;"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:950
msgid "receive payments for sales orders online;"
msgstr "sotuv buyurtmalari uchun to'lovlarni onlayn qabul qilish;"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:951
msgid "generate electronic documents from the **eCommerce** application."
msgstr "**eCommerce** ilovasidan elektron hujjatlar yaratish."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:954
msgid ""
"The **Peruvian eCommerce** module is dependent on the previous installation "
"of the **Invoicing** or **Accounting** app, as well as the **Website** app."
msgstr ""
"**Peruvian eCommerce** moduli avvaldan **Invoicing** yoki **Accounting** "
"ilovasi, shuningdek **Website** ilovasi o'rnatilgan bo'lishiga bog'liq."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:962
msgid ""
"After configuring the Peruvian :ref:`electronic invoicing <peru-accounting-"
"settings>` flow, complete the following configurations for the **eCommerce** "
"flow:"
msgstr ""
"Peru :ref:`elektron hisob-faktura <peru-accounting-settings>` jarayonini "
"sozlagandan so'ng, **eCommerce** jarayoni uchun quyidagi sozlamalarni "
"bajaring:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:965
msgid ""
":ref:`Client account registration <ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-"
"access>`;"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Mijoz hisobini ro'yxatdan o'tkazish <ecommerce/customer_accounts/"
"checkout-access>`;"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:966
msgid ":ref:`Automatic invoice <ecommerce/handling/invoices>`;"
msgstr ":ref:`Avtomatik hisob-faktura <ecommerce/handling/invoices>`;"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:967
msgid ""
":doc:`../../websites/ecommerce/configuration/products`: Set "
"the :guilabel:`Invoicing Policy` to :guilabel:`Ordered quantities` and "
"define the desired :guilabel:`Customer taxes`."
msgstr ""
":doc:`../../websites/ecommerce/configuration/products`: :guilabel:`Invoicing "
"Policy` maydonini :guilabel:`Ordered quantities` ga o'rnating va "
"kerakli :guilabel:`Customer taxes` ni belgilang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:969
msgid ":doc:`../payment_providers`;"
msgstr ":doc:`../payment_providers`;"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:970
msgid ""
":doc:`../../websites/ecommerce/shipping`: For each shipping method, set "
"the :guilabel:`Provider` field to :guilabel:`Fixed Price`. Then, set "
"a :guilabel:`Fixed Price` amount greater than `0.00` (not zero), as the "
"shipping method price is added to the invoice line."
msgstr ""
":doc:`../../websites/ecommerce/shipping`: Har bir yetkazib berish usuli "
"uchun :guilabel:`Provider` maydonini :guilabel:`Fixed Price` ga o'rnating. "
"So'ngra :guilabel:`Fixed Price` miqdorini `0.00` dan katta (nol emas) qilib "
"belgilang, chunki yetkazib berish usuli narxi hisob-faktura qatoriga "
"qo'shiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:975
msgid ""
"`Mercado Pago <https://www.mercadopago.com/>`_ is an online payment provider "
"supported in Odoo that covers several countries, currencies, and payment "
"methods in Latin America."
msgstr ""
"`Mercado Pago <https://www.mercadopago.com/>`_ — Odoo'da qo'llab-"
"quvvatlanadigan onlayn to'lov provayderi bo'lib, Lotin Amerikasidagi bir "
"nechta mamlakatlar, valyutalar va to'lov usullarini qamrab oladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:977
msgid ""
"Make sure to define a :guilabel:`Sales Price` on the :guilabel:`Delivery "
"Product` of the shipping method to prevent errors when validating the "
"invoice with |SUNAT|."
msgstr ""
"Hisob-fakturani |SUNAT| bilan tasdiqlashda xatolarning oldini olish uchun "
"yetkazib berish usulining :guilabel:`Delivery Product` da :guilabel:`Sales "
"Price` belgilanganligiga ishonch hosil qiling."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:979
msgid ""
"To offer free delivery, manually remove the :guilabel:`Delivery Product`, or "
"at least use `$0.01` (one cent) for the invoice to be validated with SUNAT."
msgstr ""
"Bepul yetkazib berishni taklif qilish uchun :guilabel:`Delivery Product` ni "
"qo'lda olib tashlang yoki hisob-faktura SUNAT bilan tasdiqlanishi uchun "
"kamida `$0.01` (bir sent) dan foydalaning."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:983
msgid ""
":doc:`Set up the Mercado Pago payment provider. <../payment_providers/"
"mercado_pago>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Mercado Pago to'lov provayderini sozlang. <../payment_providers/"
"mercado_pago>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:988
msgid ""
"Once the :ref:`configurations <peru-ecommerce-configuration>` are all set, "
"fiscal input fields will be available during the checkout process for signed-"
"in customers."
msgstr ""
"Barcha :ref:`sozlamalar <peru-ecommerce-configuration>` o'rnatilgach, "
"tizimga kirgan mijozlar uchun buyurtmani rasmiylashtirish jarayonida soliq "
"ma'lumotlarini kiritish maydonlari mavjud bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:991
msgid ""
"When customers enter their fiscal data at checkout and complete a successful "
"purchase, the invoice is generated with the corresponding |EDI| elements. "
"The document type (Boleta/Factura) is selected based on their tax ID (RUC/"
"DNI). The invoice must then :ref:`be sent to the OSE and the SUNAT <peru-"
"electronic-invoice-status>`. By default, all published invoices are sent "
"once a day through a scheduled action, but you can also send each invoice "
"manually if needed."
msgstr ""
"Mijozlar buyurtmani rasmiylashtirishda o'zlarining soliq ma'lumotlarini "
"kiritib, xaridni muvaffaqiyatli yakunlaganlarida, hisob-faktura tegishli |"
"EDI| elementlari bilan yaratiladi. Hujjat turi (Boleta/Factura) ularning "
"soliq identifikatori (RUC/DNI) asosida tanlanadi. Keyin hisob-"
"faktura :ref:`OSE va SUNAT ga yuborilishi kerak <peru-electronic-invoice-"
"status>`. Standart bo'yicha, barcha e'lon qilingan hisob-fakturalar "
"rejalashtirilgan amal orqali kuniga bir marta yuboriladi, lekin kerak "
"bo'lsa, har bir hisob-fakturani qo'lda ham yuborishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:997
msgid ""
"Once the invoice is validated with |SUNAT|, customers can download the .zip "
"file with the CDR, XML, and PDF files directly from the customer portal by "
"clicking the :guilabel:`Download` button."
msgstr ""
"Hisob-faktura |SUNAT| bilan tasdiqlangach, mijozlar :guilabel:`Download` "
"tugmasini bosish orqali CDR, XML va PDF fayllarini o'z ichiga olgan .zip "
"faylini to'g'ridan-to'g'ri mijoz portalidan yuklab olishlari mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1006
msgid "Permanent inventory reports: |PLE| 12.1 and |PLE| 13.1"
msgstr "Doimiy inventarizatsiya hisobotlari: |PLE| 12.1 va |PLE| 13.1"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1009
msgid ""
"Make sure to :ref:`set <peru/configuration-ple>` the appropriate type of "
"chart of accounts for your PLE reports."
msgstr ""
"PLE hisobotlaringiz uchun tegishli hisoblar rejasi "
"turini :ref:`o'rnatganingizga <peru/configuration-ple>` ishonch hosil qiling."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1012
msgid ""
"Odoo can produce two permanent inventory reports as `.txt` files for "
"Peruvian accounting: |PLE| 12.1 and |PLE| 13.1. All inventory transactions "
"made need to be reported."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Peru buxgalteriya hisobi uchun ikkita doimiy inventarizatsiya "
"hisobotini `.txt` fayllari sifatida yaratishi mumkin: |PLE| 12.1 va |PLE| "
"13.1. Amalga oshirilgan barcha inventarizatsiya tranzaksiyalari hisobotda "
"aks ettirilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1015
msgid ""
"|PLE| 12.1 **only tracks inventory in physical units**, focusing on the "
"inflow and outflow of goods for effective management and planning."
msgstr ""
"|PLE| 12.1 **inventarizatsiyani faqat jismoniy birliklarda kuzatadi** va "
"samarali boshqarish hamda rejalashtirish uchun tovarlarning kirimi va "
"chiqimiga e'tibor qaratadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1018
msgid ""
"|PLE| 13.1 tracks **both physical quantities and monetary values of "
"inventory**, providing a comprehensive view for tax and management purposes."
msgstr ""
"|PLE| 13.1 **inventarning ham fizik miqdorlarini, ham pul qiymatlarini** "
"kuzatib boradi va soliq hamda boshqaruv maqsadlari uchun keng qamrovli "
"ko'rinishni taqdim etadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1021
msgid ""
"Both reports must be maintained semi-annually (January-June and July-"
"December), with monthly transaction details reported within these periods. "
"The submission deadlines are October 1st for the first semester and April "
"1st for the second semester, in accordance with the *Resolución de "
"Superintendencia N° 169-2015*."
msgstr ""
"Ikkala hisobot ham yarim yillik asosda (yanvar-iyun va iyul-dekabr) "
"yuritilishi kerak, bu davrlar ichida oylik tranzaksiya tafsilotlari hisobot "
"qilinadi. *Resolución de Superintendencia N° 169-2015* ga muvofiq, "
"topshirish muddatlari birinchi yarim yillik uchun 1-oktabr va ikkinchi yarim "
"yillik uchun 1-apreldir."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1029
msgid ""
"Before generating the |PLE| 12.1 or |PLE| 13.1 reports, make sure "
"the :guilabel:`Peru - Stock Reports` (`l10n_pe_reports_stock`) module is "
"installed, then update the fields for:"
msgstr ""
"|PLE| 12.1 yoki |PLE| 13.1 hisobotlarini yaratishdan oldin :guilabel:`Peru - "
"Stock Reports` (`l10n_pe_reports_stock`) moduli o'rnatilganligiga ishonch "
"hosil qiling, so'ngra quyidagilar uchun maydonlarni yangilang:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1032
msgid ":ref:`Products <peru/reports-ple-products>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Mahsulotlar <peru/reports-ple-products>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1033
msgid ":ref:`Warehouses <peru/reports-ple-warehouses>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Omborlar <peru/reports-ple-warehouses>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1034
msgid ":ref:`Inventory transfers <peru/reports-ple-transfers>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Inventar ko'chirishlari <peru/reports-ple-transfers>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1041
msgid ""
"Several configurations related to the product or product category are "
"necessary for |PLE| reporting:"
msgstr ""
"|PLE| hisoboti uchun mahsulot yoki mahsulot toifasiga oid bir nechta "
"sozlamalar zarur:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1043
msgid ""
"**Type of existence**: For all products needing |PLE| reporting, go to the "
"product record's :guilabel:`Accounting` tab and select the :guilabel:`Type "
"of Existence` according to |SUNAT|'s table 5 for inventory reporting."
msgstr ""
"**Mavjudlik turi**: |PLE| hisoboti kerak bo'lgan barcha mahsulotlar uchun "
"mahsulot yozuvining :guilabel:`Accounting` varag'iga o'ting va inventar "
"hisoboti uchun |SUNAT| ning 5-jadvaliga muvofiq :guilabel:`Type of "
"Existence` ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1047
msgid ""
"**Automatic inventory valuation**: For storable goods (:dfn:`products with "
"tracked inventory`), use :doc:`automatic inventory valuation <../../"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet>`. Once "
"automatic inventory valuation is enabled, this valuation method can be "
"enabled for a product's product category."
msgstr ""
"**Avtomatik inventar baholash**: Saqlanadigan tovarlar (:dfn:`inventari "
"kuzatiladigan mahsulotlar`) uchun :doc:`avtomatik inventar baholashdan "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet>` "
"foydalaning. Avtomatik inventar baholash yoqilgach, ushbu baholash usulini "
"mahsulotning mahsulot toifasi uchun yoqish mumkin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1052
msgid ""
"**Costing method:** Storable goods must use a :doc:`costing method <../../"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet>` **other** "
"than :guilabel:`Standard Price`, as the journal entries generated from stock "
"moves are used to populate the |PLE| reports."
msgstr ""
"**Tannarx hisoblash usuli:** Saqlanadigan tovarlar :guilabel:`Standard "
"Price` dan **boshqa** :doc:`tannarx hisoblash usulidan <../../"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet>` foydalanishi "
"kerak, chunki zaxira harakatlaridan yaratilgan jurnal yozuvlari |PLE| "
"hisobotlarini to'ldirish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1060
msgid "Warehouses"
msgstr "Omborlar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1062
msgid ""
"When :doc:`setting up a warehouse <../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses>`, the :guilabel:`Annex "
"Establishment Code` field must be filled. This code acts as a unique ID for "
"each warehouse and should only be a numeric combination, containing between "
"4 to 7 digits."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Omborni sozlashda <../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses>` :guilabel:`Annex "
"Establishment Code` maydoni to'ldirilishi kerak. Ushbu kod har bir ombor "
"uchun noyob identifikator vazifasini bajaradi va faqat 4 dan 7 tagacha "
"raqamdan iborat raqamli kombinatsiya bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1070
msgid "Inventory transfers"
msgstr "Inventar ko'chirishlari"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1072
msgid ""
"Transferring inventory is a key process captured in the |PLE| 12.1 and |PLE| "
"13.1 reports. :doc:`Inventory transfers <../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/daily_operations>` include both incoming and outgoing "
"shipments."
msgstr ""
"Inventarni ko'chirish |PLE| 12.1 va |PLE| 13.1 hisobotlarida qayd etiladigan "
"asosiy jarayondir. :doc:`Inventar ko'chirishlari <../../inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations>` kiruvchi va chiquvchi "
"jo'natmalarning ikkalasini ham o'z ichiga oladi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1076
msgid ""
"When validating an inventory transfer (either on a warehouse receipt or "
"delivery order), select the :guilabel:`Type of Operation (PE)` performed "
"according to |SUNAT|'s table 12 for permanent inventory reporting."
msgstr ""
"Inventar ko'chirishni tasdiqlashda (ombor qabul hujjati yoki yetkazib berish "
"buyurtmasida) doimiy inventar hisoboti uchun |SUNAT| ning 12-jadvaliga "
"muvofiq bajarilgan :guilabel:`Type of Operation (PE)` ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1081
msgid "Generate a .txt file for permanent inventory Kardex reports"
msgstr "Doimiy inventar Kardex hisobotlari uchun .txt fayl yaratish"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1083
msgid ""
"|PLE| 12.1 and 13.1 come as two separate books. The books need to be "
"downloaded in `.txt` file format from Odoo, and then they should be "
"submitted to the |SUNAT| |PLE| software."
msgstr ""
"|PLE| 12.1 va 13.1 ikkita alohida kitob sifatida keladi. Kitoblarni Odoo dan "
"`.txt` fayl formatida yuklab olish kerak, so'ngra ular |SUNAT| |PLE| "
"dasturiga topshirilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1086
msgid ""
"On the :ref:`Inventory Valuation Report <inventory/product_management/"
"valuation-report>`, click the :guilabel:`PLE Reports` button. Then, select "
"the :guilabel:`Period` and choose a report to export: either "
"the :guilabel:`PLE 12.1` or :guilabel:`PLE 13.1`. Odoo generates a `.txt` "
"file for the chosen report."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Inventar baholash hisobotida <inventory/product_management/valuation-"
"report>` :guilabel:`PLE Reports` tugmasini bosing. "
"So'ngra :guilabel:`Period` ni tanlang va eksport qilish uchun hisobotni "
"tanlang: :guilabel:`PLE 12.1` yoki :guilabel:`PLE 13.1`. Odoo tanlangan "
"hisobot uchun `.txt` fayl yaratadi."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:None
msgid "Export Buttons selection"
msgstr "Eksport tugmalarini tanlash"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1095
msgid ""
"Only a download of the report in `.txt` format is available. There is no "
"preview or visualization available within Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Hisobotni faqat `.txt` formatida yuklab olish mumkin. Odoo ichida oldindan "
"ko'rish yoki vizualizatsiya mavjud emas."

