":guilabel:`Philippines - Accounting` (`l10n_ph`) va :guilabel:`Philippines - "
"Accounting Reports` (`l10n_ph_reports`) modullarini o'rnatish :ref:`soliq "
"hisobotlarini <localizations/philippines/tax-reporting>` yaratish uchun "
"standart :doc:`soliqlarni <../accounting/taxes>` avtomatik ravishda "
