msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tax Invoices` uchun: :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration "
"--> Settings` yo'lidan o'ting, :guilabel:`Customer Invoices` bo'limida."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:242
